<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr unfoldingWord Literal Text Thu Jul 25 2019 09:33:56 GMT-0400 (EDT) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Genesis</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kendeu Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kendeu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ken.</para>
  <para style="mt">Genesis</para>
  <para style="mt">Kendeu Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Kendeu laisiukwak aide ma kekieege ndeu kegai hadung-tingkideu kendeu, mipei nah mipui kendeu, mina kemau ketei ndeu, Tinggwang sampetdung nah kelikelu mariemdung kendeu, nah Abraham penai Tinggwang kakga yimting eh ngngwa kelung ndeu kelu. Kendeu laisiukwak ga yiki kecu Tinggwang gu minadung nah penui teilung ziemne riem kelu ha ranglia bam. Mina aidung de si: Adam penai Eve, Noah, Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, nah Joseph nah pe sinamedung.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pentateuch lie qukela sam cide pekie laisiukwak mengei, gade Kendeu laisiukwak raitube, nah cide Bible ga laisiukwak raitube mengeidung de da. Laisiukwak aidungde de hezai laisiukwakdung lie qula, kedanemene cidungde ga Israelme ziemne Tinggwang keledeu samdung nah hezaidung kebamne. Kendeu laisiukwak kaipwa kebam pekie cai cide dainzwa Israel yimting eh Tinggwang gu mina tei lubi kecu rasam ranglia kebamne. Laisiukwak mengei aidungde Moses ne rau kegai nzwa, Hezaidung perwak kamtude Moses tsit ha rang kebamde gwale.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Tingkideu, kideu, nah mina (1:1-2:25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mina kaukedi nah kemau caineu (3:1-5:32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Noah rasam (6:1-9:29)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mina leuh zangra kepet (10:1-11:32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Abraham teilung (12:1-25:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Isaac nah pe kelak (25:19-26:35)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jacob pe namedung (27:1-37:1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Joseph teilung (37:2-50:26)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kendeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Kendeu dau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kendeu dau: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">magede tei kemak dwa</char></note>, Tinggwang tinggimdung nah kideu damgai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 1:10, 11:3 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Dui kecok de reu kemui ne puibam. Nah kideube pe rehi gah nah mtamrwa. Tinggwang Rabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang Rabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang kengkieng </char></note> duidung reu ga nlai eh bam. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Peu kebaa petlu,” nah kebaa de petlu. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Tinggwang kebaa ngaulu, nah cide pesuilu. Pa kemui gade kebaa de keutsamdi. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Tinggwang kebaa zi mtakpwa “tingba” qulu nah pa kemui de de “tingmui” qulu. Tinghegi canggwangdi nah tingcang gwanglu, cide raitu benai.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Peu duidung kakga tingkam ge bam lu, nah peu cide de duidung de duidung gade nzi ntsam dilu.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Tinggwang tingkam teilu, nah duidung tingkam kangle kebam de gade duidung tingkam reule kebam de keutsamdi. Cide cinzwa lu. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Tinggwang tingkam dede “ting” qulu. Tinghegi cang gwangdi nah tingcang gwanglu, cide lang pekenabe.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Cipaucai Tinggwang rangdi, “Ting kangga duidung kebam de de peu heni ge ga gwang ngkwa dilu, nah peu kecang deu petlu.” Cide cinzwa lu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pet. 3:5 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Tinggwang kecang deu dede “kideu” lie qulu, nah pa duidung gwang ngkwa kelu de de “jaaididung” lie qulu. Pa cide ngau pwa pe suilu <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Peu kideube de cehei kendiak lung pet lulo: mabangdung petsi peleu builu kelabe nah matsi bangdung petsi builu kelabe, peleu petsi ga kebambe, ket ket kecu pa kenzwabe riep gade.” Cide cinzwa lu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 15:38 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Nah kideube cehei kendiak lung pet lu, mabangdung pa kenzwabe peleu petsi builu kelabe, nah tsingbangdung pa kenzwabe petsi builukela, peleu petsi ga kebambe. Tinggwang cide ngau pesuilu. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Tinghegi canggwangdi nah tingcang gwanglu, cide lang pekecumbe.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Peu ting gade kebaadung pet eh kemui gade kebaa keutsam dilu, nah peu kebaadung de de tingbaziedung, tingkumdung, nah renet ngyidung bangdwa daidau bi kecu keulialu. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Peu penuide ting ga kebaadung lulo, iciu eh kideu reu peu baalu kerane.” Cide cinzwa lu. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Tinggwang kebaadung diki kecu kena teilu, tingba dau baa kera tingnaimiak nah tingmui dau baa kera hekei. Pa hekei hegidung de teilu. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Tinggwang kebaa kena de pwa ting gage kailu iciu eh peu kideu reu baalu kerane, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />peu tingba reu nah tingmui reu di kera, nah kemui gade peu kebaa de keutsam di kera. Tinggwang cide ngau pesuilu. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Tinghegi canggwangdi nah tingcang gwanglu, cide lang pemdaibe.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Peu ring kela makaunedung ketsamtsam kekiee de le duidung puilu, nah peu nruinedung de kideu reu ting tingkam ga lim lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Tinggwang jaaidi kaune disüt cudung, nah ringkela kaune ketsamtsam ci kenzwa bedung, makaunedung mlai kelabe nah duidung leune ga kepui teikebamdung, nah nruine pe hesiu kepung ketsamtsam leune ci kenzwabe damgai. Tinggwang cide ngau pe suilu. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Tinggwang penui de samlam beu, eh ranggai, “Hing nah kieepetlu, nah jaaididung ga duidung puilu. Peu nruinedung kideu ga kieepetlu.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Tinghegi canggwangdi nah tingcang gwanglu, cide lang pemengeibe.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Pecai Tinggwang rangdi, “Peu kideube de ring kela makaune ketsamtsam hingpet lu, ket ket kecu pa kenzwabe riep gade, kauruine, bwakela kaudung, nah kideu ga renaam kaunedung ket ket kecu pa kenzwabe riep gade.” Cide cinzwa lu. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Tinggwang kideu ga renaam kaunedung ci kenzwabedung, kauruine, nah hangdeu reu ga bwakela kau leune penui kenzwadung teilu. Pa cide ngau pesuilu. <verse eid="GEN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Anui mina anui nzwa, nah anui rehi nzwa tei cugo. Peu penuide jaaidi ga heka, ting ga nruinedung, kideu pelane ga kauruine, nah makaune bwa kela pelane reu peu kengkieng teu zie.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung kesa ga</char><char style="fqa">kauruine reu, kideu ga makaune pelane reu, nah kideu ga makaune bwa kela leune reu, de kecu bam</char> </note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:9">Jas. 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Tinggwang mina de Pe rehi nzwa damgai. Pa pe rehi nzwa pecu damgai. Pa penaide mipei nah mipui damgai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat: 19:4, Mark: 10:6, Acts 17:29, 1 Cor. 11:7, Col: 3:10, 1 Tim: 2:13 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Pecai Tinggwang penaide samlam beu nah penai dage ranggai, “Hena kekiee lungh lu, nah lungh hinglu. Kideube ga puilu, nah cide gumlu. Jaaidi ga hekadung reu, ting ga nruinedung reu, nah kideu reu ga mlai kela kauring pelane reu kengkieng bamlu.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Pecai Tinggwang rangdi, “Pielo, Ih nnaide mabang petsi leu petlu kela leune, nah tsingbang petsi leu petlu kela leune kideu peu reu pelane ga kebam peu dida. Cidungde nnai ziemne ketyeipok zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:2">Rom. 14:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Kideu ga renaam kaune pelane, nruine tinggimdung ga kebam leune, nah kideu ga bwakela leune, nah kering cuingi kebam kau leune de Ih cehei kendiak bang leune taktyei tei kera peu dida.” Cide cinzwa lu. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Tinggwang pa tei kelu leune de ngaulu. Ainie, cide yi sütdi. Cidau tinghegi canggwangdi nah tingcang gwanglu, cide lang peherokbe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:4">1 Tim. 4:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ciciu eh tinggimdung nah kideu tei canglu, nah cidung de teipui kebam kering kaune leune. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Lang henane benai Tinggwang pa tei kebam gade pe ta teicanglu nah pa lang henane benai pe ta leune gade mtaklu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Heb. 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Tinggwang lang henane benai de samlam gai nah tei mcilu, kedanemene cipau nai gade pa damgai kelu pe bata leune gade mtak kelune.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adam penai Eve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Aidung de tinggimdung nah kideu dam gwang kelu ha, cipau nai RAMPAUBE Tinggwang tinggimdung nah kideube tei kelu dau cidung de damgai lu. <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Kideu ga luh rebang gede lungh cu mereu, nah luh mabangdung gede pwakcu mereu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE Tinggwang kideu reu ga peu tingrui gai mereu kecune, nah mina mige de hangdeube ga heta tei kera gah reu kecune. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Dede dui ge kideu kang gade hang eh hangdeu reu pelane hetau hwalu. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang hangdeu gade ndei keulu delwe cide teu mina gede teilu, nah pe ngkieki gage keringcui ngngi gai beu ge minabe ringcuhdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor: 15:45 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang naimiak kepetle Eden gage hegurie ge linglu, delwe pa teikelu minabe de pa cika ge kailu. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang hangdeu gade tsingbang hezukeyi nah ketyeipok ziemne keyi leune peu lungh petlu kera teigai. Aide hegurie sum ga kebam tsailihei bang, nah keyi kesia maci peu kela bang de de si.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rev: 2:7, 22:14 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kereuki ge Eden gade lwa pet eh hegurie dui ketau beu. Cika de cide mzipwa kereuki mdai teilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:2">Keu. 22:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Kereuki keraibe zi cai Pishon. Cide Havilah deu pelane ga lwa twagwa kebam de da, kecak kebam dega. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Cipau deu de gu kecak au yi. Cika bdellium nah onyx tangtsu de bamla. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Kereuki kenabe zi cai Gihon. Aide Cush deu pelane ga lwa twagwa bamla. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Kereuki kecumbe zi cai Tigris, cide Ashur naimiak kepetle lwa bamla. Kereuki mdaide cai Euphrate. <verse eid="GEN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang minabe de cide tatyei nah kwa kera Eden gurie gage pecu kailu. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang mina be dage aja kai eh ranggai, “Nang hegurie be gade tsingbang keheibe tsi de tyei lubui. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Dede keyi kesia maci peu kela bang de gade nang tyei so, kedanemene nang cide gade tyei kelu benai gade, nang tsai bi zie.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Tinggwang rangdi, “Minabe pekatei lungh kebam yi mada. Ih pecu ngha kera pe kangngwa ge teibeu zie.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor: 11:9 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang tangdei le hangdeu ga makaune pelane nah ting ga nruine pelane teigai. Delwe pa cidung de minabe da ngngwa gwang beu pa cidung de de hezi dai msiak ziebi pie eh. Keheibe de minabe kering kaune ket ket kecu zi msiak gai kebeube, cide pe zilu. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Minabe kauruine pelane, ting ga nruinedung pelane, nah hangdeu ga makaune pelane zidung msiaklu. Dede minabe de ziemne pecu ngha kera ket de kangngwa petau be ngau luma. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang minabe de peu zip zingdi kera teigai, cine minabe zipdi. RAMPAUBE Tinggwang minabe hetura ket keulu delwe pa hetura keu kedi pumteih de pe jam kaudi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor: 11:8 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang minabe hetura keu kelu de le, Pa mipui gede teilu delwe minabe da pecu ngngwa gwang beu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:13">1 Tim. 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Minabe rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Henai pia, aide au pera a radung gade keu lu, nah pe chi a chi gade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Pecu ‘mipui’ de qu zie, kedanemene pecu au minabe dade keu mpet kelune.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ciziemne mipei ge pepui pepei de gidi eh pa pe nau de ngngwa ket tei dizie,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat: 19:5, Mark: 10:7-8, Eph: 5:31 </char></note> nah penai ngngwa pumteih ket dizie. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Penai hang nana paula bam, minabe nah pe naube, dede ngngamdi ma.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Mina kaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Cu heneibe RAMPAUBE Tinggwang hangdeu ga makaune tei kegaidung kak de mriak tube. Pa mipui de dade rangdi, “Tinggwang rang kesang deni: ‘Ncu hegurie ga tsingbang keheibe tsi de tyei helo’?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mipuibe henei dade rangdi, “Anai hegurie ga tsingbangdung tsi de tyei lubui, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />dede hegurie sum ga kebam tsingbang tsi de ziemne, Tinggwang rangdi, ‘Nnai cide tyei so, mede nnai cide tung de so, mecai nnai tsai zie.’” <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Henei mipui da rangdi, “Nang tsaidi lak. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Kedanemene Tinggwang ci bam nnai cide tyei kelu benai gade nnai miak nraklu zie, nah nnai Tinggwang nzwa dizie, keyi kesia ci eh.” <verse eid="GEN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Mipuibe tsingbang cide ketyeipok ziemne yi kecu, nah cide ngau hezu keyi, nah tsingbang cide mide maci peu kela ngau luge, pa matsi kesa keulu delwe cide tyeilu. Pecai pa pe nahpei pecu ngngwa kebam de de kesa peu gai, nah pa cide tyeilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:14">1 Tim. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Penai hangna na miak nrak lu, nah penai paula kebam penai cilu. Penai nzüt neidung herui ncütlu delwe penai katei ziemne cum kerabedung teilu. <verse eid="GEN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang tinghegi kengkung tingdau ge hegurie ga tetkela kwa penai siulu, cine minabe nah pe nau RAMPAUBE Tinggwang dwa gade hegurie tsingbangdung kakga penai mbaidi.<verse eid="GEN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang minabe de qugai eh pe dade rangdi, “Nang daiga lano?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Minabe rangdi, “Ih hegurie ga n kwa siulu, nah Ih au ngngi di, kedanemene Ih paula kebam ne. Cine Ih mbaidi.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Caune nang paula kebam ncu ranglia no? Ih ncu tyei helo rang kebeu tsingbang de gade nang tyei di dini?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Minabe rangdi, “Nang acu ngngwala kera kepeu mipui de ne, tsingbang de gade matsi pa acu peu, nah Ih cide tyei dida.” <verse eid="GEN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang mipuibe de keteu eh, “Nang daitei aiciu dino?” Mipuibe rangdi, “Henei ne acu cwa di eh Ih cide tyei dida.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang henei dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Nang aide tei kedi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nang aide tei kedi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kedanemene nang aipau minadung de cwa kedine</char></note> ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">kauruine pelane kak de nang rünne reset pung zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">nah hangdeu ga renaam kaune pelane kak de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">N za le lia eh nang tet zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">nah n teilung pelane nang tangdei tyei zie.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Ih peu mipui nnai kakga kengaurau bam zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">nah pe name nah n name kakga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Pa ne n peu tei pang zie, nah nang pe pideu nsau zie”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Pa mipui dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">“Nang hena mna kecu dau Ih n rei tei ngkiee beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">ciu eh nang keherei eh hena mna luzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">Nang n nahpei de hengim lazie, dede pa n reu di zie.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Pa Adam dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">“Kedanemene nang n nau kwa kingnei kedine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">nah Ih ncu tyei helo de rang kebeu tsingbang gade tyei dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">de ranggai, ‘cide gade nang tyei so,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">n ta aide ziemne hangdeu be reset pung dizie da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">N teilung pelane gade nang keherei eh n pok peei tyei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Heb. 6:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Nah hangdeube n ziemne ceheidung nah hetudung lungh pet beu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">nah nang renaamkang ga mabangdung tyei zie.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />N zu nlup duile nang npuk peei tyei zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">ncu tei kelu hangdeu be ga nang cailigwang dai kemaktane, kedanemene ncu cika de tei kelune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">Kedanemene tangdeile ncu teilu, nah nang tangdei mmi dai dizie.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Minabe pe nau zi Eve msiak lu, kedanemene pa mina pelane pui kecu ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang Adam penai pe nau de makaune geu pwa paiheni teilwe penai de cum beu.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang rangdi, “Minabe cu au anui hangge nzwa dida, keyi kesia maci bam dida. Cine cu pecu peu pe ba ketwa pet eh, ring kela tsingbang gade keu eh, cide tyei lakta, nah kelungta ring lakta.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE Tinggwang pecu Eden gurie gade gwa mpetdi, pecu peu ndei pecu tei kelube hangdeu gade tatyei kerane. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Cine Tinggwang minabe de hegurie gade gwadi, nah pa Eden gurie naimiak kepetle gage cherubim de kailu, nah kiengtie mzaipei kecu pelane lam nreu gwanglu kebam ge kaizeu di, cinzwa eh kering cailihei bang kwalu kerane.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Cain penai Abel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Minabe pe nau Eve de ngngwa nau hepei zai teidi nah pa tetlaklu delwe Cain de mna lu. Pa rangdi, “Ih RAMPAUBE ngha gade mipeina ge de lung luda.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Pecai Eve Abel sinabe de mna lu. Abel meurün kekwame ge teidi, dede Cain au heta ketame ge. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Cinzwadi eh matie mene Cain pe luhlüt mei kesa pung gwang RAMPAUBE de reca teibeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:11">Jud. 1:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Nah Abel cai, pe meurün ga de mciu kelu raitube nah pelui keyibe kesa pa teu gwang. RAMPAUBE Abel nah pe ratak de luulu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Heb. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Dede pa Cain gu reca luulu tadi. Cine Cain pe rata sütti, nah pezu mneudi. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />RAMPAUBE Cain dage rangdi, “Daitei nang n rata au no nah daitei nang n zu mneu bam no? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Nang petau be tei la cai, ncu luu mene ta zie ni? Dede nang magade petaube tei mecai, kemau n kimui ga kwabam nah n reu di neu zeu, dede nang cide swa ngkieng lu maisia.” <verse eid="GEN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Langnai ge Cain pe sinabe Abel de mpau. Nah cidau penai luhdung ga kela dau, Cain pe sinabe Abel de pe ratadi eh pecu teitsetdi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung yitube ga aide bam. Ciuliede, kesa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">Cain pe sinabe Abel dage rangdi, “Co anai luhdung ga mie go lie.” Nah cidau penai luhdung ga kela dau, Cain pe sinabe Abel de pe ratadi eh pecu teitsetdi.</char> </note><verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ciciu eh RAMPAUBE Cain de keteu, “Daiga n sinabe Abel la no?” Pa rangdi, “Ih ci ma Ih a sinabe de kekwabe ni?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Nang daitei di dino? N sinabe jai hangdeu gade a dage mra gai bam dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Heb. 12:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Cu nang reset pung dida hangdeu gade, cide n ba gade n sinabe jai luulu kerane pe mui ngnga luda. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Nang hangdeu ga heta tei kegai dau, cu gade n ziemne magede lungcu beulak. Nang kideu ga n ki gah eh rwapwa kelame gedi zie da.” <verse eid="GEN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Cain RAMPAUBE dage rangdi, “A ziemne saja au Ih pung kebui swade hung dida. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Kesang, nang aipau hangdeu gade henai acu gwagi di zeu, nah Ih n zu gade acu kebai di zieda. Ih kideu ga a ki gah eh rwapwa kelame ge dizie da, nah acu kengaume keheibe de acu teitset dizie da.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />RAMPAUBE pe dage rangdi, “Keheibe de Cain de teitset cai, cipau de de pia hena kiee ge hekum peei zie.” Pecai RAMPAUBE Cain reu ga ge hegiak ge kaidi, ciciu de mi keheibe de pecu ngaulu lie de, cipau de pecu gwaketang melu kerane.<verse eid="GEN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Cine Cain au RAMPAUBE kebam gade tetdi delwe Nod deu ga lunghdi, cide naimiak kepetle Eden ga. <verse eid="GEN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Cain pe nau de cilu nah pa tetlak lu. Pa Enoch de mnalu. Pecai pa namdi ge teilu nah cide pe napei Enoch zi teu qulu. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoch pena Irad lung lu. Mehujael au Irad pei. Irad au Mehujael pei. Methushael au Lamech pei. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lamech pe nau nauna teilu. Nau ge zi Adah, nah keda nau zi Zillah. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Adah Jabal de mnalu. Pa hekaune gui kelame nah paiki ga lung kelame pau teilu. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Pe sinabe pei zi Jubal. Pa lei keteime nah leibung nah nrina kwa kelame pelane pau. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Zillah ne, pa Tubal-Cain de mnalu, cipau de hetageu nah hegeu teu maleune teila Tubal-Cain sinabe pui zi cai Naamah. <verse eid="GEN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lamech penau kena da rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Adah nah Zillah, a kwa kingnei lulo, nnai Lamech nau kena, Ih kerang de kingnei lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Kedanemene acu tei rejam kedine Ih mina ge de teitset dida, rehangme ge de acu tei rejam kedine.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Cain kum pia hena peei cai, ciucai Lamech kum au pia riakhena-hena peei zie.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adam pe nau de ngngwa nau hepei zai tei dailu, nah pa mipeina kedage mna lu. Pa pe zi Seth qulu, “RAMPAUBE acu Abel keleu gade mipeina kedage ha da, kedanemene Cain ne pecu teitset kedine.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:3">Ken. 5:3</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 5:4">4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seth pe na mipeina ge lungh lu nah pa pe zi Enosh qulu. Nah cipau tingdau minadung RAMPAUBE zi qu cudi.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Adam gade Noah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Aide Adam leuhme zidung raukelu. Tinggwang mina de tei kecu benai, pa penai de pa nzwa eh teilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 1:1, 1 Kor. 11:7</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Pa penai de mipei nah mipui teigai. Pa penaide tei luge penaide samlam beu nah penai zi mina msiak beu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 19:4, Mar 10:6</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adam mmi 130 lunghlu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 19:4, Mar 10:6</char></note> ge, pa kenzwa mipeina ge pe na lunghlu, pe rehi nzwa eh, nah pa pe zi Seth msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Adam Seth pei kedicaine, pa mmi haiheset lungh lu. Pa pena mipeinadung nah mipuinadung kekiee ge pei teilu. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adam mmi 930 lungh lu delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seth mmi 105 lungh luge, pa au Enosh pei. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Pa Enosh lungh kelu caine, pa mmi 807 lungh silu delwe mipeinadung nah mipuinadung kekiee lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seth 912 lunghlu, delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enosh mmi riakhekui lunghlu ge, pa pena Kenan lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Pa Kenan pei kedi caine, Enosh mmi 815 lunghlu. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lungh silu. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enosh mmi 905 lunghlu delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenan mmi 70 dige, pa pena Mahalalel de lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Pa pena Mahalalel lungh kelu caine, Kenan mmi 840 lunghlu. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lungh silu. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenan mmi 910 lunghlu, delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalalel mmi 65 lunghlu, nah pa pena Jared lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Pa pena Jared lungh kelu caine, Mahalalel mmi 830 lunghlu. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lungh silu. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalalel mmi 895 lunghlu, delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Jared mmi 162 lunghlu ge, pa pe na Enoch lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Pa pena Enoch lungh kelu caine, Jared pa mmi 800 lunghlu. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Jared mmi 962 lunghlu, delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoch mmi 65 lunghlu ge, pa pe na Methuselah lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Pecai Enoch mmi haicum Tinggwang de ngngwa hekang eh lung pa pena Methuselah lungh kelu caine. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enoch mmi 365 lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Enoch Tinggwang de ngngwa hekang eh lung, ciciu eh pecu ngau tadi, Tinggwang pecu ngngwa teu kedine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Heb. 11:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Methuselah mmi 187 lunghlu ge, pa pena Lamech lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Pa pena Lamech lungh kelu caine, Methuselah mmi 782 lunghlu. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Methuselah mmi 969 lunghlu. Delwe pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lamech mmi 182 lunghlu ge, pa pe na mipeina ge lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Pa pezi Noah msiaklu, nah ranggai, “Hena aide ne anui da kerelui teugwang beu zie da nah anui bata kehung aika de, kedanemene RAMPAUBE reset kegai anui hangdeu gade tei maikesia ne.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Lamech mmi 595 lunghlu pa pena Noah lungh kelu caine. Pa pe napeidung nah pe napuidung kekiee lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lamech mmi 777 lunghlu. Ciu eh pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Noah mmi 500 lunghlu. Pa pena Shem, Ham nah Japheth lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Duinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Cinzwadi eh minadung kideu ga lungh hing petlu ge nah penui da releimedung lungh luge, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Tinggwang namedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggim rabedung</char></note> mina napuidung hezukeyi ngaulu. Penui penui katei penui suibe keheibe de penui nau teilu. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />RAMPAUBE rangdi, “A rabe mina da kelungta la si lakta, kedanemene penui au tsaidi kerame lu. Penui mmi 120 lungh zie.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Cidau ting nah pecai de kengkiengme, kideu ga lungh. Aide Tinggwang napeimedung nah mina napuimedung ngngwa lung kecu gade penui hename lunghlu. Nah aidung de mina ndaa kengkieng nah mina kemlangme.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />RAMPAUBE kideu ga minadung daikenzwage nlien bi kecu nah daikenzwa gede penui lungcet leune au kesia kemau rünne jüja labi kecu ngaulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 53:2">Lei. 53:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />RAMPAUBE nnungta di, pa minadung de kideu gage tei gai kedine, nah pa pe lung siadi. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Cine RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Ih mina damkegai de tei nggah dizie kideu reu gade; minadung de de nah makaune kedidung de nah bwa kela kaunedung nah tinggimdung nah nruinedung de, kedanemene Ih penuide tei kegai mnung tadi delu.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Dede Noah RAMPAUBE miak ngau gade pe suiyi teilu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Aidungde Noah rasamdung. Noah mina makesang mege, nah pa minadung kak gade peting dau kemau tei ma. Noah Tinggwang de ngngwa hekang eh lungh. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Noah pena mipeinadung hangcum lungh lu: Shem, Ham, nah Japheth. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Kideube Tinggwang dwa gade siadi, nah zaisiet le puidi. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Tinggwang kideube de ngaulu; ainie, cide sia dida, kideu ga minadung pelane kesia lampui ga penui la dida.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Tinggwang Noah dage rangdi, “Ih mina pelane de peu peting penlih di kera ngau dida, kedanemene kideube zaisiet le penui da puipung bam kedine. Kesang, Ih penuide tei nggah di zie kideube de si eh. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Nziemne cypress tsing keyi pwa liem ge tei lu. Liem ga kibungdung tei lu, nah cide hegwale de helungle de tsingcam le cum lu. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Aide nzwa eh nang cide tei zie: Liem pe tie cubit hai cum; pedi cubit riakngei, nah pehu cubit camrei. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Liem be ziemne kipai ge teilu, nah hebaki penai pe mbie kakga heni cubit ge kainzeulu. Liem mbie gage kikam ge teilu nah cide set cum teilu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Kingnei lu, Ih kideu reu gage duinai langgai lai zeu, tinggim kang ga kebam pe ngyi ketei ring kela leune de ngkap di kerane. Kideu ga kebam mapelane tsai dizie. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Dede Ih ncu ngngwa samkak ge tei zie. Nang liem ga nlüt zie, nang, nah n napeidung, nah n nau, nah n napeime naudung ncu ngngwa nlüt zie. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Makaune ring kela pelane, kena ketsamtsam nang liem ga teu nlüt lu maisia, penuide peu ncu ngngwa ringlu kerane, pepui nah perie si eh. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Nruinedung penui kenzwabe, nah makaune kedibedung penui kenzwabe, hangdeu ga bwa kela kaunedung penui kenzwabedung, ketsamtsam kena ncu ngngwa eh nlüt lu, penuide peu ring bam lu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Taktyei ketsamtsam hekwa lu tyei kelabe nkatei n ziemne hekwalu, ciciu eh n ziemne nah penui ziemne tatyei bam lu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Cine Noah aide teilu. Tinggwang pecu aja pelane kai kebeu nzwa, cine pa teilu.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />RAMPAUBE Noah dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, nang nah n kilungme pelane, liem ga nlüt lu, kedanemene aipau ceheu gade nang au a dwa gade masang kela Ih ngaulu delu. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Makaune kemcibe pelane gade peseudung hena nah pepuidung hena nang nda teu gwang zie. Makaune mci kemakbe gade cai, penui kak de kena teu gwanglu, peseu nah pepui. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Nruinedung ting ga kebamdung lie cai, periedung hena nah pepuidung hena teu gwanglu, peu penui nadung de kideu peu reu pelane ga lungh cuh dailu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Lang henane cai Ih tingrui langgai zie kideu reu ga nah cide tingmui tingba zie riakdai ge rui zie. Ih tei kelu hangdeu reu ga ringkela pelane de ngkapdi lu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Noah RAMPAUBE pecu rang kebeu leune de teilu.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Kideu be ga duinai kegwang dau Noah mmi hai herok di. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Noah, pe napeidung, pe nau nah pe napeime naudung, de ngngwa liem ga nlüt lu kedanemene duinai gwang kedine. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Kemcibe nah mci kemak makaunedung, nruinedung nah hangdeu reu ga bwa kela pelane, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />kena kena, peseu nah pepui, Noah da gwang eh liem ga nlüt lu, Noah de Tinggwang rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Lang hena ne cai, kideu reu ga duinai duidi gwangdi. <verse eid="GEN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Noah teilung mmi hai herok bekum, keina be kei, cipau kei zie kereiehena benai, cipau nai gapte, kideu kang gade duilet disüt kecu peciakne letba de gai, nah tinggim hebakidung ngkeidi. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Iciu eh tingmui tingba zie riakdai ge kideu ga tingrui mie ndeudi.<verse eid="GEN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Cipau nai Noah nah pe napeidung, Shem, Ham nah Japheth, nah Noah nau, nah pe na hangcum naudung, de ngngwa liem ga nlütlu. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Penui de si eh renaam kaune cikenzwa bedung nah kauruine cikenzwa bedung nah kideu reu ga bwa kela kaunedung ket ket cikenzwa bedung, nah nruine keheibe de cikenzwa bedung, pe hesiu pung kela ruinedung. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Pe cui ngyi ketei ring kela leune kena na Noah da gwanglu delwe liem ga nlüt lu. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Makaune nlüt kelu peseu nah pepui gege pelane; Tinggwang pecu rang kebeu nzwa penui nlüt lu. Ciu eh RAMPAUBE penui nlüt kedi cai kikambe ngkuidi. <verse eid="GEN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Ciu eh kideu be ga zie riakdai ge duinai gwangdi, nah dui be kieesi reureu di nah liem be kideu reu nliem cuhdi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Nah duidung ne kideu reu pelane gumpwadi, nah liem be dui reu ga nlim ladi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Kideu be reu ga dui be cuh sütdi nah ting kangga pelane iciu eh lamlwatu kehudung pelane de gum pwadi. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Nah dui be cuh reureu eh lamlwatudung hutu reuga cubits kereimengei hangdi. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Kideu reu ga ring mlai kela leune tsaidi, nruinedung, kauruinedung, renaam kaunedung, nah makaune kideu reu ga kekiee lungh kebam ring kela pelane nah mina pelane. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Ringkela makaune pelane kideu ga lungh keladung, kering cuingi penui ngkiedung gade ngi keladung pelane, tsaidi <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Ciu eh kideu peu reu ga ring kela leune de ngkapdi, mina gade makaune ditube kecang, bwa kela kaunedung, nah ting ga kebam nruinedung. Cidung de pelane kideube gade ngkapdi. Noah nah pecu liem ga ngngwa kelame rünne banglu. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Dui be kideu reu ga zie hai eh riakngei ge bamdi.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Tinggwang Noah, renam kaunedung pelane, nah kauruine liem ga kela pelane de de nsungta dima. Tinggwang kideu reu gage tingkai gui kera tei gai, nah dui be cip miedi. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Kideu kang ga duiletdung nah tinggim ga tingrui hebakidung de ngkuidi, nah tingrui tadi. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Duinai duidung kideu be gade cam reureu di, nah zie hai eh riakngei cai au dui cam reureu miedi. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Kei henabe kei, ziangreiehena benai, liem be Ararat deutu ga gwang mtaklu. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Dui be cam reureu jüja bamdi kei kereibe kei kecang. Ciu eh kei kereibe kei lang naige benai, lamlwatu twangdung ngau petdi.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ciu eh zie riakdai cai Noah liem hebaki Pa ne tei kelude ngkei gai. <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />Pa hegak ge de lang mpet gai ge cide liem nlüt mpet bamdi kideu ga dui cipmie kemaktane. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Pecai pa tamhau gede lang mpet gai dai kideube ga dui cam mi mebi pie lu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Dede tamhau cide mtak gai kera ni ngaulu ma, nah pa pe da liem ga cailigwang dai, kedanemene dui ne kideu pelane gum pwa bam reu kecune. Pa pe ba ketwa pet, cide pe tai ga liem be ga keu nlüt lu. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Pa lang hena ne kwa dai lu delwe pa liem gade tamhau de lang mpet gai dai. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Tinghegi dige tamhau caili peda gwang dai. Pielo! Pe mui ga Olive nei kering ge bam. Cine Noah kideu be ga dui cam miekedi cilu. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Pa keda lang henane kwalu, delwe tamhau de lang mpet gai dai. Pa peda cailigwang dai tadi.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Cinzwadi eh mmi raitube nah hai herok ket bekum, kei raitube kei, lang naige benai kideu ga dui be cangdi. Noah liem cum de keudi, delwe piegai, nah ngaulu, ainie hangdeu cang dida. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Kei na bekei, zie ngkaiehena benai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">duinai kedi mmi ge eh langkereine cai</char></note> kideu be cangking di. <verse eid="GEN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Tinggwang Noah dage rangdi, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Liem gade mpet lu, nang, n nau, n napeidung, nah n na naudung de ncu ngngwa lwe. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Makaune kering pelane nda kebam de ngngwa mpetlu, nruinedung, makaunedung nah bwa kela kaune leune kideu reu ga bwa keladung, iciu eh penui kideu peureu ga kieesi lu kerane, delwe penui lunghing lu eh kideu reu lungh hamlu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Cine Noah pe napeidung, pe nau, nah pe na naudung de pecu ngngwa lwe mpetlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">2 Pet. 2:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Ring kela kaune, bwa kela leune, nah nruine, kideu ga mlai kela leune, penui kenzwadung pemaa tei eh liem gade tetdi.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Noah au RAMPAUBE dage recabam ge teilu. Pa makaunedung kemci be nah nruinedung kemci be ketsamtsam keu ciak lu, delwe pwa recabam gage keru recadung teigai. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />RAMPAUBE ru kegai perim keyi de pesuilwe pe lung gade rangdi, “Ih madaude mina ziemne hangdeu be de reset dai lakta, penui henane gade penui lungcet mau ladi lie de. Mede Ih madaude ringkela leune de ngkap dai lakta, Ih tei kedi nzwa.<verse eid="GEN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Kideu kebam tane, heleuh kelingting nah luhlüt ting, kengkung nah kelum,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">hepwak nah tingka, nah tingba nah tingmui bam mui zie.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang penai Noah samkak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Pecai Tinggwang Noah nah pe napeidung de samlam beu, nah penui dade rangdi, “Hena kekiee lunghlu, lungh hing petlu, nah kideu lungh hamlu. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Kideu ga ring kela makaune pelane, ting ga nruine pelane, hangdeu ga bwa mlai kela pelane, nah jaaidi ga hekadung pelane n mie hing eh lungh zie. Penuide n kengkieng kang gage kaibeu dida. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Mlai eh lungh kebam pelane n ziemne taktyei tei zie. Mabang kemdiakdung Ih ncu kepeu nzwa, cu Ih ma pelane ncu peu la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:29">Ken. 1:29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 1:30">30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Dede nang hetei pe kering ria kebambe tyei lak, cide cai pejai, kebam be.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:23">Hez. 12:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Dede n jai ziemne, n jai ga keringria kebam de, Ih pemi luuzie. Makaune pelane gade Ih cide luu zie. Mina keheibe ba gade, cide cai, pe sinabe de daptset kedibe de ba gade, Ih cipau pei de keringria de ziemne saja peu zie.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Keheibe de mina de daptset cai, mine pecu de daptset zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">kedanemene mina de Tinggwang rehi gade Pa mina de tei kelune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lev. 24:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Nnui ziemne au, hena kekiee lunghlu nah lungh hinglu, kideu pelane reu lungh hamlu nah cide reu lungh hinglu.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Ciu eh Tinggwang Noah de mpau nah pe napeidung peda kebamme dage ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Aziemne au, kingneilu! Ih nnuide nah nnui leuhme lungh leu gwang kerame de ngngwa samkak zeu da, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />nah nnuide ngngwa ring kela makaune pelane de, nruinedung de, kauruine de, nah kideu ga makaune pelane, nnuide ngngwa keladung de, liem gade mpet kelu pelane gade, kideu ga ring kela kaune pelane kecang. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ih aidung de teu eh nnuide ngngwa samkak la, madaude kau kengngi leune de duinai gele ngkap dai lakta. Madaude kideube de duinai ne ngkap dai lakta.”<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Aide samkakkelu marehi de Ih tei kebam anui kakga nah kaukengngi pelane nnuide ngngwa kela, nah gwang dai kera ceheudung peciakne ziemne: <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Ih agu tangningnaria hemwa gage kaigaila, nah cide kideube anai kakga samkak kelu marehi ge zie. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ih hemwa teu kideu gumlu de nah tangningnaria hemwa ga ngau kecu dau, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />ciu de Ih nsunglu zie a samkakkelu, anui kakga nah kaukengngi pelane kakga kebamde. Duidung madaude duinai mmi dai lakta mina leune de ngkap kera. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Tangningnaria hemwa ga pet zie nah Ih cide ngau zie, iciude kideu reu ga kaukengngi pelane nah Tinggwang kakga kelungta samkakkelu de nsunglu kerane.”<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Cidau Tinggwang Noah dage rangdi, “Aide samkakkelu marehi ge Ih nah kideu ga kaukengngi pelane anai kakga samting kelu lie kecu.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Noah napeidung liem gade mpet kelume cai Shem, Ham, nah Japheth. Ham cai Canaan pei da. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Aipau hangcum de Noah napeidung da, nah aidung de dade kideu pelane ga heleuh hinglu.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noah heta ketame ge teidi, nah pa kube luh talu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Langnai ge Noah zau kesa saklu eh miedi. Pa paini radi delwe pe paiki ga paula zeubam di. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Ciciu eh Ham, Canaan pei, pe pei paula kebam ngau lwe, nah pesinabe kena hegwale kebam dage rang beu. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Cine Shem nah Japheth pai teulu nah penai hekeutu gage kailu, nah caisim lüt penai pei paula kebam de haa lu. Penai zu kedale nreu lwe, iciu de penai pei paula kebam de penai ngau melu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Noah pe zau sakmie gade mcing luge, pa pe napei henatube pe dage daipai tei gai bi cilu ge. <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Cine pa rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Canaan reset punglu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Peu pecu pe sinabe kilame kila tei lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Pa rangsi eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Peu RAMPAUBE, Shem Tinggwang, de peu Samlam pung kelube tei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">nah Canaan de peu pe kila tei lulo.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Peu Tinggwang de Japheth, tingdeu tei mdi beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">nah peu pecu Shem paiki gage pe kilung tei lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Peu Canaan de pe kila tei lulo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Duinai cai, Noah mmi haicum eh riangngei lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Noah teilung pelane cai mmi hai hekui riakngei, nah pecai pa tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Heleuhdung ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Aidungde Noah name, Shem, Ham, nah Japheth leuhmedung. Duinai caine penui napeidung lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Japheth napeidung cai Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, nah Tiras. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Gomer napeidung cai Ashkenaz, Riphath, nah Togarmah. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Javan napeidung cai Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, nah Dodanim. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Aidungde gade rejaaikung ga kelungme mpet tsamdi delwe penui katei penui deu ga lunghdi, mileune de penui let rip rang eh, penui heleuhdung nah penui pautsa rehi gade.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ham napeidung cai Cush, Mizraim, Put, nah Canaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Cush napeidung cai Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah, nah Sabteka. Raamah napeidung cai Sheba nah Dedan. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Cush cai Nimrod pei, pa kideu gade ngkieng kelu raitube. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Pa au RAMPAUBE dwa gade teigwa kengkiengme ge. Cine ainzwa rangla, “Nimrod nzwa, RAMPAUBE dwa gade teigwa kengkiengme ge.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Keraidau pe hegwangram raitubedung Babel, Erech, Akkad nah Kalneh, aidung pelane Shinar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shinar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrew zi Shinar de Babylon pelane da. Ken 11.2; 14.1, 9; Jos 7.21;</char></note> deu ga bam. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Cipau deu gade pa tetpwa Assyria ga miedi nah Nineveh, Rehoboth Ir, Calah teilu, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />nah Resen, Nineveh penai Calah kakga bam. Cide au namdi disüt kecu ge.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Luditme, Anamme, Lehabme nah Naphtuhme au Mizraim pei, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Pathrusme, Kasluhme (cipaume dade Philistinme gwang), nah Caphtorme.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Canaan au pe neraibe Sidon nah Heth pei, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />nah Jebusitme, Amoritme, Girgashitme, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Hivitme, Arkitme, Sinitme, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Arvaditme, Zemaritme, nah Hamathme. Nah pecai Canaanme pautsame lungzang petlu. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Canaanme deurai Sidon gade, Gerar lambie Gaza ga kecang, nah Sodom lambie ket tetgai, Gomorrah Admah, nah Zeboyim, Lasha ga kecang. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Aidung de cai Ham napeimedung, penui pautsa rehi gade, penui let rehi gade, penui deudung ga, nah penui heleuhdung lungh keladung.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shem leuhme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shem de mipeinadung mna beu, Japheth sinabe kecingbe. Shem au Eberme mina pelane pau. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Shem napeimedung Elam, Ashur, Arphaxad, Lud nah Aram. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aram napeimedung cai Uz, Hul, Gether, nah Meshech. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arphaxad Shelah pei teilu, nah Shelah Eber pei teilu. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eber pe napei hangna bamla. Hangge zi be cai Peleg, kedanemene pe ting dau kideu be pangpop kedine. Pe sinabe zi cai Joktan. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Joktan au Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah pei. <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obal, Abimael, Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ophir, Havilah, nah Jobab. Aidung pelane Joktan napeimedung. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Penui deurai Mesha gade, kepetle lamlwatu nam Sephar ga kecang. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Aidung de Shem napeidung, penui pautsadung nah penui letdung rehi gade, penui deudung ga, penui heleuhdung rehi gade.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Aidung de Noah napeimedung pautsa, penui paupakhadung ria gade, penui heleuhdung rehi gade. Aika de heleuhdung lungh ntsam petdi nah duinai caine kideube reu lungh miedi.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Babel tsukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Cu kideu pelane ga helet ket teu nah hekwa de nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Penui naimiak kepetle mbeuh mie ge, penui Shinar deu ga langkie ge ngaulu nah penui cika lunghdi. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Penui ket ket dade rangdi, “Gwanglu, anui tangdei keniak lwe ru tak lugo.” Penui tangtsu nding tangdei le rutak kelu kang keu nah mortar nding kehania keu. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Penui cu, “Gwang lu! Anui anui ziemne namdi ge nah tsukwa petün ting tung cang kecu ge tei cu go, nah anui katei anui zi teigo. Anui ciciulu mecai, anuide kideu reu pelane ga tei zangradi zielu.” <verse eid="GEN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Cine RAMPAUBE namdi de nah tsukwa de Adam leuhme ne ketei de pie zie lie hung. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Pielo! Penui au mina leuh ge helet de nzwa nah penui tei kera cu au pebang dwa cuh au da! Tie mene penui tei keneube magede teigai kelak gah di zieda. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Gwang lu, anui hung delwe cika penui let tei kebwakdi go, iciu eh penuide peu kekwaci tadi lu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Cine RAMPAUBE penui de kideu reu pelane gage teizangdi, nah penui namdi de kwa si ta di. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ciziemne, cide de pezi Babel lie qulu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE cikade kideu pelane let kebwak kedine nah cikade RAMPAUBE penui de kideu pelane peu reu gage teizang gai kedine.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shem gade Abram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Aidung de Shem leuhmedung. Duinai cai mmi kena dau, Shem mmi hai di ge, pe na Arphaxad lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Arphaxad lungh kelu cai, Shem mmi hai mengei ge lunghlu. Nah pe na keda mipeinadung nah mipuinadung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arphaxad mmi camrei mengei lunghlu ge, pa pe na Shelah lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Arphaxad pa pe na Shelah lungh kelu cai ne mmi 403 lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shelah mmi camrei lungh lu ge, pa pe na Eber lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Shelah pa pe na Eber lungh kelu cai ne, mmi 403 lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eber mmi camrei-mdai lunghlu ge, pa pe na Peleg lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eber pa pe na Peleg lungh kelu cai ne mmi 430 lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Peleg mmi camrei ge lungh luge, pa pe na Reu lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Peleg pa pe na Reu lungh kelu cai ne mmi 209 lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Reu mmi camrei-kena lunghlu ge, pa pe na Serug lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Reu pa pe na Serug lungh kelu cai ne mmi 207 lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serug mmi camrei lungh luge, pa pe na Nahor lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Serug pa pe na Nahor lungh kelu cai ne mmi haina ge lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahor mmi ngkaiehekui lunghlu ge, pa pe na Terah lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Terah pa pe na Nahor lungh kelu cai ne mmi 119 lunghlu. Pa keda pe napuidung nah pe napeidung de lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Terah mmi riakhena lungh kelu cai ne, pa pe na Abram, Nahor nah Haran lunghlu.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Cu aidung de Terah leuhme: Terah pe na Abram, Nahor nah Haran lungh lu nah Haran pe na Lot lungh lu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haran pe pei Terah ringkebam dau, pecu kemna nam, Chaldeame deu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Deu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babylonia namdi</char></note> Ur gade tsaidi. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abram nah Nahor penai nau teilu. Abram nau zi cai Sarai nah Nahor nau zi cai Milkah, pa Haran napui, pa au Milkah penai Iskah peibe da. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sarai au nagah pui ge; pa pe na gah.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Terah pe na Abram, pe capei Lot, Haran napei nah Abram nau Sarai penui de ngngwa lwe penui de nzang Canaan deudi ga mie kerane Chaldeame deu Ur de gidi. Dede penui Haran nam ga gwanglu nah cika lungh di. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Terah mmi 205 lunghlu ge pa Haran nam gade tsaidi.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Abram de kequ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Cu RAMPAUBE Abram dage rangdi, “N deudi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">N deudi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Mesopotamia ga Haran cuikui de rangbam.</char></note> gade, nah n kibaume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">N kibaume </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ncu kemna ni gade</char></note> dade nah n pei kilungme dade tet cu, Ih ncu hangdeu lia zie lie kebam deu de ga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat 7:3, Heb. 11:8</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Ih ncu heleuh kedi ge teibeu zie, nah Ih ncu samlam beu zie delwe n zi tei mdi beuzie, iciu eh nang samlam ge teilu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Ih ncu samlam kebeume de samlam beuzie, dede ncu rüt kemakme de Ih reset zie. Nda de Ih kideu ga heleuh pelane de samlam beuzie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat 3:25, Gal. 3:8</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Cine Abram tetdi, RAMPAUBE pecu teilu lo rang kebeu nzwa eh, nah Lot de pecu ngngwa tetdi. Abram Haran gade ketet dau pa mmi riakhena-mengei di. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abram pe nau, Sarai, pe siname napei, Lot, de ngngwalu, nah penui Haran gade mabam ngaukelu pelane nah kilamedung pelane de ngngwalu. Penui Canaan deu mie kera tet gaidi, nah penui Canaan deu ga gwanglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:4">Bat. 7:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abram hangdeu tetka gwang, Shechem ga kecang nah Moreh mhu. Cipau tingdau Canaanme cipau deu ga lung bam. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />RAMPAUBE Abram da gwanglu eh rangdi, “Ih n leuhme de aipau deu de pwa peu zie.” Cine Abram cika ge RAMPAUBE, peu pecu ngau kegaibe de recabam ge teibeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gal. 3:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Cika de pa hangdeutu deudi Bethel naimiak kepetle ge tet gai, nah naimiak kenlütle Bethel penai naimiak kepetle Ai kakga pe ramzeuki teilu. Cika de pa recabam ge RAMPAUBE de tei beu nah RAMPAUBE zi qugai. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Pecai Abram mbeu jüja eh Negev lebie miedi.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abram Egypt ga kegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Canaan deudi ga herakum kumdi, cine Abram Egypt ga lungh kera miedi, kedanemene cipau deu ga herakum siaham kedine. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Pa Egypt ga lütdi lai kezeu dau, pa pe nau Sarai dade rangdi, “Aika pielo nang hezukeyi pui ge kecu Ih ci, <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Egyptme ncu ngau de, penui rang zie, ‘Aide au pe nau,’ nah penui acu teitset dizie dede penui ncu peu ring zie. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Nang au a tipui lie kecu rang lulo, iciu de nziemne Ih a ziu yiluzie nah iciu eh n ziemne ateilung keli luzie.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Cipau tingdau Abram Egypt ga lütlu, Egyptme Sarai hezuyi süt kecu ngaulu. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Pharaoh gu hegwangnadung pecu ngau lwe Pharaoh dade pecu twagai nah cipau pui dede Pharaoh kiga ngngwa gwangdi. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Pe ziemne Pharaoh Abram dade pezai yi eh meurün hau, ketum, gada seudung, kilapuidung, kilapeidung, gada puidung nah utdung pwa pecu peu. <verse eid="GEN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Cidau RAMPAUBE au Pharaoh da nah pe ki gage mateei hingsüt cudung langgai, kedanemene Sarai, Abram nau ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Pharaoh Abram de qulwe pe dade rangdi, “Nang aide daipai ge a dage tei gai di de no? Nang daitei pa n nau lie kecu acu ranglia me no? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Nang daitei, ‘pa au a tipui lie,’ de eh rang no, ciu eh acu peu pecu a nau zielie ngngwa la no? Cu, ciziemne aika n nau nei. Pecu ngngwalu delwe n lampui ga miedi lu.” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Ciciu eh Pharaoh pe minadung de ajadung kaibeu, nah penui pecu gwadi, pe nau nah peda kebam pelane de si eh.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abram penai Lot kelamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Cine Abram Egypt gade hang nah pa, pe nau, nah pe ma pelane teu eh Negev gage tet gaidi. Lot de penuide ngngwa miedi. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Cu Abram au mahei süt, makaunedung de, rangkanggeu de nah kecak de. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Pa n beuh jüja eh Negev gade Bethel ga mie, ndaa pe paiki, Bethel penai Ai kakga kebam ni de ga. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Pa ndaa tei kelu recabam kebam ni de ga pa mie. Aika de pa RAMPAUBE zi qugai. <verse eid="GEN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Cu Lot, Abram de ngngwa mbeuh kelabe de, meurün haudung nah ketum haudung nah ramzeukidung de bam. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Penai hangna na nna eh lungh ncüt bam kera ziemne hangdeu be tei dau lakdi, kedanemene penai mabamdung kiee süt kedine, ciu eh penai lungh ncüt gailak di. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Iciu delwe, Abram kaudung kekwame penai Lot kaudung kekwame kak ga ngngwa siadi. Cipau ting dau Canaanme penai Perizzitme cipau deu ga lungh bam. <verse eid="GEN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Cine Abram Lot dade rangdi, “Peu anai kakga nah n kau kekwame nah a kau kekwame kakga ngngwa kesia bam helo, kedanemene, anui au kilungme ge lu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Ndwa ga hangdeu pelane bam de meni? Mie cu, delwe ada de nkatei tsam di lu. Magade nang hile bie mie cai, Ih zetle bie mie zie. Mede magade nang zetle bie mie cai Ih hile bie mie zie.” <verse eid="GEN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Cine Lot pie twagwagai eh Jordan langkam pelane ga dui yisüt kebam ngaulu, Zoar pelane ga kecang, RAMPAUBE gurie nzwa nah Egypt deu nzwa. Aide au RAMPAUBE Sodom penai Gomorrah de ngkap kemak dwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Cine Lot Jordan langkam pelane de pe ziemne kedetlu, delwe naimiak kepetle ge tet gaidi, nah penui kibaume hang gege dade kelamtsamdi. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abram Canaan deu ga lunghdi, nah Lot langkie namdidung kakga ga lunghdi. Pa Sodom taiga kecang pe ramzeukidung teilu. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Cu Sodom ga minadung au RAMPAUBE dage kemaudung siasüt kecu tei kegaime.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lot pe dade tet kedi cai, RAMPAUBE Abram dade rangdi, “Nang sap kebam ni gade tingtünle, tingbangle, naimiak kepetle nah naimiak kenlütle pie gai pielo. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Nang kengau aipau hangdeu pelane de, Ih ncu nah n leuhme de kelungta pwa peu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Bat. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Ih n leuhme de kideu ga rebui kekiee kiee ge tei beu zie, iciu eh magade mige kideu rebui de pei lu bui liecai, iciu cai n leuhme de de pei kap lubui. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Cuhlu, hangdeu pedi nah petie ga tet miecu, kedanemene cide Ih ncu peu zielu.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Cine Abram pe ramzeuki keu ncu lu, nah gwang Hebron nam ga mhudung Mamre taiga lungdi, nah cika de RAMPAUBE de recabam ge teibeu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mamre aide ga mina de rangbam, Kendeu ga nzwa 14.13, 24. Aide heni ge de rangbam 23.17, 19; 25.9;</char></note><verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abram ne Lot de kelikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Cinzwa di eh, Shinar gwangpei, Amraphel, Ellasar gwangpei, Arioch, Elam gwangpei, Kedorlaomer, nah Goiim gwangpei, Tidal penui ting dau, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />Penui Sodom gwangpei, Bera, Gomorrah gwangpei Birsha, Admah gwangpei, Shinab, Zeboyim gwangpei Shemeber, nah Bela (Zoar de de qula) gwangpei de ngngwa hereu tei. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Hegwang kekambe mengei aidung de Siddim Langkam (Mcai Jaaidi dede qu kela) gade kemaacüt lu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Penui mmi kereiekena Kedorlaomer gwa teilu, dede mmi kereiekecumbe kum ga penui keregidi. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Pecai mmi kereiemdaibe kum Kedorlaomer nah hegwangmedung pecu nzang kelame gwang eh Astheroth Karnaim ga Rephaimme, Ham ga Zuzitme, Shaveh Kiriathaim ga Emitme, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />nah Horitme de penui hangdeutu deudi Seir gade, cide hetaideu taiga kebam El Paran ga kecang gwaketangdi. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Pecai penui nreugwanglu nah En Mishpat (Kadesh lie dede qu kela) ga gwanglu, delwe Amalekitme deudi pelane de ngamlu, nah Amoritme Hazezon-Tamar nam ga lungh kebamme de de si eh.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Iciuge Sodom gwangpei, Gomorrah gwangpei, Admah gwangpei, Zeboyim gwangpei nah Bela gwangpei (Zoar de de qu kela) tet petlu delwe Siddim Langkam gade hereu tei kera mteilu <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Elam gwangpei Kedorlaomer, Goiim gwangpei Tidal, Shinar gwangpei Amraphel, Ellasar gwangpei Arioch penui de regi kera; hegwang mdaidung hegwang mengei de de keregi. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Cu Siddim Langkam au kehania hom kecukdung le puihbam, nah Sodom penai Gomorrah gwangpei pak kecu dau penui cika cakmiedi. Kedamedung cai Moab lamlwatudung gage pak gaidi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Cine hegwangmedung Sodom penai Gomorrah gu mabamdung pelane nah penui taktyeidung de keulu, delwe penui lampui ga tet gaidi. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Penui kemie dau, penui Abram sinabe napei Lot, Sodom ga lung kebambe dede, pe mabamdung pelane si eh ngngwa teu tetdi.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mige pak kelume ge gwang eh Hebrewme pei Abram dage aipau ha de paubeu. Pa Amoritme pei Mamre gu mhu bang taiga lunghbam, Pa au Eshkol penai Aner sinabe, penui pelane de Abram de ngngwa yi ciau. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Cu Abram pe kibaume de ngauraume ne tui pwa kedi siu luge, pa pe mina hereu ketei ciem keci 318, pe ki gade lungh kelume de teuswalu delwe pa penui de Dan nam ga kecang zuimie. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Tingmui gage Abram pe minadung de penuide regi kera nzilu delwe penuide gwaketanglu, delwe Hobah nam, cide Damascus tingtünle bie ga kecang penuide zuimie. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Pecai pa mabamdung pelane pung cailigwang dailu, nah pe kibaume pei Lot nah pe mabamdung de teugwang dailu, mipuidung nah mina kedadung de si eh.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abram Kedorlaomer nah hegwangme pecu nzang kela me de ngamlu eh cailigwang kelu cai, Sodom ga hegwangpei Shaveh Langkam (hegwangpei langkam dede qula) ga pecu redau kera pet. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Salem gwangpei Melchizedek, tangku nah zau teu gwanglu. Pa au Hutube Tinggwang cingkupei. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Pa pecu samlam beu eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">“Hutube Tinggwang, tinggim nah kideu teikegaibe, ne Abram de samlam kebeube tei lulo!<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Hutube Tinggwang n ba gage n ngauraume de kaigai kebeube da twa lulo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Pecai Abram mangau kelube pelane gade zi kereizige pecu peu di.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 7:1-3</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Sodom gwangpei Abram dade rangdi, “Mabamdung nkatei ziemne kelu nah minadung de acu peu lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Abram Sodom gwangpei dade rangdi, “Ih RAMPAUBE, Hutube Tinggwang, tinggim nah kideu Teikegaibe da a ba pwa cuh gaila, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />ciu eh Ih helangria nage, mede picum ria nage de, mede ngu makeheibe de keu lak, ciu de nang, ‘Ih ne Abram de tei mahei beu’ de madaude rang gailak. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ih rehangme ne tyei kelu de nah minadung acu ngngwa mie kecume mzi de rünne gwale magade lu lak. Peu Aner, Eshkol nah Mamre de penui qwa keulu.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Abram de samkakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Ma aidungde cai RAMPAUBE sam Abram da marengei ge gade gwang eh ranggai, “Ngngi so, Abram! Ih au ncu kegumbe nah n ziehi au disüt samzai ketei ziemne” <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Abram rangdi, “RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, nang daipai pwa acu peu laino, kedanemene Ih a na gah eh bamdi delu, nah a ki mabam kegumbe au Damascusme Eliezer.?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abram rangdi, “Nang acu a leuh ge de peu kemakne, pielo, a ki gade lungh kelu hange ne a mapwa teizie.” <verse eid="GEN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Cidau, ainie! RAMPAUBE sam pe da gwanglu eh ranggai, “Aipau peide n maa kegumbe lak lie; dede nkatei n pum gade gwang lai eh kebambe ne n mapwa tei zie.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Pecai pa pecu hegwale ngngwa mpetlu, delwe pe dade rangdi, “Tinggim lebie pie gailo, nah hegidung de peilo, magade nang cidung de pei lu bui cai.” Delwe pa pe dade rangdi, “N leuhme de ci kieege zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Rom. 4:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Pa RAMPAUBE de nlumlu, nah aide ziemne pa pecu masang lie eh luulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom. 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal. 3:6</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Jas. 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Pa pe dade rangdi, “Ih au RAMPAUBE, hangdeu aide ncu pwa peu eh cide gum lu kerane, Chaldeame nam Ur gade ncu ngngwa mpet kelube.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Pa rangdi, “Rampaubo RAMPAUBE, Ih dainzwa cilu lai cide Ih gumlu zielie kecu?” <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Cidau Pa pe dade rangdi, “Acu ketumlei ge mmi kecum, hemeupui ge mmi kecum, nah meurünseu ge mmi kecum cum kecu nah tamhau ge nah ruipuine ge teugwang beulo.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Pa aidungde peciakne pecu keu gwang beu, nah pa cidungde dum zina teilu, delwe pempie ket de kedabe pempie de mcwa eh kailu, dede pa nruinedung de mzi ntsam ma. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Heraruidung tsai kebam hekaunedung reu ga tyei kera hung kecu dau, Abram cidung de de gwa gidi.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Pecai tingnaimiak nlwet kezeu dau, Abram zip zing miedi, nah ainie kengngi nah hingsüt kecu kemui pe lung puidi. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Cidau RAMPAUBE Abram dage rangdi, “Ci gapte lulo, n leuhme hangdeu penui deu kemak ga sangme ge tei eh lung zie, nah hebaang tei zie nah mmi hai mdai ge ziemne keherei süt zie. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Penui heleuh gwa tei lai eh kebam leuh de de Ih penui tutiak zie, nah cipaucai penui mahei kekiee teu eh mpet zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:36">Tet. 12:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Dede nang nlung ziune eh n paume da mie zie, nah nang lungh tie süt kedi caine tsai zie. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Ceheu pemdaibe dau ne penui aika gwang dai zie, kedanemene Amoritme penui kesia penli ga hang cangdi mereulu.” <verse eid="GEN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Tingnaimiak nlütdi nah muidi ge, ainie! Mika lige nah miheu kebaa ge makaune teihdung kak ga tetkah gwang. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Cipau nai RAMPAUBE Abram de ngngwa samkak lu eh ranggai, “N leuhme de cine Ih aipau deu de pwa peu la, Egypt reuki Shihor deugumrai gade Euphrate reuki kedi de kecang, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Kenitme, Kenizzitme, Kadmonme, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Hittime, Perizzitme, Rephaitme, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Amoritme, Canaanme, Girgashme nah Jebusiteme.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hagar penai Ishmael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Cu Sarai, Abram nau, hena ge de pecu mnabeu ma, dede pa kilapui bam, Egyptme ge, pezi Hagar lie kecuge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gal. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Cine Sarai, Abram dade rangdi, “Pielo, RAMPAUBE acu peu a na lung meda. Cine mie a kilapui de ngngwa zeulu. Iciu de pe a ziemne hename ge mna beu de cilak lu.” Abram Sarai kwa kingneilu. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Cide au Abram canaan deu ga mmi kerei ge lungh kelu caine, Abram nau Sarai, Egyptme pe kilapui Hagar de pe nahpei nauseupui tei kera peu. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Cine Abram Hagar de ngngwa nau heipei zai teilu nah pa tetlakdi. Pa tetlak kedi cilu ge, pa pe mpaube pui de mapei tadi. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Pecai Sarai Abram dade rangdi, “Acu mapei ta kedi de n ziemne lie. Ih a kilapui de ncu nauseupui tei kera pwa peu nah pa tetlak kedi cilu ge, pa acu mapei ta dida. Peu RAMPAUBE de anai kakga tiak lulo caube petaubi kecu.” <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Dede Abram Sarai dade rangdi, “Aika pielo, n kilapui n kang lungh bam, nang cet lwe petau tube peda teigai lulo.” Cine Sarai Hagar dade pezai sia süt gai, nah pa pe dade pakdi.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />RAMPAUBE gwame ge hetaideu ga duireu gade pecu ngaulu, Shur lampui ga duireu kebam de gade. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Pa rangdi, “Hagar, Sarai kilapui, nang daiga de gwang lano nah nang daiga mie lai eh la no?” Ge pa rangdi, “Ih au a mpau pui Sarai dade pakla lie.” <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />RAMPAUBE gwame pe dade rangdi, “N mpau pui da cailigwang cu, delwe pe kang ga lunghlu.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Pecai RAMPAUBE gwame pe dade rangdi, “Ih n leuhme kekiee ge peu zie, iciu eh penui kieezu eh pei kap gailak di zie.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />RAMPAUBE gwabe pe dade rang si gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">“Ainie, nang au tetlakla nah mipeina ge de mnalu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">nah nang pe zi Ishmael msiak luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">kedanemene RAMPAUBE n rei siulu delu.<verse eid="GEN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Pa gada kekuube mina nzwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">pa mi keheibe de de ngaurau zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">nah mina leune pecu ngaurau zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">nah pa pe sinamedung pelane dade lung tsam zie.” <verse eid="GEN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Iciu eh Hagar RAMPAUBE pecu kempaube de aipau zi de peugai, “Nang au acu ngau kela Tinggwang,” Kedanemene pa rangdi, “Ih ngau bam reu ni, Pa acu ngau kelu caide?” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ciziemne tekwa de Beer Lahai Roi lie qudi; ainie, cide Kadesh penai Bered kakga bam.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hagar Abram napei de mnalu nah Abram pe napei, Hagar ne mna kebeube de Ishmael lie qulu. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Hagar Ishmael de mna kelu dau, Abram mmi riakheset-herok di.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Hegeukerum samkakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Abram mmi riakhekuiehekui di ge, RAMPAUBE pecu peu ngau gai nah pe dade rangdi, “Ih au Kengkieng Tinggwang. Adwa ga tet lu, nah kemzuibe teilu. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ciucai Ih anai kakga a samkak kaizeulu zie nah ncu n leuhme kieesüt kecu pwa peu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abram keu hena mie pe zu hangdeu tunglu eh, Tinggwang pecu mpau eh, ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“A ziemne au, ainie, a samkak de n da la. Nang heleuh kekiee ge pei tei zie. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />N zi Abram si lakta, dede Abraham dizie da, kedanemene Ih ncu heleuh kekiee ge pei tei kera kedetlu delu. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Ih ncu n leuhme kekiee pwa peu zie, nah Ih ncu peu heleuhmedung teizie, nah n leuh gade hegwangme lungh gwang zie. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Ih anai kakga nah n cai n leuhme dage, nah penui ceheudung leune ga bam mui kela samkak kelu a samkak de kaipwa la zie, n Tinggwang kera nah n cai n leuhmedung lungh gwang kerame Tinggwang kera. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nang lungh kebam deu de Ih ncu nah n cai n leuhme lungh gwang kerame de peu zie, Canaan deu pelane de kelungta nnui gu tei kera, nah Ih penui Tinggwang zie.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Pecai Tinggwang Abraham dade rangdi, “N ziemne au, nang ada samkakkelu de mzai bilu maisia, nang de nah n cai n leuhme lungh gwang dai kera penui ceheudung leune de. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Aide agu samkak kelu, nang mzai bilu maisia, anai kakga nah n cai n leuhme lungh gwang kera kakga: Mipeina keheibe de nnui kakga hegeurum bilu maisia. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Nang n pumteih geutün ga hegeurum lu maisia, nah aide anai kakga samkakkelu zasi de keulia la luzie. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Nnui kakga mipeina keheibe de de pa lang heset ne dide hegeurum bi lu maisia, n minadung ceheudung leune ga. Aide n kilung gade mna kelube nah sangme keheibe dade nnui leuhme kemakme gede rangkang le luilu kelube de de si zie. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />N kilung gade mna kelu keheibe de nah n rangkang le lui kelu keheibe de hegeurum bi maisia. Ciu eh a samkakkelu de n teih ga kelungta samkakkelu ge zie. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Hegeurum kemak mipeina keheibe de pe geutün de gade hegeurum kemakbe de pe mina kakgade peu keugi di zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pe mina kakgade peu keugi di zie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pa madaude agu tei si lakta </char></note> Pa acu samkak de kaizeu kemakne.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Tinggwang Abraham dage rangdi, “Dede n nau Sarai de, Sarai lie qu si tadi lu. Meliene, pe zi Sarah dizie. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Ih pecu samlam beu zie, nah Ih pe dade de ncu mipeina ge peu zie. Ih pecu samlam beuzie, nah pa heleuhdung pui tei zie. Peda de mina hegwangdung lungh cu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Pecai Abraham keumie pe zu hangdeu tung lu eh nuidi, nah pe lung gade rangdi, “Mige mmi hai kedi ge da hena ge de lungh lubui ni? Dainzwa Sarah, pa mmi riakhekui kedi caine pe na lungh lu lai no?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Abraham Tinggwang dade rangdi, “Oh Ishmael de peu n dwa ga lunghlu lie cai!” <verse eid="GEN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Tinggwang rangdi, “Lak, dede n nau Sarah ncu mipeina ge mnabeu zie, nah nang pe zi Isaac msiak maisia. Ih pe dage a samkakkelu kaipwa lazie pe cai pe leuhme de kelungta samkakkelu ge eh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:7">Gal. 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 4:8">8</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ishmael ziemne au, nang kekie de Ih siu da. Ainie, Ih pecu samlam beu dida nah pe leuhme kekiee tei beu zie nah pe leuhme kieesüt zie. Pa au hegwangna kereiekena pei zie, nah Ih pecu peu heleuh kedi ge teibeu zie. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Dede Ih Isaac de ngngwa a samkakkelu de kaizeu zie, pecu Sarah ne ngkikum aipau hi dau ncu mna beu zie.”<verse eid="GEN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Pa pe dage marang cangdi ge, Tinggwang Abraham de gidi eh tetdi. <verse eid="GEN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Pecai Abraham pe napei Ishmael de ngngwalu, nah pe kilung gade lungh kelumedung pelane de, nah pa rangkang le lui kelumedung pelane de, Abraham kilungme kakga de mipeina keheibe de, delwe cipau nai de gage penui teih geutün hegeurum kecu teilu, Tinggwang pecu rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abraham pe teih ga geutün hegeurum kelu dau pa au mmi riakhekui-hekui di. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Pe napei Ishmael mmi kereiekecum di pa pe teih ga geutün hegeurum kelu dau. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abraham nah pe napei Ishmael cipaunai gage hangna na hegeurum lu. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Pe kilung ga kebam mipei pelane pecu nzang eh hegeurum lu, kilung gade lungh kelume nah sangme ge dade rangkang le luikeludung de si eh.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Rwakemie hangcum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />RAMPAUBE Abraham de peu Mamre ga mhubangdung pi gade pecu ngaugai, pa ting lum peri dau pa paiki kimui ga ntum kebam dau. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Pa ngangcuh piegai nah, ainie, pa mi hang cum pe dwa ga sap kebam ngaulu. Pa penui de ngaulu ge, pa penui de redau kerane paiki kikam gade pakpet delwe hangdeu le keu hena mielu. <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Pa rangdi, “A Rampaubo, magade Ih n miakngau gade nsuibe teilu liecai, kehereide n kilabe ki tetkahdi helo.” <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Peu dui nage de pwa gwanglu eh nnui pi hui lo, nah tsingbang de kang ga nnui mtak lulo. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Nnui nnui kilabe da gwang kelu nzwa, peu acu taktyei kecam nage de teugwang lo, iciu eh nnui de tei nring lu kerane. Aipaucai nnui nnui lampui ga tetgai lubui. Penui keligai, “Nang kerang de nzwa teilu.” <verse eid="GEN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Pecai Abraham zette paiki ga nlwet Sarah dade rangdi, “Kelwalu, tokkui keyibe seahs kecum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seahs kecum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">20 Kilogram</char></note> keulu, cide henet lu delwe tangku rulu.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Iciu eh Abraham ketumhau da pakgwang eh ketumna kemdui nah pelui keyi nage teulu eh kilabe de cide peudi, nah pa cide lamlui kera kelwalu. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Pa tungduikang, tungdui nah ketumna mtei pwa kebam de pwa lwe, taktyei penui dwa ga kaibeu. Delwe penui ma ketyei dau pa penui taiga sap eh tsingbang kangga kwabam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Heb. 13:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Penui pedade rangdi, “N nau Sarah daiga bam no?” Pa keligai, “Cika paiki ga bam lie.” <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Penui hangge keteu, “Ih heriaktingdau gwang dai bi zie, nah pielo, n nau Sarah mipeina ge de mna luzie.” Pecai ga kebam, paiki kimuiki ga de Sarah kingnei bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rom. 9:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Cu Abraham penai Sarah au cing di, lungtiee süt nah Sarah mipui hena lung lu kebui ting be de kahdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:9">Rom. 4:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Cine Sarah pe katei pecu nuidi, pekatei pe dage rang eh, “Ih ta kedi cai ne nah a mpaube cing kedi caine, Ih cu de hena nepam kecu suiyi de ngau lubui reu ni?” <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />RAMPAUBE Abraham dade keteu, “Daitei Sarah nui eh rang no, ‘Ih cing kedi cai ne hena lungh kesang lubui reu ni?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Keheibe de RAMPAUBE ziemne tei pa ham zie ni? Ih ne riem kegai dau, heriakting dau, Ih n da cailigwang zie. Nah aipau tinghi ngkiekum Sarah mipeina ge de mnalu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Cidau Sarah mlaidi nah rangdi, “Ih nui ma,” kedanemene pa ngngi kedine. Pa samkeligai, “Ma, nang nuida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1 Pet. 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham Sodom ziemne kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Pecai mina cidung hangcum tet kerane cuhlu delwe Sodom lebie pie ngkeigai. Abraham penui de ngngwa miedi penui de penui lampui ga tet kecu pie kerane. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Dede RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Ih tei lai eh kebam de Abraham dade Ih kebaidi zieni, <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />kedanemene Abraham leuhme kedi ge nah kengkieng ge tei zielu, nah pe dade kideu ga heleuh pelane de samlambeu zielu?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 3:25, Rom. 4:13, Gal. 3:8 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Kedanemene Ih pecu kedetlu da iciu de pa pe name nah pe kilungme de ledeu pwa pe caide RAMPAUBE zai de kaizeu lu kerane, masang nah kemzeu be teilu kerane, iciude RAMPAUBE Abraham dage rang kebeu de teicang lu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Pecai RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Ih Sodom penai Gomorrah namdidung de kemmau ha sui süt bam kedine, nah penui mau dizu kedine, <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Ih cu cika nghung pie zie nah pecu mmau kebam ada kegwang de penui tei kesang mi me bi kecu pie zie. Magade cinzwa melie cai, Ih cilu bui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:5">Keu. 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Cine mina cipau kena cika de tet nreu pwa Sodom lambie miedi, dede Abraham, RAMPAUBE dwa de cuh sap bam di. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Pecai Abraham RAMPAUBE da nreu gwang delwe rangdi, “Nang makesangme de kemaume de si eh ngkapdi dizie deni? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Magade makesangme riakngei namdi ga bam cai. Nang peciakne de ngkap dizie de ni nah makesangme riakngei cika kebamme ziemne cipau ni de kelibeu lak deni? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Nang cikenzwa ta tei dilak, makesangme de kemaume de si eh teitset kera, iciu eh makesangme dede kemaume dage tei kegai nzwa tei teigai kera. Nang cikenzwa au tei di lak! Kideu pelane tu ketiakbe kemzuibe teilak ni?” <verse eid="GEN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Ih Sodom namdi ga makesangme riakngei ngau lu cai, Ih penui ziemne namdi pelane de mbai beu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abraham samkeligai eh rangdi, “Pielo, Ih a Rampaube de resiu kera acu tiaklu, Ih au rebui nah mimütdung ge swa si meliede. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Magade cika hang mengei riakngei swa makesangme cam bam lie cai dainzwa lai? Nang hang mengei cam kedi ne namdi pelane de ngkap dizie deni?” Pecai pa rangdi, “Ih riakdai mengei ngau lu cai, Ih ngkap di lak.” <verse eid="GEN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Pa pecu mpau dai eh rangdi, “Magade cika riakdai bam cai?” Pa keligai, “Ih riakdai de ziemne cide ngkap dilak.” <verse eid="GEN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Pa rangdi, “Kehereide n rata diso, Rampaubo, ciu eh Ih rang silu kerane. Magade cika camrei bam cai.” Pa keligai, “Ih cide tei lak, Ih cika camrei ngaulu cai.” <verse eid="GEN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Pa rangdi, “Pielo, Ih a Rampaube de resiu kera tiak luda! Magade cika ngkai ngaulu cai.” Pa keligai, “Ih ngkai de ziemne cide ngkap di lak.” <verse eid="GEN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Pa rangdi, “Kehereide n rata di so, Rampaubo, nah Ih pia ge kamtube samrang zie. Cika hang kerei ge au ngau lu zie.” Ge pa rangdi, “Ih kerei de ziemne ngkap dilak.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Abraham de ngngwa mpau cangdi herizi, RAMPAUBE pe lampui gage tet gaidi nah Abraham kilung cailigwangdi.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Sodom penai Gomorrah ngkapkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Cipau nai tinghegi tinggimgwame kena Sodom ga gwang, Lot Sodom kirie ga ntum kebam dau. Lot penaide ngaulu eh, cuh lwe penaide redau kera mie di, nah keumie pe zu hangdeu tung di. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Pa rangdi, “A mpaubo kehereide, Ih nnaide n kilabe ki ga gwang lulo kie lalie, nnai pi hui lu, nah tingmui bam lu. Pecai tingcang nnai cuh zi lubui nah nnai lampui le mie lu.” Penai keli eh, “Lak, anai heziu namceu lung ga hegwale zeu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Dede pa penai de kecung bidi, cine penai de pecu ngngwa mie pe ki ga gwanglu. Pa tangku cehi kai mene ru beu delwe taktyei keyi mteilu, nah penai cide tyeilu. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Dede penai zeu ga gwang kedi dwa, namdi minadung, Sodomme, hecing hena, namdi tu leune gade minadung pelane ki cide twagwalu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Penui Lot de qu lwe pedage ranggai, “Heziu nda gwang kebam mina de daiga bam no? Penaide anui da teu mpet beulo, ciude anui penai da kemmha ta tei lu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Cine Lot kikam gwale de penui da pet delwe pecai pekatei kikam ngkuidi. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Pa rangdi, “A zangmedung, Ih nnui da a nggia kie la, kenlien ai kenzwa ta teiso. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Ainie, Ih relie kemci a napui hangna bam reu. Ih a nggia kiela, peu acu penaide nnui da ngngwa gwang beulo, nah nnui suibe penai dage teikeneube teigai lulo. Dede aipau pei kena dage magede teigai so, kedanemene penai a ki siu ga gwang bam di de lu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Penai rangdi, “Caisim dilu!” Penui rang si di, “Nang sangme tei eh aika lung kera gwang, dede pa cu anui gu tu tiak pei tei! Cu anui penai de swade ndade siaki kecu tei gaizie.” Penui minabe de nia ketang, Lot de nia ketang nah kikam de teipang di kera tei cudi. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Dede tinggimgwame kena penai ba ketwa pet Lot de penai taigai kilung ga ngngwa nlütlu delwe kikam be ngkuidi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Lot giame kena ne hecing hena heki kikam gwale kebam mina pelane miak tei citdi, iciu eh penui kikam peei la cudau, penui leu sütdi.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Pecai tinggimgwame kena Lot dage ranggai, “Nang aika mi keheibe de bam ni? N napui nahpeime, n napeidung nah n napuidung mede namdi ga n kibaume keheibe de bam cai, penui de aika de peu mpet dilu. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Kedanemene anai heni aide ngkapdi lai zeu da, kedanemene RAMPAUBE dwa gade aidungde de kemmau sam kekiee siu kedine, pa anuide cide ngkap di lo eh langgai lie.” <verse eid="GEN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Lot pe napui nahpei kena, pe napui de lu zie lie sampet kebeu kena da gwang marang eh ranggai, “Kelwalu, aika de nzet tet dilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE namdi de de ngkapdi lai eh bam dida.” Dede pe napui nahpei kena de ziemne au pa henui tei kebam nzwadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:28">Luk. 17:28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:29">29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Tingcang baareirang ge, tinggimgwame Lot de kecung eh, ranggai, “Tet cu, n nau nah n napui kena aika kebam de de ngngwa lwe mpet lu, iciude namdi de saja kepeu dau nnuide de ngkapdi melu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Dede pa lunghaudi. Cine minabe kena pe ba teulu nah pe nau ba teulu, nah pe napui kena ba teulu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pecu ngau ngngia kecune. Penui penui de nzang mpetlu, delwe penui de namdi gwale ge peu bamlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2 Pet. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Penai penui de deudi gade ngngwa mpet luge, hangge paube rangdi, “Ringlu kerane pak lu! Nreu gwang pie so, mede hangdeu langkie kehei gade mtak so. Lamlwatudung gage pak gailu, iciude nnuide ngkapdi melu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lot penai dage rangdi, “Ciu so, kehereide, a kedibo! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />N kilabe n miak ngau gade n suibe tei luda, nah nang acu n ngaugia kedi keulia eh a teilung kelikebeu da, dede Ih lamlwatudung pak kah gai lak, kedanemene kengkap acu mzu pwa di zie, nah Ih tsai di zie. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Pielo, cipau namdi cika kebam de au pak mielu kera mna bam, nah cide au namdi keceu nege. Kehereide acu peu cika ge pak gaidi lulo (cide au namceu nage meluini?), nah a teilung kwak lu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Pa pe dage rang eh, “Petauda, nang nggia kie kegaide Ih tei beuzie nah nang kerang namdi de Ih ngkapdi lak. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Kelwalu! Cika ge pak gailu! Kedanemene nang cika gwang canglu kemaktane Ih magede tei gailak.” Cine namdi cide de Zoar qulu.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Lot Zoar gwang canglu ge tingnaimiak kideu reu ga cudi. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Cidau RAMPAUBE Sodom penai Gomorrah reu gage heu kebam sulfur rui ngkei gai nah Tinggim gade RAMPAUBE dade miheu ruigai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:29">Luk. 17:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Pa namdi cidung de, langkie pelane, nah keringria kebam namdi leune nah tsing ceheibwa hangdeu ga lungh kebam leune tei ngkap di. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Dede Lot nau, pecai ga bam cudau, caili gwang nreu pie gai, nah pa mcai cia mmidi.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Abraham tingcang nuge cu lu delwe, pa RAMPAUBE dwa ga kesap ni de ga mielu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Pa Sodom penai Gomorrah nah kideu langkie pelane ga pie ngkei gai. Pa piegai nah ainie pa pie kebam dau, hangdeu gade mika, miheukedi mika ge nzwa eh cu kecu ngau.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Cine Tinggwang langkie ga kebam namdidung ngkapdi cu dau, Tinggwang Abraham de nsung lu. Pa Lot kelungh namdidung kengkap dau, pa Lot de kengkapdung kak gade lang mpetdi.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lot nah pe napui kena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Dede Lot pe napui kenade nzang lwe Zoar gade tet pwa lamlwatu lebie lung kera tet cu lu, kedanemene pa au Zoar ga lung bam hing kecune. Cine pa tsupop ga lunghdi, pa nah pe napui kenade. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Pe neraibepui pe caihereibe pui dage rangdi, “Anai pei cing dida, nah kideu ga mipei gede anai de kideube zai gade ngngwa zeu beu kera gada. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Gwanglu, anai pei de peu sakmielu delwe anai pecu ngngwa zeu go, ciu eh anai anai pei leuh peu lunghlu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Cine penai cipau ziu de penai pei de peu zau sak lu. Ge kecingbe pui lütlu delwe pe pei de ngngwa zeudi; pa pe napui daidau zeu mie bi, mede daidau pa cu dai dibi kecu cima. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Pecai benai neraibepui pe caihereibe pui dage rangdi, “Kingnei lu, Ih aika nzie ziu a pei de ngngwa zeuda. Anai heziu de pecu peu zau sak kera kaibeu rie go, ciu eh nang lütlu delwe pecu ngngwa zeu lu maisia, Ciu eh anai anai pei na lunghlu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Cine cipau ziu penai pecu peu sakmie dailu, delwe henabe pui pecu ngngwa mhadi. Pa sakmie ham kedine daidau pa zeu nah cuh bi kecu de cima. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Cine Lot napui hangnana penai pei na tetlak ladi. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Kecingbe pui mipeina ge mnalu nah pezi Moab msiak lu. Pa henai kecang de Moabme paube da. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Henabe pui de au mipeina ge mna lu, pa pezi Ben-Ammi msiaklu. Pa cu Ammonme pau be da henai kecang.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abraham penai Abimelech</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Pecai Abraham cika de Negev deu nkangle bie ge tet gaidi, nah pa Kadesh namceu penai Shur kakga lungh di. Pa au Gerar namceu ga sangme ge tei eh lungh bam la. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Abraham pe nau Sarah de liagai eh rangdi, “Pa au a tipui lie.” Cine Gerarme Gwangpei Abimelech Sarah de ngngwa kera langgai nah pecu ngngwalu. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Dede Tinggwang tingmui dau Abimelech mang lede gwang eh pedade rangdi, “Ainie, nang au ketsai mege dida nang ngngwang gwang pwa kebam pui de ziemne, kedanemene pa au mipei ge nau lu.” <verse eid="GEN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Cidau Abimelech pe taiga mna gwang ma nah pa rangdi, “RAMPAUBO, nang makesangme leuh ge dede teitset dizie ni? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Pa pekatei ne adade, ‘Pa au a tipui’ de eh rang meni? Nah pa pekatei de rangdi, ‘Pa au a heibe.’ Ih aide a lung mzuizang eh tei nah a ba kena kemau teima.” <verse eid="GEN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Pecai Tinggwang pemang lede pedade rangdi, “Yeo, nang nlung mzui delwe aide tei kecu Ih de ci lie, nah Ih ncu peu a dage kemau teigaidi melie. Ciziemne Ih ncu peu pecu tung me lie. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ciziemne, mipeibe nau de pwa peu di lu, kedanemene pa au caihakecime ge lu. Pa n ziemne kekie tei beu zie, nah nang ring luzie. Dede magade nang pecu pwa peu dilu mecai nang nah ngu minadung pelane tsai bi zie.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimelech tingcang nuge pecai benai cuhlu delwe pe kilamedung de petaiga ge qu ngwang lu. Pa penuide ma aidung de pelane ranglia gai, ge minadung ngngi süt di. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Pecai Abimelech Abraham de qu lwe pedade rangdi, “Nang anui dage daige teigai zeu no? Dainzwa Ih n dage kemau teigaidi di no, ciu eh nang adage nah a hegwangram gage kemau kedi ge keugwang kecu? Nang ada ge teibui kemak teigai au delie.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abimelech Abraham dage rang dai, “Ncu dai ne ai kenzwa teigai kera kecung gai beu no?” <verse eid="GEN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abraham keligai, “Kedanemene Ih cet kecu, ‘Aipau ni ga Tinggwang mie kehing mige de bam lak, nah penui a nau ziemne acu teitset dizie.’ <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Pecaide, pa au a tipui kesang, a pei napui, dede a pui napui ma; nah pa a nau dida. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Tinggwang acu peu a pei ki püt di delwe heni ketsamtsam ga mbeu gwang la dau, Ih pedage ranggai, ‘Nang a nau kecu nzwa aipau samsang keulia bi maisia: Heni keheiga anai kemie dau, acu lepwa, “Pa au a heibe, de eh rang lulo beulie.”’” <verse eid="GEN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Pecai Abimelech meurün nah hetumseu, nah hebaangme mipui nah mipei keulu delwe penuide Abraham de peu gai. Pecai pa Sarah, Abraham nau de pecu peu caili beu di. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimelech rangdi, “Pielo, a deu ndwa ga bam. Nang lungh keneu keheibe ga lungh lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Pa Sarah dage rangdi, “Pielo, Ih n heibe de rangkang geu chang ge peu dida. Cide au ncu nzang kelame pelane miakngau gade ncu kemmau keheibe gade gumlu kerane, nah pelane dwade, ncu au tei petau cangsiak dide lie kecu ge.” <verse eid="GEN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Pecai Abraham Tinggwang dade kekie teigai, nah Tinggwang Abimelech de teihemi beu, pe nau, nah pe kilame puidung de iciu eh penui hena lungh lu kera teibeu. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE peu Abimelech kilung ga mipuime pelane de hena lungh kelak teidi, Abraham nau Sarah ziemne.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Isaac de kemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />RAMPAUBE Sarah mapie beuzie lie pa kerang nzwa pe mapie beu, nah RAMPAUBE Pa sampet kebeu nzwa Sarah ziemne teicang gaibeu. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Sarah tetlaklu nah Abraham de pa cing kedi caine mipeina ge Tinggwang ne pedage rang kebeu ting gap dau mnalu. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abraham pe napei, pecu mna kebeube de, Sarah ne pecu mna kelube de Isaac msiaklu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 1:2, Luk 3:34 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Abraham pe napei Isaac lang heset di ge hegeurum kecu teilu, Tinggwang pedage ajah kai kebeu nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Bat. 7:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Abraham mmi haige di kecu dau pe na Isaac de pecu mna beu. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sarah rangdi, “Tinggwang acu suiyi pwa peu da; mileune de siu kegaime acu ngngwa pesuiyi zie.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Pa rangdai gai “Caune Abraham dade Sarah hename nepam zielie kecu ranglu laino, dede Ih pa cing kedi caine mipeina ge mna beuda!”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hagar penai Ishmael de langgi kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Hena nade ngkieng cu lwe tung tadi, Isaac tung ta kedi benai Abraham hengyi dige telei gai. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Sarah langnai ge Egyptme pui Hagar napei Abraham na mna kebeube de ngau periakdi. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Cine pa Abraham dage rang gai, “Aipau hebaang pui de nah pe napei de gwa gidi lulo, kedanemene aipau hebaang pui napei de peu a na Isaac de ngngwa, mapwa ga ncüt gailak.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29">Gal. 4:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Ma aide Abraham pe napei ziemne pelung keherei sütdi. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Dede Tinggwang Abraham dage rangdi, “Aipau nade ziemne nah n kila pui ziemne nlung keherei so. Makie aidungde pa n dage rang kebeu samdung de pedade kiengnei lulo, kedanemene Isaac dade n leuhmedung zi keu zielu. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ih n kilabe pui napei de de peu heleuh ge luzie, pa au n leuhme ge kecune.” <verse eid="GEN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Abraham tingcang nuge pecai benai cuh zi lwe tangku nah dui la keulu delwe Hagar de pe hekeutu ga cide npüt kaibeu. Pa pe napei de peu lwe pecu lang gidi. Hagar tetpwa hetaideu Beersheba ga huirwa ladi. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Duila ga dui sak cangdi ge, pe napei nade tsinghum kangga ge gi gaidi. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Pecai pa pe napei dade dei ham kemak ga mie ntum bamdi, lakpi le kap canglu kera dei ge ga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lakpi le kap canglu kera dei ge ga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">100 feet ge kenzwa </char></note>, pa rangdi, “Peu acu a napei tsai kecu ngau helo.” Pa cika ntum bam kecu dau, pa pe kwa cii eh hap süt cudi. <verse eid="GEN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Tinggwang mipeina de kwa siulu, nah tinggim gade Tinggwang gwame Hagar de qu, nah pedage rangdi, “Nang daitei nlung keherei au no, Hagar? Ngngi so, Tinggwang au mipeina de kebam ga pe kwa siulu da. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Cuh lu, n napei nade kwak cuhlu delwe pelung teinciep beulu; kedanemene Ih pecu heleuh kedi ge tei zie.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Pecai Tinggwang pe miak teimrak beu, nah pa tekwaki dui ngaulu. Pa mie delwe dui le duila ga kai puilu delwe pe napei de peu saklu. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Tinggwang mipeina de ngngwa la, nah pa ngking cuhlu. Pa hetaideu ga lungh bamla eh lakpi kap cisüt kecume ge teilu. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Pa Paran hetaideu ga lungh bamla, nah pe pui Egyptme deu gade pe ziemne pe nau pei beulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Beersheba gade samtingkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Cipau tingdau Abimelech nah pe reugwame kedibe Phicol au Abraham de mpau eh, ranggai, “Tinggwang au nang ketei leune ga ncu ngngwa la. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Cu ciziemne nang Tinggwang zi gade aika de sampet beulo, acu, mede a name mede a leuhme dage ma kesia tei gailak lie kecu. Nang lungh kebam deu de de nah acu samkak kelu masang de Ih ncu liagai kecu nzwa lai lo.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abraham rangdi, “Ih sampet beu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Abraham gu tekwa dui ziemne Abimelech kilame ne pe dade süt pwadi kecune Abimelech dage ncam gai. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimelech rangdi, “Cau ne ai kenzwa tei bi Ih ci ma. Nang madau gede ada ge ranglia ma, Ih henai kecangde cide siu ma.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Cine Abraham meurün nah hetumseu keu lwe Abimelech de cidungde peu gai, nah penai hangna samting samkak teilu. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Pecai Abraham pe meurün hau gade meurünlei hena penuikatei ne keu ncamlu. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimelech Abraham dade rangdi, “Meurünlei hena penui katei ne keu ncam kecu aidungde kie de dai no?” <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Pa keli gai, “Nang meurün lei hena aide a ba gade ngaulu zie, iciu lude tekwa aide Ih ne kui kelube lie de kecu a ziemne zierang be delie” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Cine pa heni cide Beersheba lie qulu, kedanemene cika de penai hangna na samkak tei kelune. <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Penai Beersheba gade samting samkak kelu tei, nah pecai Abimelech penai pe reugwame kedibe Phicol Philistinme deu ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abraham Beersheba ga Tamarisk bang ling gailu. Pa cika de kelungta kering Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE de reca. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abraham peting ketie ge Philistinme deu ga sangme pei ge tei lung ladi.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Abraham de kedei kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Ma aidungde aizwa gwang kebam cai Tinggwang Abraham de kedei gai. Pa pedage rangdi, “Abraham!” Abraham keligai, “Ih aika bam.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17">Heb. 11:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Pecai Tinggwang rangdi, “N napei de ngngwalu, n na pumli nade, nang ku kelabe Isaac de, nah Moriah deu ga miecu. Cika lamlwatu ge reu gage Ih ncu ranglia lai eh kebam de gage pecu cika ge keru reca tei beulo.” <verse eid="GEN 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Cine Abraham tingcang nuge pecai benai cuh zilu, pe gada püt teilu, nah rehang hangna de ngngwa si lu, pe napei Isaac de si eh. Pa keru reca tei kera ziemne tsing de danglu, pecai pedage Tinggwang ne rang kebeu heni ga pa mie kera tet culu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Lang cumne benai Abraham ngang cu pie gaige heni de deitau ge ga ngau. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Abraham pe rehangbe kena dade rangdi, “Aika gada de ngngwa bamlu, nah Ih nah mipeina luga mie zie reu. Anai mie recalu delwe nnai taiga cailigwang dai zie.” <verse eid="GEN 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Pecai Abraham keru reca tei kera tsing de keu lwe pe napei Isaac reu ge cide kai beudi. Pa pe ba ga mi nah tangkane keulu; nah penai hangna na nzang lwe tet petdi. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaac pe pei Abraham dade marang eh rangdi, “A pei,” nah pa rangdi, “Ih aika bam, a napei.” Pa rang dai, “Ainie, aika mi nah tsing bam, dede keru reca tei kera meurünna dai ga bam no?” <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abraham rangdi, “Tinggwang ne meurünna keru reca ziemne pwa peu zie, a napei.” Cine penai hangna na nzang mie ladi.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Iciuge penui Tinggwang rang kebeu ni ga mielu ge, Abraham racabam teilu delwe tsing pwa gailu. Pecai pa pe napei Isaac de kanglu, nah ratakbam tsing reu gage pe napei de pwa gailu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:21">Jas. 2:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Abraham pe ba hetwapet pe napei de teitset kera pe tangkane keulu. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Pecai RAMPAUBE tinggimgwame tinggim gade pecu qu nah rangdi, “Abraham, Abraham!” nah pa rangdi, “Ih aika bam.” <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Pa rangdi, “N napei reu ga n ba kai so, mede pecu magede tei di so, kedanemene Ih cu au cilu da nang Tinggwang de hingla lie kecu, n na pumli na de nang adwa de keu mbaih di kemak ngau.” <verse eid="GEN 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abraham ngang cu pie gaige ainie, meurün seu ge tsinghum gage peki dwak pwa kebam ngaulu. Abraham mie delwe meurün seu de keu pecu teugwang pena keleu gade keru reca teilu. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Cine Abraham heni cide qu, “RAMPAUBE peu zie,” nah henai kecang de ainzwa rang bamla, “RAMPAUBE lamlwatu ga de cide pwa peu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />RAMPAUBE gwame pia pe kena be tinggim gade Abraham de qu dai gai <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />nah rang dai-RAMPAUBE ne aide sampet peu da-Ih ne sampet beu nang ma aidungde tei kebeu ziemne, nah n na, n na pumli be de teu caili kemakne,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:73">Luk. 1:73</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 1:74">74</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />Ih ncu samlam beubi zie nah Ih n leuhme de tinggimdung ga hegidung kiee ge, nah jaaidikung ga heciang kekiee ge nzwa tei beu zie; nah n leuhmedung penui ngauraume de ngam luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:13">Heb. 6:13</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 6:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />N name heleuh pelane gade kideube samlam pung luzie, kedanemene nang a kwa kiengnei kelune. <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Cine Abraham pe rehangbe kena tai ga cailigwanglu delwe penui tet cuh gai eh nzang lwe Beersheba gage tet gailu, nah pa Beersheba ga lungh bamdi.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahor napeidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Ma aidungde cai Abraham dage ranglia eh, “Milkah de n sinabe pei Nahor de pena mna beuda.” <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Penui cai, pe neraibe Uz, Buz be pecaihereibe pei, Kemuel Aram pei, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesed, Hazo, Pildash, Jidlaph, nah Bethuel. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Bethuel be Rebekah pei teilu. Aidung de Milkah ne pena hang heset Abraham sinabe Nahor de mna kebeudung da. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Pe nauseupui pezi Reumah kecu pui dede Tebah, Gaham, Tahash, nah Maacah de mnalu.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Sarah tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sarah mmi haige eh ngkaiehena lunglu. Aidung de Sarah teilung mmidung da. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Sarah Kiriath Arba gade tsaidi, aide, Hebron, Canaanme deu ga. Abraham Sarah ziemne hei eh hap bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Pecai Abraham cuhlu delwe pe nau pau kebam gade tetdi, nah Heth napeidung dade marang eh ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Ih au nnui kakga sangme ge lie. Kehereide acu nnui kakga herau kie ge tei kera hangdeu ge peulo, iciu eh Ih a nau de cika ge kunglu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Heth name bau Abraham de keli eh ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Anui kwa kiengnei gailo, a mpaubo. Nang au anui kakgade Tinggwang hegwang napei lie. N nau de n suitube anui raudung gage kunglu lo. Anui keheibe de rau ncu ha lak lie di lak lie, ciude nang n nau de kunglu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Abraham cuhlu delwe mina deu, Heth napeidung da keumie. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Pa penuide resiu eh, ranggai, “Magade nnui kesamdau Ih a naude kung lulo maisia cai, a kwa siulu delwe a ziemne nnui Zohar napei Ephron dade kie beulo. <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />Pedade Machpelah tsupop, pe gu de, peluh kung ga kebam de acu zwa kera kie beu lulo. Peu pecu cide pemi mmui lu cang eh nnui dwade acu zwa hangdeu de heraukie teilu kera.” <verse eid="GEN 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Cidau Ephron Heth namedung kakga ntum bam, nah Hittitme pei Ephron, Heth napeidung nah namdi kirie ga ngngwa gwang kelame pelane kak de Abraham sam keli eh ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Lak, a mpaubo, a sam kiengnei gailo, Ih luh de, nah cika tsupop kebam de si eh a leuhme peidung kebam dwa gade Ih cide ncu n nau de kunglu kera peu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Pecai Abraham pekatei deuketmedung dwa ga keu mielu. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Pa Ephron de resiu eh Hittitme pelane siulu kebui tei eh, ranggai, “Dede nnui petau lu bui lie cai, kehereide a kwa kiengnei gailo. Ih luh mi de teibeu zie. Rangkang keu lulo adade, nah Ih cika a kibaume de kunglu dizie.” <verse eid="GEN 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Ephron Abraham dage keli gai eh, ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Kehereide, a mpaubo, a kwa kiengnei gailo. Hangdeu keceu aide rangkanggeu hai mdai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu hai mdai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu 4.6 kilogram</char></note> gwale ma, anai kakga dai bam no? Cika ge n nau de kung lulo” dedi. <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abraham Ephron sam mneilu delwe rangkang geu hai mdai Heth napeidung siu kecu gade pa rang kecu nzwa heli keteime zai rehi gade perüt mdetlu.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Cine Ephron luh Machpelah ga, Mamre taiga kebam luh de, nah tsupop cika kebam de, nah luh de tsingbang twagwa kebam pelane pe nli pekungdung peciakne si eh mpet beu, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Abraham de Heth napeidung nah namdi kirie ga gwang kelame pelane dwa gade. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Aide cai Abraham pe nau Sarah de Machpelah luh ga kebam tsupop gage kungdi, aide Mamre taiga, cide Hebron, Canaanme deu ga bam. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Cine luh de nah cika tsupop kebam de Abraham de peu pe heraukie tei kerane Heth napeidung ne mpet beudi.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaac penai Rebekah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Cu Abraham cing süt di nah RAMPAUBE Abraham de ma pelane ketei ga samlam beu. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Abraham pe kilabe dage rangdi, mige pe kilungme cingtube nah pe maabam pelane pie rengei kelabe, “A mnie kakga ge n ba kailu <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />nah Ih ncu peu tinggim Tinggwang nah kideu Tinggwang RAMPAUBE dwa ga de sampet tei gai zie, nang a na ziemne penau aika canaanme napui dade, Ih ngngwa lungh kebamme kak de kedet lak lie kecu. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Dede nang a mna nam ga nah a kibaume da mie zie, delwe a na Isaac ziemne henau ge peeilu maisia.” <verse eid="GEN 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Kilabe pedade rangdi, “Magade releipui be aipau deu ga acaisui gwang raudi cai dainzwa lai? Ih n na de lang caili pwa nang kegwang Mesopotomia deudi de gage langgai di zie ni?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abraham pe dade rangdi, “Nang a na de cika ge langgai dai kelak teibilu. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />RAMPAUBE, tinggim Tinggwang acu a pei ki gade nah a kibaume deu gade ngngwa gwang kelube, nah pa acu sünne eh sampet eh pesam kaibeu eh ranggai, ‘N name de Ih hangdeu aide peu zie,’ pa pe tinggimgwame de n dwa langgai zie, nah nang cika de a na ziemne nau ngaulu zie. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Dede releipui acaisui raudi cai, ciude nang a sampet aipau kangga lüt si ta dizie. Dede nang a na de cika ngngwa cailigwang lak.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Cine kilabe peba pwa Abraham pe mpaube mnie kena kakga ge kailu delwe pa kerang de teizie lie eh sampet teilu.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Kilabe pe mpaupei gu utdung kerei teulwe tetdi. Pa pe mpaube mapeu ketsamtsam pelane gade de teu si eh tetdi. Pa tetti delwe Aram Naharaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aram Naharaim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mesopotomia </char></note> cuikui, Nahor namdi ga miedi. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Pa namdi gwale bie dui tekwa ge ga peu utdung de kwaktunglu. Cide ting hegi, cipau tingdau mipui dui twak kera miedi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Ciu eh pa rangdi, “RAMPAUBO, a mpaupei Abraham Tinggwang, henai acu peu teidaulu nah Samkak kelu samsang a mpaube Abraham de keu lialo. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Pielo, Ih dui rwak aika namdi ga releime dui twak gwang kera ga sapbam. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Peu ainzwa lu. Ih releipui de rangcu dau, ‘Kehereide n duibung pwa hena mie gai eh acu peu sak,’ nah pa acu, ‘Saklu, nah Ih ngu utdung ziemne de dui twak pwa gwang beu zie,’ de eh rang cai, cipau pui de nang n kilabe Isaac ziemne kedet kelube pui lulo. Aide ne nang a mpaube dade samkak kelu samsang keulia kecu Ih cilu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Cidau pa marang cangdi kecu dwa de, ainie, Rebekah pe duibung ge pe hekeutu gage pwa lwe gwang. Rebekah Abraham sinabe Nahor nau, Milkah napei Bethual mnabeu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Pa au relei hezuyi süt nah kemci pui ge. Pa pedwa ga mipei ge de bam swa ma. Pa tekwa ga nghung eh pe duibung twak puilu delwe cailigwang. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Ge kilabe pakpet pecu redau lwe rangdi, “Kehereide acu peu keceu nage de n duibung gade dui saklo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Pa rangdi, “Saklu, a mpaubo,” nah pa pe ba zette pe duibung pwa hena gai beu eh pecu peu saklu. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Pa pecu peu sak cang kelu dau, pa rangdi, “Ih n gu utdung ziemne de dui pwa gwangbeu zie, penui sak canglu kemaktane.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Cine pa zette pe duibung makaune dui kesak kwak gage tei mta kelwa gaidi eh, tekwa ga pak dai mie dui pwa gwang beu, nah pe utdung pelane ziemne dui pwabeu. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Mina be mlei mene pecu pie bam RAMPAUBE pe beu ziemne pecu peu tei daukelu teilu de mi mebi kecu. <verse eid="GEN 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Utdung dui sak cang kelu cai, minabe kecak ngkie ringgoi perüt shekel pempie nah kecak ta kena perüt shekel kerei ge pe ba kena ziemne keu mpet beu, <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />delwe keteudi, “Nang cau napui no? Kehereide acu ranglialo, cika heziu n pei ki ga zeu kera a minadung nah a ziemne heni bam mi?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Pa pedage rangdi, “Ih au Milkah napei Bethual, pa Nahor de mna kebeube napui lie.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Pa pedage rang eh, “Anui da reigau nah ketum tak kiee süt bam, nah heziu nnui bamlu kebui heni de bam.” <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ciu eh mina be keumie RAMPAUBE de reca. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Pa kie eh, “RAMPAUBE de twalu, a mpaube Abraham Tinggwang, pa pe kenlum a mpaube dage samkak kebeu de masang eh gidi ma. A ziemne, RAMPAUBE a mpaube ki kibaume da acu ngngwa gwang beu da.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Pecai releipui be pe pui kiga pak gwang maha aidungde pelane pau beu. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Cu Rebekah pe heipei bamla, nah pezi cai Laban. Laban minabe lampui ga duilet taiga kebambe da pak mie. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Cidau pa ngkie ringgoi nah heta kena pe tipui ba ga kebam ngaulu, nah pa Rebekah, “Aipau mina be adage rang,” de kecu samde siulu ge pa mina taiga mie, nah, ainie, pa duilet taiga pe utdung taiga sapbam. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Ge Laban rangdi, “Acu ngngwa kilung gwanglu, nang RAMPAUBE samlam kebeume ge da. Daitei nang hegwale sap bam no? Ih a ki ga n ziemne heni mtei luda, nah utdung ziemne de si eh.” <verse eid="GEN 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Cine mina be kilung ga lütlu nah pa utdung püt lwakdi. Utdung de reigau nah taktyeidung peu, nah pecai minabe ziemne nah pecu ngngwa kelame pi nah pe pi hui kera dui pwa gwangbeu. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Penui pe dwaga taktyei pwa gwang teleilu, dede pa rangdi, “Ih rang zie lie kelade Ih rang di kemaktane Ih ma tyei lak.” Cine Laban keli eh, “Ranggai cu” dedi. <verse eid="GEN 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Pa rangdi, “Ih au Abraham kilabe. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />RAMPAUBE a mpaube de samlam süt beu eh pecu keheime ge tei beu. Pa pecu meurün hau nah ketum haudung, rangkanggeu, kecak, kilapeidung nah kilapuidung, nah utdung nah gadadung pwa peudi. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sarah, a mpaupei nau, pa cing kedi caine pecu mipeina ge mnabeu, nah pa pecu pe mabam pelane peu dida. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />A mpaupei acu peu pe sam mzai kera sampet gai, ranggai, ‘Nang a na ziemne Ih lung kebam deu canaan ga releime kak de henau pei so. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Meliene, nang mie maisia a kibaume, a pei leuhme, nah a na ziemne henau peilu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Ih a mpaupei dage rangdi, ‘Magade releipui acaisui rau di cai.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Dede pa a dade rangdi, ‘RAMPAUBE, Ih pesam mzai muila kelabe, pa pe tinggimgwabe de langgai beuzie nah pa n lampui ngau daulu zie, iciu eh nang a kibaume kak gade nah a pei kelak ria gade a na ziemne nau peilu zie. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Dede nang nlilu bui a sampet de gade magade a kibaume nang gwang kecu dau penui ncu pe mpaube pui de peu lak lie cai. Cidau nang a sampet gade mbai lu bui.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Cine Ih henai duilet ga gwanglu, delwe ranggai, ‘O RAMPAUBE, a mpaupei Abraham Tinggwang, kehereide, Nang magade a mbeu tei daulu kera tei kesang beu zielie cai, <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Ih au aika bam, sap lwe dui rwak taiga bam. Releime ge dui twak kera gwang cu dau, Ih pe dage rang, “Kehereide n duibung gade acu dui keceu nage sak kera peulo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Releipui de acu rang eh, “Saklu, nah Ih n utdung ziemne de dui pwa gwangbeu zie,” cipau releipui de de peu nang RAMPAUBE ne kedetkelu a mpaupei na nau lulo.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Ih mlei mene kie canglu mereu kecu dau, ainie, Rebekah pe duibung pe hekeutu gage pwa lwe nghung tekwa ga dui twak bamdi. Cine Ih pedade rangdi, ‘Kehereide acu peu dui sak lo.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Ge pa zette pe hekeutu gade pe duibung pwa hena mie delwe rangdi, ‘Saklu, nah Ih n utdung de de dui peu zie.’ Cine Ih saklu, nah pa utdung de de peu dui saklu. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Ih pedage keteu eh rangdi, ‘Nang cau napui no?’ Pa rangdi, ‘Bethual napui, Nahor napei, Milkah ne pecu mna kebeube de.’ Pecai Ih ringgoi be pwa pe ngkie gage kai nah heta kena pwa pe ba gage kai. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Delwe Ih keumie RAMPAUBE de reca, nah RAMPAUBE samlam beu, a mpaube Abraham Tinggwang, acu lampui petau be ga nzang gwang a mpaube kibaume napui de ngau kelune peu pe na nau kera ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Cu ciziemne, nang magade a mpaupei dage nlum kebeu samkak masang eh mtei eh keulia cai, acu rang gailo. Dede melie cai, acu ranglialo, iciu eh Ih nzet lebie ba mede hile bie ge nreu gai lu kerane.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Iciu ge Laban penai Bethual keli gai eh rangdi, “Makie aide RAMPAUBE dade gwang kecune; anui ndage keyi kesia rang gailak. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Pielo, Rebekah n tai ga bam da. Cine pecu nzang lwe tetcu, RAMPAUBE ne rang kebeu nzwa, pecu peu n mpaupei napei nau teicu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Abraham kilabe penui sam aide siulu ge, pa pekatei hangdeu ga RAMPAUBE de keumie. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Kilabe pai nah rangkang geu nah kecak le ketei netdung li mpetlu, delwe cidung de Rebekah de peu. Pa mtakepeu ma pemi kehungdung pwa pe heibe nah pe pui de de peugai. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Pecai pa nah pecu ngngwa kelame matyei nah saklu. Delwe cipau ziu cika bamlu, nah penui tingcang cuhlu ge, pa rangdi, “Acu peu a mpaupei da cailigwang culo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Pe heibe penai pe pui de rangdi, “Peu releipui de anui da mtakkak gede mede ziangrei ge bam gai rielo. Cipau cai pa tet lubui.” <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Dede pa penui dade rangdi, “Peu acu bamdi helo, RAMPAUBE a beu tei dau beu da. Acu a lampui ga lang beulu ciude Ih a mpaupei da mielu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Penui rangdi, “Anui releipui de qu lwe pecu keteu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Cine penui Rebekah de qu lwe pecu keteudi, “Nang mina aipau de de nzang tet lubui deni?” Pa keli, “Ih tet lubui.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Cine penui tipui Rebekah nah kilabe pui de si eh lang gai, Abraham kilabe nah pe minadung de nzang gwangdi. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Penui Rebekah de samlam beu, nah peda rang eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Anui tipui, ncu peu mina pecang pui teilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">nah n leuhme de peu kirie gum kelube teilu penuide ngaurau kelame dade.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Pecai Rebekah cuhlu, nah pa nah pe kila releime si eh utdung reu ngkeilu nah penuide nzang tetdi. Iciu eh kilabe Rebekah de ngngwalu delwe pe lampui le ge tet cu gai.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Cipau ting dau Isaac Negev ga lungh bamla, nah Beer Lahai Roi gade cailigwang bam. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Isaac luh ga terwa zie lie tinghegi tetpet. Pa pie nghang ge, ainie, utdung cika gwang kela ngaulu. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rebekah pie gai, nah pa Isaac de ngaulu ge, pa pe ut reu gade nghunglu. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Pa kilabe de rang eh, “Mina lu be de luh ga anui tai lam tet gwang kelabe de cau no?” Kilabe rang, “Pa au a mpaube.” Cine pa pe ngwangbiet pai keu pezu gumdi. <verse eid="GEN 24:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Kilabe Isaac dage pa tei kedi be ma pelane pau beu. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Ciu eh Isaac Rebekah de ngngwa pe pui Sarah kelung paiki de ga nlütlu, ciu eh pa penau di, nah pa pecu ku. Cine Isaac pepui ga kedi teide pelung tei ncieplu.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Abraham tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abraham mipui keda de luulu; pezi cai Keturah. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Pa pecu Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, nah Shuah penui de mnabeu. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Jokshan au Sheba penai Dedan pei di. Dedan leuhme cai Assyriame, Letushme, nah Leumme. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midian name cai Ephah, Epher, Hanok, Abida, nah Eldaah mina aidung de Keturah leuhme. <verse eid="GEN 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abraham pe mabam pelane pwa Isaac de peudi. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ciuliede, pa ring kebam dau, pe nauseupui napeidung de pa mapeu ciau delwe penuide Canaan deudi naimiak kepetle ge lang gaidi, pe na Isaac dade lang gidi. <verse eid="GEN 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Aidung de Abraham teilung tingba ziedung, cide cai pa mmi 175 ge lungh. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abraham lungh mnungkui lwe cing süt eh tsaidi, kecing me ge pe teilung lungh mnungkui eh, nah pa pe leuhmedung da gwangdi. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Pe na kena Isaac penai Ishmael, pecu pwa Hittitme pei Ephron, Zohar napei luh Mamre taiga Machpelah tsupop de gage kungdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 23:17-20 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Luh cide Abraham Heth name dade luilu. Abraham de de pe nau Sarah de kekung gage ngngwa kungdi. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abraham tsit cai, Tinggwang pena Isaac de samlam beu, nah Isaac Beer Lahai Roi taiga lungh di.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishmael napeidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Cu aidungde cai Ishmael leuhme, Abraham napei, Sarah kilapui Egyptme pui Hagar ne Abraham de mna kebeudung da. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Aidung de Ishmael napeimedung zi, kecingbe zi gade rai eh rau kelu: Nebaioth, Ishmael neraibe, Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish, nah Kedemah. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Aidungde Ishmael napeidung, nah penui zidung msiak pwa, penui renamdung ne, nah penui kelung nidung zi gage kaibeu; penui hegwangna kereiekena heleuh rehi gade. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Aidung de Ishmael mmi peteilung ziedung haige camreiehena. Pa perabe kaibeu eh tsaidi, nah pe leuhme de teuhekwa dailu. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Penui Havilah gade Ashhur kecang ga lung, Egypt tai kemna, Assyria lambie kemie ga. Penui hangge ge de kengaurau eh lungh.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jacob penai Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Aidung de cai Abraham napei Isaac de kemna ha. Abraham Isaac pei teidi. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaac Rebekah, Bethuel napui Paddan Aram ga Arameanme ge, nah Arameanme Laban tipui de pe nau luu kelu dau mmi riakdai di. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isaac pe nau pe na kega ziemne RAMPAUBE dage kiegai, nah RAMPAUBE pe kekie tei beu, iciu eh penau Rebekah tetlaklu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Penai mna kemak dwa de pe za gade ngngwa keherei bamdi, nah pa rang, “Daitei ai kenzwabe ada gwang lai no?” De eh pa RAMPAUBE dade aide ziemne keteu kera miedi. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />RAMPAUBE pe dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Heleuh kena nlung ga la, nah nlung gade nang heleuh kena keu ntsam dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Hangge kedabe swa ngkiengki zie, nah kecingbe henabe nküt teizie.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Pa mna kera ting canglu ge, ainie, peza ga nedui la. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Kecingbe de pegeu gie ciak eh mamai pai ge nzwa mnalu. Penui pezi Esau lie qulu. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Cipau cai, henabe be pe ba Esau pideu herakting lwe mnalu. Pecu Jacob de eh qulu. Penau mna kelu dau Isaac mmi riakherok di.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Penai ngkieng culu, nah Esau teihgwa keyi mege teilu, pa hegwale kela pesui yila; dede Jacob be mlei ham lama, pa peting kilung ga bamla. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Ciu eh Isaac au Esau de pesuiki kedanemene pane gwa kelu makaune teih pa tyei, dede Rebekah Jacob de pe suiki. <verse eid="GEN 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Jacob reteipi gi ge lang bam. Esau mnei di nah pa nzeu eh luh gade gwangla. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Esau Jacob dage rangdi, “Acu taktyei kegie lude a pok teibeu lo. Kehereide, Ih au leu zu dida!” Aide ziemne pezi Edom lie qu di. <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Jacob rang eh, “N nerai kwa cide acu zwa railu.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau rang eh, “Ainie, Ih nzeu eh tsai lau da. A nerai kwa cide pe keyi dai no?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Jacob rangdi, “Keraibe nang ada letpet lulo,” Cine Esau letpet lu nah cinzwa eh pa pe nerai kwa Jacob dage zwa beudi. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Jacob Esau de tangku nah gi pwapeu. Pa tyei nah saklu, nah cuh lwe pe lampui ga tetdi. Ainzwa eh Esau pe nerai kwa de mapei tadi.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaac penai Abimelech</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Abraham tingdau hangdeu ga herakum kerai de cai, keda ge cuhdi. Isaac Philistinme hegwangpei Abimelech da Gerar ga mie. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />RAMPAUBE peu pecu ngaugai eh pedage rangdi, “Egypt ga mie so; Ih ncu lung bam lulo kebeu deu ga lung bamlu. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Aipau deu ga bamlu, nah iciude Ih ncu ngngwa la luzie nah ncu samlam beu zie; ncu nah n leuhme de hangdeu peciakne peu zie nah Ih n pei Abraham dage samkai kecu sampet kebeu de kaipwa bam luzie. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Ih tinggim ga hegi kebam kiee ge n leuh teingkiee beu zie, nah Ih n leuhme de hangdeu ai pelane peu zie. N leuhme dade kideu mena peciakne da samlam beu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Ken. 15:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Ih aide tei beu zie kedanemene Abraham a sam mzai eh nah Ih teilo kebeu, a samkai kebeu, a zaidung pelane, nah a zaidung pelane mzai kelune.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Cine Isaac Gerar ga lunghdi. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Langnai ge Gerar ga minadung pe nau ha peda keteu kecu dau, pa keligai, “Pa au a tipui.” “Pa au a nau lie kecu, pa rang hingdi,” Kedanemene pa cetdi, “Minadung Rebecca de lulu kerane pecu teitset zie de, kedanemene pa hezuyi süt kecune.” <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaac cika peting ketie ge kela dau, Philistinme hegwangpei Abimelech pe hebaki gade pie mpet gai. Ainie, Isaac penau Rebecca de mrai mcuibam kebam de pa ngau. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimelech Isaac de qu lwe rangdi, “Pielo, pa au n nau da. Nang daitei, ‘pa n tipui lie rang no’?” Isaac pedage rang eh, “Kedanemene Ih kecet mi acu teitsetdi delwe pecu lu pwadi zielu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimelech rangdi, “Nang anui dage daipai tei gai la no? A minadung hangge reluicui eh n nau de ngngwa zeudi lubui, nah anui mau de n peu ga lubui.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Cine Abimelech mina pelane de mrai rang mrak eh cu, “Keheibe de aipau pei de de nah pe nau dage buikemak teigai cai teitset dizie,” debeu.<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaac cipau deu gage heleuh gilu nah cipau kum pa gikegai hai kiege luhlütlu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pecu samlam kebeune. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Pa maheilu, nah hei reureu lwe pa mahei süt kecume ge teilu kemaktane. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Pa meurün hau nah ketum hau kekiee ge, nah kilame kekiee ge bam. Philistinme pecu ngau swakdi. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Pe pei Abraham ringkebam dau pe kilame tekwa kui keludung peciakne, Philistinme penui ta kam eh tangdei teimet di. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimelech Isaac dage rangdi, “Anui dade tetdi, kedanemene nang anui swa ngkiengki lu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Cine Isaac cika de tetdi nah Gerar deu langkam gage pe bam teilu, nah cika lung bamdi.<verse eid="GEN 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaac, pe pei Abraham tingdau tekwa kui keludung de kui dailu. Philistinme ne Abraham tsaidi cai penui de kam di. Isaac tekwa cidung de pe pei ne mtak kebeu zidung teu qu dailu. <verse eid="GEN 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Isaac kilame tekwa langkam ga kuimie ge, penui cika tekwa dui lwa kepet ngaulu. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Gerar ga tumkwame Isaac tumkwame de kesamlim di, nah rangdi, “Dui aide anui gu.” Cine Isaac cipau tekwa “Esek” lie qulu, kedanemene penui pecu ngngwa kesamlim kedine. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Pecai penui tekwa keda ge kui dailu, nah penui cipau de ziemne de kesamlim daidi, cine pa cide zi mtak pwa “Sitnah” teidi. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Pa cika de tetdi nah tekwa keda ge kui dailu, dede penui kesamlim dai ma aipau de gade au. Cine pa Rehoboth qulu, nah pa rang eh, “Cu RAMPAUBE hangdeu aide ga kebwak mene lungh kera anuide peu da, nah anuide lungyi lubui da.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Pecai Isaac cika de Beersheba ga hangdi. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Cipau zeuziu de RAMPAUBE peu pecu ngaugai eh rangdi, “Ih n pei Abraham Tinggwang. Ngngi diso, Ih au ncu ngngwala nah ncu samlam beuzie nah n leuhme kekie pwa peu zie, a kilabe Abraham ziemne.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Isaac cika ge recabam ge tei lwe RAMPAUBE zi qugai. Cika ge pa pe rezeuki teilu, nah pe kilame tekwa kuilu.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Pecai Abimelech Gerar gade, Ahuzzath, pe zangpei, nah pe reugwame reu kedibe Phicol de nzang eh pecu redau kera hung. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaac penui dade keteu, “Nnui daitei a da gwangla no, kedanemene nnui acu ngau nghet nah nnui dade acu gwa dida delwe?” <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Pecai penui rang eh, “RAMPAUBE ncu nzang kela anui ngau bam da. Cine anui kakga samkak kecu bam kera cetlu, yeo, anui kakga. Cine co anui ncu ngngwa sampetgai golie. <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />Nang anui dage kesia tei gai lak lie kecu, anui ndage kesia teigai kemak nzwa eh, nah anui n dade anui zai yi nah ncu peu nlung nciep eh langgi kedi nzwa. Kesang. RAMPAUBE ncu samlambeu süt lie.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Cine Isaac penui ziemne hengyi ge mteilu, nah penui tyei nah sak. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Penui tingcang nuge culu nah hangge ge ngngwa samkai eh sampetlu. Ge Isaac penuide yi eh lalo gai eh, lang gidi, nah penui pecu kelamtsam di. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Cipau nai Isaac kilame gwang eh penui tekwa kui kelu ha pedage paugai. Penui rangdi, “Anui dui ngaulu da.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Pa tekwa de Shibah qulu, cine cudau de cipau namdi de Beersheba lie qu.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau mmi riakdai di ge, pa Hittitme Beeri napui Judith, nah Hittitme Elon napui Basemath de de nau luulu. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Penui Isaac penai Rebecca lung tei keherei gai.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Jacob ne Isaac samlam ngaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Pecai Isaac hecing dige pe miak siadi nah pa mangau tadi, pa pe na hecingbe Esau de qu teugwanglu, nah peda ge rangdi, “A na.” Esau pe dage rang eh, “Ih aika bam,” <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />nah Isaac rangdi, “Pielo aika, Ih au hecing dida. Ih tsai kelwadi de ci meda. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Ciziemne n reunetdung, n lakpitsi nah lakpitsibung pwa lwe, renaamkang mie a ziemne heteih kaplo. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />A ziemne Ih tyei keneube, nah kenggum taktyei ntei beulo nah cide ada pwa gwang beulo ciu eh Ih cide teilu kerane nah Ih tsaidi kemak dwa ncu samlam beulu kerane.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Cu Rebekah siulu Isaac pe napei Esau de resiu kebam dau. Esau luh ga hetei gwa kera nah cide punggwang beu kera tet petdi. <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebekah pe napei Jacob de mpau eh rangdi, “Aika pielo, n pei n swacingbe Esau de marang cu Ih siulu. Pa rangdi, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Acu makaune tei teugwang nah acu taktyei keyibe lang beulo, Ih cide tyei lwe Ih tsai kedi dwa RAMPAUBE dwade samlam pwa ncu peu zie lie.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Ciziemne cu, a na, kiengnei lu Ih ncu ajah kai kebeu de. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Hemeu hau ga mie, nah acu hemeu pelui keyi be kena teugwang beu; iciu de Ih cidung de gade n pei pa tyei neu tube taktyei keyibe lang beu zie. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Nang cide n pei da pwa gwang zie, ciu eh pa cide tyei lu kerane, iciude pa tsai kedi dwa pa pe samlam pwa ncu peu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Jacob pe pui Rebekah de rang gai, “Ainie, Esau au pemai kekie kau ge, nah Ih nduipai kecu kau ge. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Magade a pei acu tung cai, nah Ih au pe ziemne mide kecwame ge nzwa dizie. Ih samlam mene reset a dage kai gai zie.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Pe pui pedage rangdi, “A na, peu reset pelane a peu ga gwanglu. Ih kerang nzwa teilu, nah mie delwe, ada cidungde pwa gwang beulo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Cine Jacob mie lwe hemeuna pe pui da cidungde teugwang beu, nah pe pui pe pei tyei keneube taktyei keyibe lang beulu. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Rebekah pe na cingtube Esau painia peda kilungga kebam de yitubedung keulu, delwe pe henabe Jacob de peu teulu. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Pa hemeuna geu pwa peba kena nah pe ngwang pemai kegadung gage kailu. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Pa pe na Jacob de taktyei keyibe nah tangku pe ba le ru kelude de si eh pwa beu.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Jacob pe pei taiga gwang eh rangdi, “A pei.” Pe pei rang eh, “Ih aika bam; nang cau no, a na?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Jacob pe pei dage rangdi, “Ih au n neraibe Esau. Nang rang kebeu de nzwa Ih tei luda. Cu cuh ntumlu delwe Ih n ziemne pwa gwang kela hetei tyei lulo, iciu eh nang acu samlam beulu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Isaac pe napei dage rangdi, “Nang dainzwa cide ngau zette ludi ah, a na?” Pa rangdi, “Kedanemene RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang adage cide pwa gwang kebeune.” <verse eid="GEN 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaac Jacob dage rangdi, “Ada gwang nnalu, iciu eh Ih ncu tunglu kerane, a napei, nah nang a na Esau kesang mi mebi kecu cilu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Jacob pe pei Isaac da gwang, nah Isaac pecu tunggai nah rangdi, “N kwa Jacob kwa nzwa, dede n ba kena au Esau ba nzwa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Isaac pecu cilu tadi, kedanemene pe ba au pe sinabe Esau ba nzwa pemai kebamne, cine Isaac pecu samlam beudi. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Pa rang dai eh, “Nang a na Esau kesang de ni?” Pa keli eh, “Ih da.” <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Isaac rangdi, “Acu taktyei ra teugwang beulo, nah Ih n gu hetei cide tyei zie, Iciu eh Ih ncu samlam beulu kerane.” Jacob taktyei peda teugwang beu. Isaac tyeilu, nah Jacob zau de si eh pecu teugwang beu nah pa saklu. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Pecai pe pei Isaac pe dage rangdi, “Cu gwang mnalu nah acu kemam gai, a na.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Jacob gwang nnalu nah pecu kemamgai, nah pa pe paini riem nghui gai nah pecu samlam beu. Pa rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Ainie, a na riem de RAMPAUBE samlam kebeu luh riem de nzwa da.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Tinggwang de peu tinggim gade hezin kaibeu eh n luh peu yi kelube tei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">peu ncu tak nah zau keheci peu kiee süt kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Kideu ga heleuhdung de peu n kila teilu nah peu minadung de n dwa keumie kelube tei lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Nang n kibaume pelane reu di kelube tei lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">nah n pui leuhme de peu ndwa keumie kelube tei lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Ncu reset kelame de peu reset punglu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Ncu samlam kebeume de peu samlam pung kelube teilu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaac pe samlam Jacob de peu cangdi, nah Jacob tet di herizi pe pei Isaac dwade, pe swacingbe Esau hetei gwala eh gwanglu. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Pa de pe pei ziemne taktyei keyibe lang lwe cide pwa gwang beu. Pa pe pei dage rangdi, “Apei, cuh lu nah Ih ncu teugwang kebeu hetei tyei lulo, ciude nang acu samlam beulu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Pe pei Isaac pedage rangdi, “Nang cau no?” Pa keli eh, “Ih au n na, n neraibe, Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaac pepum pelane mbeu süt di nah rangdi, “Cau ah sui, mige hetei gi pung gwang acu kepeu be de? Nang kegwang dwa Ih cide pelane tyei luda, nah Ih pecu a samlam kekam be peu dida. Kesang, pa samlam beuzie.” <verse eid="GEN 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau pe pei sam siulu ge, pa hap mtei süt eh, nah pe pei dage rangdi, “A pei, acu de n samlam peulo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Isaac rangdi, “N caihereibe aika gwang acu cwa dida nah pa n samlamdung luu teu dida,” dedi. <verse eid="GEN 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau rangdi, “Pezi Jacob kecu petau lu me ni? Kedanemene pa acu cwa kedi pia pekena be dida. Pa a kecing kwa luu teudi, nah, ainie, pa cu a samlam luu teudi.” Pecai pa rang dai eh, “Nang a ziemne samlam ge de banglu me de ni?” <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaac au Esau de keli gai eh rangdi, “Ainie, Ih pecutei pwa n mpaube teibeu dida, nah Ih pe kibaume peciakne de pe kilame teibeu dida, nah Ih pecu tak zauci peu dida. Ih ma gede n ziemne teilu kebui gede ga da, a na?” <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau pe pei dage rangdi, “A pei, nang a ziemne samlam kette bamme deni? Acu samlam beulo, acu de, a pei.” Esau hap cudi. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Pe pei Isaac pecu keligai nah rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Pielo, nang kelung ni de kideu be maheidung gade mdei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">nreule ting ga hezin gade mdei dizie.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Nang n kiengtie teu eh lung zie, nah nang n caihereibe gwa teizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Dede nang n zaisia kedi dau, nang pe kengking de gileu dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Heb. 11:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jacob au Laban dage pakgai kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esau Jacob de ngkaudi kedanemene pe pei Jacob de samlam peu kedine. Esau kecet rangdi, “A pei ziemne hei eh hap kera ting nna dida; cipau cai Ih a sinabe Jacob de teitset dizie.” <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Rebecca pe cingtu napei Esau sam de ranglia beu. Cine pa Jacob pe napei henabe pei de qu eh langgai nah peda rangdi, “Ainie, n swacingbe Esau au ncu teitset kera riam eh pekatei pe lung taumla bam dida. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Cu ciziemne, a na, Ih kerang de teilu nah Haran ga a heibe, Laban da kelwa mie cu. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Cika kakge pecu ngngwa bamlu, n swacingbe rata ngkungdi kemaktane, <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />n swacingbe ncu pe rata kebamde ngkungdi kemaktane nang mdei dilu, nah nang pe dage tei kegai nsungtadi kemaktane. Iciude Ih cika de mi de ncu ngngwa dailu kera lang gai beu zie. Daitei Ih a na hang nana de tingnai ge gage deu nggah di lulai?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Rebekah Isaac dage rangdi, “Ih au lungh leu dida lie Heth napuidung ziemne. Aipau pui de nzwa, cipau deu ga mipui kesa, Jacob de Heth me pui gede luu dailu cai, Ih a teilung dai keyi ge bam lai?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Isaac Jacob de qulu, delwe pecu samlam beu, nah pecu ajah kaibeu, “Nang Canaanme pui de nau kera luu helo. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Cuhlu, Paddan Aram, ga n pui pei Bethuel ki ga miecu, delwe cikade n nau releime hang ge de luulu, n pui sinabe Laban napui hang ge de. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Kengkieng Tinggwang de peu ncu samlam beulu, delwe n name kekiee ge peulu, iciu eh nang heleuh kekiee ge pei teilu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Pecu peu Abraham samlam de ncu pwa peu kelube tei lulo, nda, nah n cai n leuhme gwang dai kerame da, iciu eh nang lungh kebam deu de gumlu kerane, Tinggwang Abraham de pwa kepeu de.” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Cine Isaac au Jacob de lang gaidi. Jacob Paddan Aram ga Arameanme Bethuel napei Laban, Jacob penai Esau pui Rebekah heibe da miedi.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Cu Isaac Jacob de samlambeu eh cika de pe nau pei kera lang pwa Paddan Aram gage langgai kedi Esau ngaulu. Pa Isaac pecu samlam kebeu ngaulu nah pecu ajah peu eh, ranggai, “Nang Canaanme pui kak de nnau luu helo.” <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Esau Jacob pe pei penai pe pui sam mzai kecu nah Paddan Aram ga mie kedi ngaulu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Esau Canaanme pui pe pei Isaac suiyi teilu kemak ngaulu. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Cine pa Ishmael da mie delwe, pa pe naudung kebam de cai, Abraham napei, Ishmael napui Mahalath, Nebaioth tipui de pe nau kera luulu.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethel gade Jacob mang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Jacob Beersheba pütdi nah Haran lam gwangdi. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Pa heni gega gwanglu nah cika tingmui pelane bamdi, kedanemene tingnaimiak nlüt kedine. Pa cipau heni de gade tangtsu ket keulu delwe pe peu kangga kailu, nah zip kerane cipau heni dega zeu mielu. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Pa pemang lam de takswa ge kideu gage tei pwa kebam ngaulu. Petün tinggim hang tung canglu delwe Tinggwang gwame cipau reuga nghang nghung bam. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Ainie, RAMPAUBE cipau reu ga saplu eh rangdi, “Ih au RAMPAUBE, n pei Abraham Tinggwang nah Isaac Tinggwang. Nang zeu kebam deu de, Ih ncu nah n leuhme de peu zie. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />N leuhme kie pwa kideu ga rebui nzwa zie, nah nang tingnaimiak kenlütle, tingnaimiak kepetle, tingtünle, nah tingbangle lam de teimdi luzie. N dade nah n leuhme dade kideu heleuh pelane de samlambeu zie. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Ainie, Ih ncu ngngwala zie, nah nang kegwang leune ga Ih ncu gum zie. Ih aipau deu gage ncu ngngwa cailigwang dai beuzie; kedanemene Ih ncu pütdi laklu. Ih n dage a sam pet kebeudung Ih pelane teibeu zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:10">Isa. 41:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Jacob pa zip kebam gade mraklu, delwe pa rang eh, “RAMPAUBE au heni aika bam kesang, nah Ih cide cilu ma.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Pa ngngi di eh rangdi, “Aipau heni de daikenzwa gede mi hingno! Cide Tinggwang ki au zie da. Cide tinggim kegwang rieki da.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Jacob tingcang nuge cuhlu nah tangtsu pa ngkum kelude keulu. Pa cide tsusum ge sumlu delwe pa maca cipau reu gage ruigai. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Pa cipau heni zi de Bethel qulu, dede cipau namdi zi de nda Luz lie la. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Jacob sampet gai eh, ranggai, “Tinggwang a beu ma aide ga acu ngngwala lie cai nah Ih tet kegwang ga acu gumbeu nah acu tangku tyei kera nah pai kai kera peu zie cai, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />Ih a pei kiga kwak eh cailigwanglu cai, iciu cai RAMPAUBE de a Tinggwang teizie. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Pecai tangtsu aide Ih sum kelude pwa ncu kerecani tei zie. Nang acu pwa kebeu keheibe gade de, Ih zikerei zige ncu peu dai bi zie.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Jacob Paddan-Aram ga gwangkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Pecai Jacob mbeuh tet sigai eh mina naimiak kepetle deudi lambie miedi. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Pa pie kegai dau, pa luh ga tekwa ge ngaulu, nah, ainie, cika cipau de ga meurünhau kecum ne twagwa bam. Kedanemene cipau tekwa gade penui meurün haudung de peu dui sakla, nah tekwa peu reu ga tangtsu kebam de au kedi ge. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Meurün hau pelane cika gwang ngkwalu ge, meurün kekwame tangtsu de letlu la delwe peu meuründung de dui sakla, nah pecai tangtsu de tekwa peu reu ga pe bam gage kai dai dila. <verse eid="GEN 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Jacob penui dage rangdi, “A zangmedung, nnui dai gade gwang no?” Penui keli eh, “Anui au Haran namdi gade.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Pa penui dage keteudi, “Nnui Nahor tsapei Laban de ci mi?” Penui keligai, “Anui pecu cibam.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Pa penuide rang dai eh, “Pa yibam mi?” Penui rangdi, “Pa yibam, nah, cika pielo, pe napui Rachel pe meurünhau de nzang eh gwangla da.” <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Jacob rangdi, “Ainie, cu ting baha di reu. Cu meurün haudung de gwang kera peting mereu. Nnui meurün de peu dui saklu maisia nah ngngwa mie delwe peu penuide cehei tyei cu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Penui rangdi, “Anui meurün haudung de dui sak kera pwa peu gailak penui peciakne gwang kemaktane. Penui tangtsu tekwa peu reu ga kebam de kela mpet luzie, nah iciulu de anui meurün hau de peu dui sak zie.” <verse eid="GEN 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Jacob penuide ngngwa marang bam kecune, Rachel pe pei meurün haudung de nzang eh gwang, kedanemene pa cidung dede pie rengei kebamne. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Jacob pe pui heipei Laban napui Rachel, nah Laban gu meurün de ngau luge, Jacob gwang eh, tangtsu de tekwa peu gade kela mpet di, nah Laban, pe pui heipei meurün hau depeu dui sak. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Jacob Rachel de kemam nah mrung eh hapdi. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Jacob au Rachel dade Ih n pei kibaume, nah pa Rebekah napei lie ranglia beu. Iciu eh pa pe pei dage paubeu kera pakgwang di.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Laban pe tipui napei Jacob ha siulu ge, pa pak pet pecu redau, pecu tuipwa lwe pecu kemam gai, nah pecu pe kilung ga ngngwa gwang. Jacob Laban dage ma aidungde pelane ranglia beu. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Laban pedage rangdi, “Nang au a teih nah ajai kesang.” Cidau Jacob kei ge kenzwa ge peda ngngwa bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Pecai Laban Jacob dage rangdi, “Nang a kibaume kecune n ziehi teimene a gwa tei bam eh ni? Ada ranggailo, n ziehi dai kenzwa ge luneu no?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Cu Laban pe napui hangna bam. Kecingbe pui zi cai Leah, nah henabe pui zi cai Rachel. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leah pe miak au mnie, dede Rachel au pe rehi de nah hezu de yi. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Jacob Rachel de pe suidi, cine pa rangdi, “Ih mmi hena Rachel ziemne n gwa teizie, n napui henabe ziemne.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Laban rangdi, “Ih pecu ncu pwa peu kelu be yiki, Ih mi kedame de pecu pwa peu kera swade. A da bam lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Cine Jacob mmi hena Rachel de luulu kerane bata tei; nah pe ziemne cipau tingde tingba zie kecam nage nzwa, pa pecu mrai kedine.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Pecai Jacob Laban dage rangdi, “Anau de acu peulo, kedanemene a tingbaziedung cang dida, iciude Ih pecu a naulu kerane!” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Cine Laban nautak ngyi ge mtei lwe heni ga mina pelane de qu hekwalu. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Cipau ziu, Laban pe napui Leah de pwa Jacob de peu, nah Jacob pecu ngngwa henau hepei zai teidi. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Laban pe kilapui Zilpah de pwa pe napui Leah kilapui tei kera peu. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Tingcang cuge, ainie, pa ngngwa kebam pui au, Leah! Jacob au Laban dage rangdi, “Nang daitei aide a dage teigai lano? Ih Rachel ziemne n bata tei me ni? Nang daitei a dade heciem tei di no?” <verse eid="GEN 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Laban rangdi, “Neraibe pui dwa henabe pui depeu mmeu di kera anui zai melie. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Aipau napui nautak ngyi de teicanglu nah anui ncu kedabe pui dede peuzie, nang a ziemne mmi keda hena ge bata tei daicai.” <verse eid="GEN 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Jacob cide kesamdaulu, nah Leah nautak ngyi teicanglu. Pecai Laban pe napui Rachel de pwa pe nau kera pecu pwapeu. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Laban pe kilapui Bilhah de pwa pe napui Rachel dede pe kila tei kera pwapeu. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Cine Jacob Rachel de de ngngwa henau hepei zai teidi, dede pa Leah swa Rachel de ku ki. Cine Jacob mmi hena Laban ta teidai.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jacob namedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />RAMPAUBE Leah de ku kemak ngaulu, cine pa pecu hena lunghlu kera teibeu, dede Rachel pena tei mene bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leah tetlak lu nah mipeina ge mnalu, nah pa pezi Reuben msiaklu. Kedanemene pa rangdi, “Kedanemene RAMPAUBE a lungrei ngau kelune; kesang cu au a nahpei acu ku zieda.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Pecai pa tetlak dailu nah mipeina ge mnalu. Pa rangdi, “Kedanemene RAMPAUBE acu qu kemak siulu, ciziemne pa acu mipeina aide dede peu da,” nah pa pe zi Simeon msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Pecai pa tetlak dailu nah mipeina ge mnalu. Pa rangdi, “Henaipia au a nahpei acu pesuiki di lubui da, kedanemene Ih pecu mipei hangcum mna beu di delu.” Cine pezi Levi lie msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Pa tetlak dailu nah mipeina ge mnalu. Pa rangdi, “Henaipia Ih RAMPAUBE de twa zie.” Ciziemne pa pezi Judah msiaklu; pecai pa pena lungh si tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:2">Mat. 1:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Rachel pa hena mna pwa Jacob de peulu kemak ngau luge, Rachel pe swacingbe puide ngau pe riakdi. Pa Jacob dage kiedi, “Acu hena peulo, maige Ih tsai dizie.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Jacob Rachel de pe ratadi. Pa rangdi, “Ih Tinggwang sap ga sap bamni, pane ncu n na lunglu kebui kaam pwabam.” <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Pa rangdi, “Ainie, cika a kilapui Bilhah bam. Pecu ngngwa zeulu, iciude pa a ziemne hename ge lungh beuzie, nah Ih peda de hename lungh luzie.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Cine pa Bilhah pe kilapui de pe nahpei de nau nzwa pwa peu, nah Jacob pecu ngngwa henau tei kera hepei zai teidi. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Bilhah tetlak lu nah mipeina ge Jacob de mnabeu. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Pecai Rachel rangdi, “Tinggwang a lam pwa beuda, nah pa a kwa siu luda nah acu mipeina ge peuda.” Aide ziemne pa pezi Dan msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bilhah, Rachel kilapui, tetlak dailu nah Jacob de mipeina pe kena be mnabeu. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Rachel rangdi, “Ih a swakecingbe pui de ngngwa hereu kehung ge teida nah Ih ne ngkieng luda.” Pa pezi Naphtali msiaklu.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Leah pa pena lung si takedi ngaulu ge, pa pe kilapui Zilpah de pwa pecu Jacob nau tei kera peu. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilpah, Leah kilapui, Jacob de mipeina ge mna beu. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leah rangdi, “Ih raci da!” Cine pa pe zi Gad msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Pecai Zilpah, Leah kilapui, Jacob de mipeina pe kenabe mna beu. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leah rangdi, “Ih a suiyi bam! Kedanemene mipuidung acu suiyi lie qu zieda.” Cine pa pezi Asher msiaklu.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Wheat luhlüt tingdau Reuben luh ga mie nah hekuhei ngaulu. Pa teugwang pe pui Leah de peu. Pecai Rachel Leah dage rang eh, “Acu n na gu hekuheidung kesa peulo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Leah pedage rangdi, “N ziemne cide ma keceu nage ni, nang a nahpei de teu tetdi kecu de? Nang cu au a napei gu hekuhei de keuteu di neu la reu ni?” Rachel keli eh, “Nang heziu pecu ngngwa zeu lubui, n na gu hekuheidung peu cai.” <verse eid="GEN 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Jacob tinghegi luh gade gwang. Leah pet pecu redau lwe ranggai, “Nang ada gwang maisia, Ih ncu a na gu hekuheidung le luilu delu.” Cine cipau ziu Jacob Leah de ngngwa zeudi. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Tinggwang Leah kekie kingneilu, nah pa tetlak lu nah Jacob de mipeina pe mengei be mnabeu. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leah rangdi, “Tinggwang acu a ziehi peu da, kedanemene Ih a kilapui de a nahpei de kepeune.” Pa pezi Issachar msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Leah tetlak dailu nah Jacob de mipeina pe herok be mnabeu. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Leah rangdi, “Tinggwang acu mapeu keyi peu da. Cu au a nahpei acu rütlu zieda, kedanemene Ih pecu mipeina hang herok mnabeu di delu.” Pa pe zi Zebulun msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Pecai pa mipuina ge mnalu nah pezi Dinah msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Tinggwang Rachel de nsunglu eh qu nah pe kekie teibeu. Pa pecu pe na lunglu kebui teibeu. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Pa tetlak lu nah mipeina ge mnabeu. Pa rang eh, “Tinggwang a ngam keugidi beuda.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Pa pe zi Joseph de qulu, rang eh, “RAMPAUBE acu mipeina keda ge peudai kelu tei luda.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jacob pe mabam mmipet kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Rachel Joseph de mna kelu cai, Jacob Laban dade rangdi, “Acu peu tetlu culo, iciu eh Ih akatei a ki ga nah a deudi ga gwang dailu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Ih nta tei eh hikelu a nau kena nah a name de acu peu culo, nah acu peu tetdi culo, kedanemene Ih daikenzwa ge n ta teigwang bi nang cibam.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Laban pedage rangdi, “Cu Ih ndwa gade n suiyi teilu lie cai, kwalu, kedanemene Ih rabe kilam de n ziemne RAMPAUBE acu samlam kebeu ci luda.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Pecai pa rangdi, “N ziehidung ranggai lo, nah Ih cidung de peu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Jacob pedage rangdi, “Ih daikenzwa ge n ta tei bi nah n gu makaunedung daikenzwa ge yilu di bi kecu nang cibam. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Kedanemene Ih kegwang dwa nang kecam nage kebam de, lung ngkie süt luda. RAMPAUBE Ih ketei leu ga ncu samlam beu da. Cu daidau ne Ih a kilungme ma de pie lai?” <verse eid="GEN 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Cine Laban rangdi, “Ih ncu dai peu lai?” Jacob rangdi, “Nang acu magede peu lak. Nang a ziemne aide teibeu cai, Ih n kaunedung de rengei nah pie dailu zie. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Acu peu henai n kauhaudung da mie, delwe meurün na kak ga ketiak be leune nah hemeudung kak de pegiak kepungbe leune keulu. Cidung de a ziehidung da. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />A masang de ne pecai a zierang tei beu zie, nang gwang a ziehidung pie kecu dau. Hemeudung kak de pelane pegiak pung kemak be gede ga cai, nah meuründung kak de tiak kemakbe gede bam eh ada ngaulu cai, rega teu kedi gage kaidi zie.” <verse eid="GEN 30:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Laban rangdi, “Petauda. Nang kerang de nzwa tei luzie.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Cipau nai Laban hemeuseudung pegiak kebam be, nah hemeupuidung pegiak tau kecube nah kedau kecu bedung, keha tau pwa kebam pelane, nah meuründung kak de ketiakbe pelane keuntsam mpetdi, delwe cidungde pe namedung ba gage pwa peu di. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Laban langcum ne mbeu dei ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Langcum ne mbeu dei ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">60 mile/90 kilometer </char></note> pe dade nah Jacob da de kailu. Ciu eh Jacob Laban kaune hau kebangbedung de rengei eh bamdi.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Jacob dang mnwa kelu poplar nah almond kiak kemdiakdung nah tsingbang keda kiakdung keu lwe pegeu kesa siep gidi, delwe tsingkiak cidung de ga keha giakdung teilu. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Pecai pa tsingkiak pa siep keludung de makaune hau dwa gade kailu, penui sak kera kegwang dui kesak kwakdung dwa gage. Penui dui sak kera kegwang dau penui kerehala kecune. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Makau haudung tsingkiakdung dwa gade halu; nah makau haudung pe na kedau nah pegiak ketei bedung lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Jacob meurünna aidungde kedet tsamlu, dede penuide peu Laban kaunedung pegiak kepung nah meurün hau ketiak bedung lam nreu eh kainzeu. Iciu eh pa pe kauhau pekatei ziemne keutsam eh pielu nah Laban kaune dade keu ncüt mene keutsamlu. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Meurün keyibedung ha kebam dau, Jacob tsingkiakdung pwa penui dwa ga dui sak kwakdung gage kaibeu, iciu eh penuide peu tsingkiakdung kakga de mciulu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Dede makaune kemneibedung kegwang dau, pa makaune kemneibedung dwaga tsingkiakdung pwa gai ma. Cine Laban gu kaunedung mneidi, nah Jacob gu kaunedung be yi ngkieng di. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Minabe de mahei süt petdi. Pa hekaune haudung, kilame pui nah kilame pei, nah utdung nah gadadung kekieege bamdi.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Jacob au Laban dade pakkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Cu Jacob Laban name samdung siu lu, penui rang kebam de, “Jacob ne anui pei gu pelane keu teu dida, nah anui pei mabamdung gade pa mahei aide pelane ngaulu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Jacob Laban zu gade ngau lu. Pa pezai pereli peda de tsam kedi ngau lu. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Jacob dage rangdi. “N pei me deu ga nah n kibaume da cailigwang lu, nah Ih ncu ngngwa la zie.” <verse eid="GEN 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Jacob sam langgai nah qugai Rachel nah Leah de luh gage pegu kauhau kebam gage <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />nah penai dage ranggai, “N nai pei adwa gade pezai tsam kedi Ih ngau dida, dede a pei gu Tinggwang acu ngngwa la. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Nnai cibam Ih a kengkieng pelane teu nnai pei gwa tei gwang kecu. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Nnai pei acu cwa dida nah a ziehidung pia kerei ge tei kedi, dede Tinggwang pecu peu acu tei rejam di ma. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Pa rang cai, ‘Hekaune kedaube n ziehidung zie,’ pecai makaune hau pelane pena kedaube lungh beu. Pa rang cai, ‘Pegiak kepungbe n ziehidung zie,’ pecai makaune hau pelane pena pegiak kepungbe lungbeu. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Ainzwa eh Tinggwang n pei gu hekaune haudung keulu delwe cidung de acu pwa peu dida. <verse eid="GEN 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Piage kemciu tingdau, Ih amang ge gade ngau hemeuseudung hekaunehau de hakebam. Hemeuseudung de kedau, nah pegiak pung. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Tinggwang gwame a mang lede adage ranggai, ‘Jacob.’ Ih ranggai, ‘Aika Ih bam.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Pa rangdi, ‘Ngang cuhlu delwe pielo hemeuseudung pelane makaune hau de mciu kebamdung de. Cidungde kedau, nah pegiak pung, kedanemene Ih Laban n dage teigai kebamdung pelane ngau bamdi delu. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ih au Bethel Tinggwang, nang cika tsusum ge maca keniaklu, cika nang a dage sampet gai. Cuge cuhlu nah hangdeu aika de tetcu nah ncu mna kelu deu ga cailigwang daicu.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gen. 28:18-22 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Rachel nah Leah keli gai nah pedage rang, “Cika magede bam mi mede hema gum kera anai pei ki ga anai ziemne? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Pa anaide pwa mapei melui ni sangme nzwa? Kedanemene pa anaide zwa nah anai rangkang de tei cio dida. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Maheidung pelane Tinggwang ne anai pei dade keuteu kedidung de anui gu nah anui namedung gu dida cu. Cu ciciu cai, Tinggwang n dage rangkebeu nzwa, tei lulo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Pecai Jacob cuhlu nah pe name nah penau kena de utdung reu gage kai lu. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Pa pe makaune hau pelane de pedwa ge kailu, pe mabam pelane de keulu, pa Paddan Aram gade ngaukelu kaune hau de si eh. Pecai pa Canaan deu ga pepei Isaac da mie kera tetgai. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Laban pe meurün mai biet kera miekedi dau, Rachel pe pei gu pe kelak rabedung regalu. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Jacob de Aramme pei Laban de cwa di, pa tetdi lau delie kecu pecu recigai kemak gade. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Cine pa pegu ma kebambe pelane teu eh pakdi nah kelwa eh kereuki ka lu, nah hangdeutu Gilead deudi lamge tet gaidi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laban ne Jacob de zuikemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Lang cumne benai Jacob pak di lie kecu Laban dage rang beu. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Cine pa pe minadung de ngngwalu pa nah pecu zui eh lang henane mbeu. Gilead deudi hangdeutu gade pa pecu canglu. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Cu Tinggwang Aramme pei Laban da tingmui pemang lam de gwanglu delwe pedage rangdi, “Nang sünne lu Jacob dage rang kera keyi liede mede kesia.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Laban Jacob dwa railu. Cu Jacob hangdeutu deudi gage pe paiki limlu. Laban pe kibaume de ngngwa hangdeutu deudi Gilead ga ramzeuki teilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa keheci laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">Laban de ramzeuki lamlwa deudi gu Gilead ga teilu</char> </note> <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Laban Jacob dage rangdi, “Nang daipai teidi no, nang acu cwadi nah a napui kenade hereu gade tui kelume nzwa nzang tetdi kecu? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Nang daitei mlei mene pakdi no nah acu cwa no nah acu ranglia meno? Ih ncu ngngwa renga eh langgai zie nage nah leidung tei eh, tambourine kwa eh nah leibungdung kwa eh. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Nang daitei acu peu a tsame de nah a napui kena de de yi eh lalo de kemam kera ha meno? Cu nang kemie ta ge tei dida. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Ncu tei keherei lu kera a kengkieng ga bam, dede nzieziu n pei Tinggwang acu resiu eh rangdi, ‘Nang Jacob dage keyibe liede mede kesiabe rang kecu sünne lu.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Cu nang tetdi da kedanemene nang n pei kiga gwang dai neu zu kedine. Dede nang daitei a rabedung de rega teu di no?” <verse eid="GEN 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Jacob keligai delwe Laban dage ranggai, “Ih mbai tetdi, kedanemene Ih au hing di nah cet kecu nang adade n napui kenade ketang eh luu teu daidi kera. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Caubene n rabedung de rega teudibi ring si eh bam lakta. Anui kibaumedung kebam gade, n gu lie keladung de ada kebambe piee lu nah keu lu.” Kedanemene Jacob au Rachel ne cidungde rega teu kela ci ma.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Laban mie Jacob paiki ga, Leah paiki ga, nah kilapui kena paiki ga, dede pa ngau lu ma cidungde. Pa Leah gu paiki gade mpetlu nah Rachel paiki ga lüt. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Cu Rachel pe kelak rabedung keulu, ut püt pai gage cidung de kailu, nah cipau reu ntumbam lu. Laban paiki pelane kecung, dede cidungde ngau luma. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Pa pe pei dage rang eh, “A mpaubo, n rata di helo, Ih ndwa ga sap gai lakta, kedanemene Ih au mipui zai tei bam lu.” Cine pa kecung dede pe kelak rabedung ngaulu ma.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Jacob perata di nah Laban de ngngwa repiadi. Pa pedage rang eh, “Ih daipai teimau dino? A kemau dai no, iciu eh nang acai n rata süt eh zui mie la kecu? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Kedanemene nang a mabamdung pelane kecung gwang ciau da. N kelak gu pelane gade daipai ngau lu di no nang? A kibaume dwa aika ge cidungde kaigai lo, iciude penui anai hangna kak ga tiaklu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Kedanemene Ih ncu ngngwa mmi ngkai ge lung dida. N meurünpuidung nah n meupuidung hing raudi ma, mede Ih n kaunehau gade meurünseuna gede dap tyei ma. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Teikuudung ne teurak kedi dung Ih nda ga teugwang la ma. Meliene, Ih ne punglu la ngkap kedi cide. Ga kedi kaune leune ziemne nang peu acu su mui la, tingkeba dau rega teu kedidung liede mede tingmui dau rega teu kedidung de. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ih cika bam eh; tingna dau kelum ne acu tei keherei, nah tingmui regeu eh; nah Ih ziplu tadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Mmi ngkai ge Ih n kelak da la. Ih nziemne matei mmi kereiemdai n napui kena ziemne, nah mmi herok n kaune hau ziemne. Nang a ziehidung pia kerei ge tei kedi di. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />A peime Tinggwang de, Abraham Tinggwang de, nah Isaac hing kelabe de, acu ngngwa bam mecai, nang acu mta lang gidi bi zie da cu. Tinggwang a rei nah Ih dainzwa laikai tei eh heta teibi ngaulu da, nah nzie ziu pa ncu kesiu gai da.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Laban keligai nah Jacob dage rang, “Cipau napuidung de anapuidung da, cipau tsamedung de a tsamedung da, nah cipau hekaune haudung de a kaune haudung da. Nang ngau kebamdung pelane de agu. Dede Ih henai daipai tei lubui no a napuidung aidungde dage, mede penui dade lung kelu penui namedung dage? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Cine cu, kesamting keluge teilu go lie, nang nah Ih, nah peu cide zierang ge teilu anai kakga” <verse eid="GEN 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Cine Jacob tangtsu ge keulu delwe cide tsusum ge kera sumlu. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Jacob pe kibaume dage rang, “Tangtsudung hekwalu.” Cine penui tangtsudung pwalu nah tsukwa ge tei gai. Pecai penui tsukwa taiga de matyeilu. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laban cide Jegar Saha Dutha msiak lu, dede Jacob cide Galeed msiak lu. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Laban rangdi, “Aipau tsukwa de anai kakga henai zierang ge.” Ciziemne cipau zi de Galeed qudi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Cide dede Mizpah lie de qula, kedanemene Laban rangdi, “Anai hange ge dade lamna kedi gade RAMPAUBE de peu anai mapie la lulo. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Nang a napui kena dade nzai sia cai, mede nang nnau keda a napui caide lu cai, migede anai tai ga bam meliede, pielo, Tinggwang anai kakga ngau bamlie.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Laban Jacob dage rangdi, “Aipau tsukwa de pie lo, nah anai kakga Ih kwa kelu, tsusum de pie lo. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Aipau tsukwa de au zierang ketei ge nah tsusum de au zierang ketei ge lie, aipau tsukwa de gwale Ih nda kahpet kelak, nah nangde aipau tsukwa de nah tsusum de gwale ada kahpet kelak, gwaketang kera. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Peu Abraham Tinggwang de, nah Nahor tinggwang de, penui peime tinggwang de, anai kak hetutiak zie.” Jacob pe pei Isaac Hing kela zi gade sampetlu. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Jacob lamlwatu reu gade ratak teigai beu nah pe kibaume de ketaktyei kera qu gai. Penui tyeilu nah lamlwatu gade tingmuiziu pelane penui ting ngngwanglu. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Tingcang nuge Laban cuh lwe, pe tsame nah pe napui kena de kemam gai nah penuide samlam gai beu. Pecai Laban tetdi delwe kilung cailigwangdi.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Jacob Esau de redau kera mteikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Jacob pe lampui ga tetla ge, Tinggwang gu tinggimgwame pecu redau lu. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Jacob penuide ngaulu ge, pa rangdi, “Aide au Tinggwang rezeuki,” cine pa heni cide de Mahanaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahanaim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ramzeuki kena </char></note> lie qulu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Jacob samgwame de pedwa lang nswagai pe swakecingbe Esau dage Edom cuikui ga, Seir deu gage. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Pa penuide aja kaibeu, rang eh, “Nnui a mpaube Esau dage ainzwa rang zie: N kilabe Jacob ainzwa rangla: ‘Ih Laban da lungh bamla, nah cu kecang la eh Ih cailigwang ridi da. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Ih ketumseu, gadadung, nah meurün haudung, nah kilamepeidung nah kilamepuidung bam. Ih a mpaube dage sam aide langgai di, ciude Ih n dwa gade suiyi ngaulu kerane.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Samgwame Jacob da cailigwang lu nah rang, “Anui nsinabe Esau da mieda. Pa ncu redau kera gwang la, nah mina hai mdai ge pecu ngngwa la.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Iciu eh Jacob ngngi süt di nah pelung keherei di. Cine pa mina pecu ngngwa kelame de ramzeuki zina gage nzi gai, nah meurün haudung, ketumhaudung, nah utdung de si eh. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Pa rang eh, “Magade Esau ramzeuki ge ga gwang nah cide de ketang cai, iciu cai ramzeuki kedabe kebamde pakdi zie.” <verse eid="GEN 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Jacob kie eh, “A pei Abraham Tinggwang, nah a pei Isaac Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE, ada rang kebeube, ‘N deudi ga nah n kibaume da cailigwang lulo, nah Ih ncu tei hei beuzie,’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Nang nta keyi leune samkak kelu kesamsangbe nah makesangbe leune n kilabe ziemne tei kegai de Ih au ngaulu dui lie. Kedanemene Ih a tuiting rünne pwalwe Jordan aide kah mpet, nah cu Ih au ramzeuki kena bam dida. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Kehereide acu a swacingbe ba gade kelibeu lo, Esau ba gade, kedanemene Ih pecu hing kedine, pa gwang eh acu nah mipuidung hena ngngwa kebamme de ketang zie kecune. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Dede nang rang, ‘Ih ncu ma pelane keyi be tei beu bi zie. Ih n leuhmedung de jaaidi kung ga heciangdung kieege nzwa peu zie, penui kieezu eh pei kapgai kelak ge.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Jacob cipau ziu cika bamlu. Pa pwalu ma kesa peda kebam be Esau ziemne mapeu ge, pe swacingbe: <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />hemeupuidung haina nah hemeuseudung ngkai, meurünpuidung haina nah meurünseu ngkai, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />petung tuilu kebam utdung camrei nah pe nadung, ketumdung riakdai nah ketumseu kerei, gadapuidung ngkai nah gadaseudung kerei. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Aidungde pa pe kilamedung ba gage kai beu, makaunehau leune kecu ket ket eh. Pa pe kilame dage rang, “A dwa mrai gwangcu nah makaunehaudung ramsang kakga heni kaizeu lu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Pa kilabe keraibe de rangbeu, rang eh, “A swacingbe Esau nnuide redaukelu dau nah nnuide keteucu dau, rang eh, ‘Nang cau dade gwang no? Nnui daiga gwang lau no? Nnui dwa ga makaune kela aidung de caugu no?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Pecai nnui rang zie, ‘Penui au n kilabe Jacob gu. Cidung de mapeu ge a mpaube Esau de langgai beula. Pielo, pa de anui cai ga gwang lalei.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Jacob sam peugai maa kenabe dage de, kecum be, nah makaunehau de nzang kelame mina pelane de. Pa rangdi, “Nnui nu de nzwa rang zie Esau dage nnui pecu redaulu de. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Nnui, ‘N kilabe Jacob anui cai na ga lada’” dede rang maisia. Kedanemene pa kecet, “Ih mapeu aidung pwa a dwa lang gai nswa eh Ih pe suiyi tei luzie. Pecai, Ih pecu ngau lu de, pa acu ngngwa luzie ha.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Cine mapeu aidung de pedwa lang nswagai. Cipau ziu pa pekatei ramzeuki ga bamdi.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jacob Tinggwang de hepwakepwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Tingmui dau Jacob cuhlu, nah pe nau kena, pe kilapui kena, nah pe na kereieket de pa ngngwalu. Pa penui de langgai di Jabbok reuki kahkepetle ge. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Ainzwa eh pa penuide reuceuna kahkepetle pe mabamdung pelane de si eh langgaidi. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Jacob pekatei bamdi cika, nah mige gwang tingba ra kecang pecu ngngwa renia. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mina be pecu canggai kelak pa ngaudi ge, pa Jacob keling kepeugai. Jacob keling mpetdi pa pecu ngngwa renia kecudau. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Mina be rangdi, “Acu peu tetdi lulo, tingba gwang di zeu delu.” Jacob rangdi, “Nang acu samlambeu kemaktane Ih ncu peu tetdi lak.” <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Mina be pe dage rangdi, “N zi cauno?” Jacob ranggai, “Jacob.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Mina be rangdi, “N zi Jacob lie qu si lak ta, dede Israel. Kedanemene nang Tinggwang nah minadung de ngngwa renia nah ngkienglu delu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Jacob pecu keteu, “Keherei de acu n zi rang lia lo.” Pa rangdi, “Nang daitei a zi keteu au no?” Pecai cika de pa pecu samlambeu. <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Jacob heni zi Peniel qulu kedanemene pa rangdi, “Ih Tinggwang de kezumok eh ngau da, nah a teilung kelibeu da.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Jacob Peniel gade tet kegai dau tingnaimiak petdi. Pe keling li kedine pa telwadi. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Ciziemne cukecang de Israelme na ngkwa nnieria tyei la ma ngkwa tai kebam de, kedanemene mige ne cipau nnieria de tei rejamdi Jacob ngkwa tei nua kecu dau.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Jacob Esau de keredau kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Jacob ngang cuh piegai eh, ainie, Esau mina hai mdai de nzang eh gwangla. Jacob hename de Leah, Rachel, nah kilamepui kena kakga mzilu. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Pecai pa kaibeu kilamepui kena nah penai name de kerai gage, pecia be Leah nah pe name, nah pecia be Rachel nah Joseph kamtu gage. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Pa pekatei penui dwa rai gwang. Pa pe swacingbe de nna gwanglu kemaktane, pa hangdeu ga pia hena keumie. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Esau pecu redau kera pak gwang, pecu tuilu, pe ngwang tuilu delwe kemam gai. Ciu eh penai hapdi. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau ngang cuh pie kegaidau, pa mipuidung nah hename de ngaulu. Pa rangdi, “Ncu ngngwa keladung de caudung no?” Jacob keligai, “Tinggwang pe zaiyi eh n kilabe de kepeu hename lie.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Pecai kilamepuidung penui name de ngngwa gwang, nah penui keumie. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Pecai Leah nah pe name gwang eh keumie. Kamtu be Joseph penai Rachel gwang eh keumie. <verse eid="GEN 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau rangdi, “Ih keredau kecu maa aidung leune pekie dai no?” Jacob rangdi, “Ih a mpaupei dwade pe suiyi tei lu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Esau rangdi, “Ih bam süt, a caihereibo. Nang kebam be nziemne kaizeu lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Jacob rangdi, “Lak, kehereide, magade Ih n dwa de n suiyi tei lu ni, ciucai a ba gade a mapeu de luulu lo, kedanemene, Ih n zu ngauda, nah cide au Tinggwang zu kengau nzwa da, nah nang acu nsuilu da. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Kehereide a mapeu nda teugwang kebeu de luulu, kedanemene Tinggwang adade pe zaiyi eh, nah kedanemene Ih teu mai kesia leune bam.” Ciu eh Jacob pecu peu bi di nah Esau cide luulu. <verse eid="GEN 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Pecai Esau rangdi, “Anui tet kera mteilu cu go. Ih nnui cai suilu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Jacob pe dage rangdi, “A mpaupei hename mnei kecu cibam, nah meurün nah hetum penui nadung de peu tung kebam de. Penui de tingnai ge gage gwa mteigai cai, makaune pelane tsai di zie. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Kehereide a mpaube de peu pe kilame dwa nswa mie lo. Ih tei sünne eh tet gwang zie, hekaune a dwa kela de nzang eh, nah hename de nzang eh, Seir ga a mpaube da Ih gwang canglu kemaktane.” <verse eid="GEN 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau rang eh, “Peu a mina kang ge acu ngngwa kelame n dage kaidiak lo.” Dede Jacob keli eh, “Daitei cide tei lai? Peu acu a mpaube dwade pesuiyi teilo.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Cine cipau nai Esau au Seir ga cailigwang kera pa tetcuh gai. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Dede Jacob Succoth ga mbeu mie, pekatei ki ge teilu, nah pe kaunedung ziemne kemtak ki teilu. Ciziemne heni zi de Succoth lie qudi.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Jacob Paddan Aram gade gwang keladau, pa Canaan deu ga kebam, Shechem namdi ga kwak eh gwanglu. Pa namdi taiga ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Pecai pa hangdeu keceuna ge rangkanggeu haige le lui lu, Shechem pei, Hamor napeidung dade, cikage pa pe ramzeuki tei lu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joh 4:5, Bat 7:16 </char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu ket de renaam ga mata keteime ziemne tingnai ge ziehi da.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Pa cika ge recabam ge teilu nah cide EI Elohe Israel msiaklu.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dinah nah Shechemme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Mmi kekiee ge cai, langnai ge Dinah, Leah napui pa ne Jacob de mna kebeube de, cipau deu ga releimedung de dau kera mie. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Hivitme pei Hamor napei Shechem, cipau deu ga hegwangpei, pecu ngaulu. Pa pecu kerak lu delwe pecu teudi, nah pa pecu tei msiadi. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Pa Dinah, Jacob napui de pesui di. Pa releipui de mraidi nah pecu kia teune gai. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Shechem pe pei Hamor de resiu, ranggai, “Releipui aipaude de a nau kera a ziemne lubeu lo.” <verse eid="GEN 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Cu Jacob pe napui Dinah de pa ne tei msia kedi ci lu. Pe name pe kaunedung de ngngwa luh ga la, cine Jacob penui cailigwang kemakta ma ge de tei ma. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Shechem pei Hamor Jacob de ngngwa mpau kerane peda mie. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Jacob napeimedung cipau ha de siulu ge penui luh gade cailigwanglu. Cipaudung de penui sui tadi. Penui rata süt di kedanemene pa Israel de kemneu ta tei eh Jacob napui de teudi kecune, kedanemene ci kenzwa ta teidi kerabe ma kecune. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamor penui de ngngwa kempau, ranggai, “A na Shechem n napui de mrai lie. Kehereide pecu penau kera peu lo. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Anuide ngngwa keleilwet lo, anuide nnui napuidung de peu lo, nah anui napuidung de luulu lo nnui ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Nnui anuide ngngwa lunghlu zie, nah hangdeu lungh keneu ga nnui lungh lubui nah heli tei, nah hema gum lubui.” <verse eid="GEN 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Shechem pe pei dage nah pe heime dage ranggai, “Peu acu nnui suiyi tei lo, nah nnui acu rang kebeube keheibe de Ih nnui de peu zie. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Nnui mta ma lu keneu be adade kielu lo nah henau mibe nnui tei hung keneuta hung lulo, nah nnui ada rang kebeu keheibe Ih peu zie, dede releipui de a nau kera acu peu lo.” <verse eid="GEN 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Shechem penui tipui Dinah de tei hera kedi ziemne, Jacob napeimedung Shechem nah pe pei Hamor de cwa eh penui sam keligai. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Penui penai dage rang, “Anui aide tei gailak, anui tipui de hegeurumlu kemakme ge de peu kera; kedanemene anui ziemne cide hengam ge zielu. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Anui nnuide ngngwa kesamdau lu zie aide rünne gade: Magade nang anui nzwa eh hegeurumlu cai, nnui kakga mipeime leune de hegeurumlu cai. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Pecai anui anui napuidung de nnuide peu zie, nah anui ziemne anui nnui napuidung de luu luzie, nah anui nnui de ngngwa ket tei eh lungh zie. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Dede magade nnui anui kerang de mzai lu mecai nah hegeurumlu mecai ge, iciu cai anui anui tipui de ngngwa lwe tetdi zie.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Penui samdung Hamor nah pe napei Shechem pesui di. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Shechem penui rang kegai de zette tei lu, kedanemene pa Jacob napui de mrai ham kedine, nah kedanemene pa au pe pei kilungme leune kak de mina nlangtu be kecune. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamor nah pe napei Shechem penai namdi rieki ga mie nah penai namme de ngngwa kempau eh, ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Mina aidungde anuide ngngwa kezuyi bam, cine penuide peu hangdeu aika lungh nah heli tei lu, kedanemene kesang, hangdeu di süt bam lu penui ziemne. Anui penui napuidung anui naudung kera luulu go lie, nah anui anui napuidung de penuide peu go lie. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Aipau kiede rünne gade penui anuide ngngwa lung zie lie zeu nah ngngwa heleuh ge teilu kera: Magade anui kakga mipeina leune hegeurum lucai, penui geurum kelu nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Penui kaunedung nah penui mabam, penui kaunedung peciakne anui gu lak ni? Cine anui penui de ngngwa kesamdau lu go, iciu de penui anui kakga ngngwa lungh zie.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Namdi ga mina peciakne Hamor nah pe napei Shechem kerang de kesamdaulu. Mipei peciakne de hegeurumlu. <verse eid="GEN 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Hegeurum kelu lang pekecum benai, penui teei eh kebam dau, Jacob napei kena (Simeon nah Levi, Dinah heibe kena), penai hangege kecu pe kingtie pwalu delwe penai namdi cide kwak bilu builie kebam dede gwaketangdi, nah penai mipeinadung peciakne de teitset di. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Penui Hamor nah pe napei Shechem de kingtie le teitsetdi. Penui Shechem ki gade Dinah de ngngwa lwe tetdi. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Jacob napeimedung kedame ketsai paaudung ga gwang nah namdi de ngkapdi, kedanemene minadung penui tipui de hengam keteine. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Penui keuteudi penui meurün haudung, penui tum haudung, penui gadadung, nah namdi ga kebam leune nah twagwa kebam luh ga <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />penui mabam pelane. Penui name nah penui naudung peciakne de, penui tuilu. Penui kilung ga kebam pelane keu tetdi. <verse eid="GEN 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Jacob Simeon nah Levi dage rang, “Nnai lungrei ada teugwang beu da, hangdeu aika lunghkebamme de peu acu ngkau kera, Canaanme nah Perizzitme. Ih mina kekie ga. Penui peciakne ma ge tei lwe ngkwalu acu renia kera nah acu ketang cai, ciucai Ih ngkap dizie, Ih nah a kelak de.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Dede Simeon penai Levi rangdi, “Helipui ge de ngngwa kecu nzwa Shechem de peu anui tipui de ngngwa bam zie ni?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Jacob Bethel ga cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Tingbazie kiee kemak cai Tinggwang Jacob dage rangbeu, “Cuhlu, Bethel ga mie cu, delwe cika gwang lungh dilu. Cika ge recabam ge Tinggwang, nang n swacingbe Esau dade pak ketet dau ncu peu ngaukegai be de tei pwa peulo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gen. 28.20-22 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Pecai Jacob pe kilungme nah pecu ngngwa kela peciakne dage ranggai, “Sangme rabedung nnui kak kebam de keu gidilu, nnui de teimci lu, nah nnui nia kedi dilu. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Pecai anui aika pütdi eh Bethel ga mie cu go. Cika de Ih Tinggwang, a lungrei ting dau acu ngha kebeube, nah Ih kemie leuga acu ngngwa kelabe de recabam ge tei beuzie.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Cine penui sangme rabedung pelane penui ba ga keladung de, nah penui nli kela nlidung pwa Jacob de peudi. Jacob cidung de Shechem taiga mhu bang kang gage kungdi. <verse eid="GEN 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Penui tetla kecudau, penuide twagwa kebam namdidung da Tinggwang nggi süt kecu teu gwang, cine minadung Jacob namedung de zui ma. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Cine Jacob Luz de qukela heni (cide, Bethel) ga gwang lu, Canaanme deu ga kebam ga, pa nah mina pelane pecu ngngwa kelame. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Pa cika recabam ge teilu nah heni cide de EI Bethel lie qulu, kedanemene cika de Tinggwang pecu peu ngaukegai ne, pa pe swacingbe dade pak kela dau. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Rebekah ngkwetpui, Deborah, tsaidi. Pecu pwa Bethel ngkang lebie mhu bang kang gage kungdi, cine cipau zi de Allon Bakuth msiaklu.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Cidau Jacob Paddan Aram gade cailigwanglu ge, Tinggwang pecu peu ngau dai nah pecu samlam beu. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Tinggwang pe dade rangdi, “N zi au Jacob, dede n zi Jacob qu si lak ta. N zi Israel zie da.” Cine Tinggwang pe zi Israel msiak beu. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Tinggwang pedade rangdi, “Ih au Kengkieng Tinggwang. N name kekiee lunghlu eh lungh hinglu. Heleuh ge nah heleuh maadung ge n dade lungh gwang zie, nah n leuhmedung kak ga hegwangmedung bam zie. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Ih Abraham nah Isaac de kepeube deu de, Ih ncu peu zie. Ih n cai n leuhmedung dede hangdeu de pwa peu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Tinggwang pedade nghang di pa pecu mpau kecu heni de gade. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Jacob Tinggwang pecu mpau kecu heni de gage tsusum ge, tangtsu tsusum ge sumlu. Pa cipau tsusum reu gage zau reca ruigai nah cika ge maca ruigai. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Jacob Tinggwang pecu ngngwa mpau kecu heni de zi Bethel msiaklu.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rachel penai Isaac tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Penui Bethel gade tetcuh dai. Penui Ephrath namdi gade mdeila reu kecune, Rachel mna hi cang gwangdi. Pa keherei sütdi. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Pa keherei sütdi kecudau, hena tei kemnapui pe dage rang, “Ngngi di so, kedanemene cu nang mipeina keda ge lungh luzie.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Pa tsai laizeudi, pe ngyi tüt kemiedau pa pe zi Ben-Oni msiakbeu, dede pe pei be pecu Benjamin qulu. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Rachel tsaidi nah pecu Ephrath (cide, Bethlehem) lampui kung gage kungdi. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Jacob pe rau reu gage tsusum ge sumlu. Cide henai kecang de Rachel rau riet pwa bam. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Israel tetcuh dai nah meurün hau de kepie tsukwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Meurün hau de kepie tsukwa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Migdal Eder</char></note> gwale ge pet pe ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Israel cipau deu ga lungh kebam dau, Reuben pe pei nauseupui Bilhah de ngngwa zeu di, nah Israel cide siu lu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Cu Jacob pena mipei kereiekena bam dida. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Pe napeime Leah ne mna kelume cai Jacob neraibe, Reuben, nah Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, nah Zebulun. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Pe napeime Rachel ne mna kelume cai Joseph penai Benjamin. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Pe napeime Rachel kilapui Bilhah ne mna kelume cai, Dan nah Naphtali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Leah kilapui Zilpah napei kena cai, Gad penai Asher. Aidung de peciakne Jacob namedung Paddan Aram gade pecu mna kebeumedung. <verse eid="GEN 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Jacob pe pei Isaac taiga gwanglu, Mamre ga Kiriath Arba (Hebron dede lie la) ga, Abraham nah Isaac kelungh bam ga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Heb. 11:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaac mmi haige eh riakheset lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Isaac pe ngyi tütdi eh tsaidi, nah pe paumedung taiga ge kaidi, lungh mlung eh cing süt kecume ge eh. Esau penai Jacob, pe napei kena, pecu kungdi.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Esau leuhme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Aidungde cai Esau leuhmedung (Edom dede qula). <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau Canaanme dade penaudung luulu. Aidung de cai penaudung: Hittitme Elon napui, Adah; Anah napui Oholibamah, Hivitme Zibeon tsapui; <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />nah Ishmael napui Basemath, Nebaioth sina bepui. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Adah, Esau de Eliphaz mna beu, nah Basemath Reuel de mnalu. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibamah Jeush, Jalam, nah Korah de mnalu. Aidung de Esau napeidung Canaan deudi gade pecu mna kebeumedung. <verse eid="GEN 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Esau pe naudung, pe napeidung, pe napuidung, nah pe kilungme peupei peciakne, de ngngwalu, pe kauruine, pegu makaunedung pelane, nah pe mabamdung pelane, pa canaan deu gade hekwa keludung, delwe hangdeu keda ga mie pe sinabe Jacob dade mdeidi. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Pa aide teidi kedanemene penai mabambe penai ziemne kieezu eh penai bam ncüt daulak kedine. Penui lungh kebam deu de penai ziemne ceu hamdi kedanemene penai gu kauruine ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Cine Esau, Edom de qu kelabe, Seir hangdeutu deudi ga lungdi.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Aidung de Esau leuhmedung, Edomme pau Seir hangdeutu deudi ga lungla. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aidung de cai Esau namedung zi: Adah napei Eliphaz, Esau nau; Basemath napei Reuel, Esau nau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Eliphaz napeidung cai, Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, nah Kenaz. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Timna, Eliphaz nauseupui, Esau napei, Amalek de mna beu. Aidung de Esau nau, Adah tsapeimedung. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Aidung de cai Reuel napeimedung: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, nah Mizzah. Aidung de Esau nau, Basemath tsapeimedung. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Aidung de cai Esau nau Oholibamah napeidung, Anah napui nah Zibeon tsapui. Pa Esau de mna beu Jeush, Jalam, nah Korah.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Aidung de Esau leuhmedung kak de pautsadung: Eliphaz leuhme, Esau neraibe: Teman, Omar, Zepho, Kenaz, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Korah, Gatam, nah Amalek. Aidung de Edom deu ga Eliphaz dade lunghgwang kelu pautsadung. Penui au Adah tsapeidung. <verse eid="GEN 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Aidung de cai Esau napei Reuel pautsadung: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, Mizzah. Aidung de Edom deu gade Reuel dade lunghgwang kelu pautsadung. Penui au Esau nau, Basemath tsapeimedung. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Aidung de Esau nau Oholibamah pautsadung: Jeush, Jalam, Korah. Aidung de Anah napui Oholibamah, Esau nau dade lunghgwang kelu pautsadung. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Aidung de cai Esau napeidung (Edom dede qu kelabe), nah aidung de penui hegwangdung.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Aidung de cai Seir napeidung, Horite deu ga lungh kebamme: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishon, Ezer, nah Dishan. Aidung de Horite pautsadung, Edom deuga Seir ga lungh kebamme. <verse eid="GEN 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lotan napeidung cai Hori nah Heman, nah Timna cai Lotan tipui. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Aidung de cai Shobal napeidung: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, nah Onam. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Aidung de cai Zibeon napeidung: Aiah nah Anah. Anah aipau de hetaideu gade duilum reu de ngau kelube da, pa pe pei Zibeon gu gadadung kwa keladau. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Aidung de cai Anah namedung: Dishon nah Oholibamah, Anah napui. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Aidung de cai Dishon napeimedung: Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, nah Keran. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Aidung de cai Ezer napeimedung: Bilhan, Zaavan, nah Akan. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Aidung de cai Dishan napeidung: Uz nah Aran. <verse eid="GEN 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Aidung de cai Horitme pautsadung: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, nah Anah, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishon, Ezer, Dishan: Aidung de cai Horitme pautsadung, Seir deu ga penui pautsa mzidung rehi gade.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edom gwangpeidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Aipau hegwangdung de cai Edom deu ga hegwangtei kegwangmedung Israelme reu hegwang ge de hegwangtei kemakne: <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Beor napei Bela, Edom ga hegwangtei, nah pe namdi zi be cai Dinhabah. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela tsaidi ge, pecai Bozrah ga Zerah napei Jobab, ne pe bam leulu. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Jobab tsaidi ge, Temanitme deu gade kegwangbe Husham, ne pe bam leulu. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Husham tsaidi ge, Bedad napei Hadad Moabme deu gade Midianme de ngam kelube, ne pe bam leulu. Pe namdi zi be cai Avith. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadad tsaidi ge, Masrekahme pei Samlah ne pe bam leulu. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samlah tsaidi ge, pecai Rehobothme pei Euphrate kereuki kung ga kebambe Shaul ne pe bam leulu. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shaul tsaidi ge, pecai Akbor napei Baal-Hanan ne pe bam leulu. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Cidau Akbor napei Baal-Hanan, tsaidi ge, pecai Hadar ne pe bam leulu. Pe namdi zi cai Pau. Pe nau zi cai Mehetabel, Matred napui, Me Zahab tsapui.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Aidung de cai Esau leuhme gade pautsadung gu pe peu keteume zidung, penui pautsadung nah penui cuikui, penui zidung de ria gade: Timna, Alvah, Jetheth, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magdiel, nah Iram. Aidung de cai Edom pautsa peuteumedung, penui hangdeu gumlwe penui lungh kelu rehi gade. Aide cai Esau, Edomme pei.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Joseph mang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Jacob pepei lung kebam deu ga lungdi, Canaan deu ga. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Aidung de Jacob kibaume hadung. Joseph, rehang mege mmi kereiehena kauge, pe swacingme de ngngwa meurünhau de kwabamla. Pa pe pei nau kena Bilhah nah Zilpah napeidung de ngngwala. Joseph penui heta kesia ketei hadung teugwang penui pei dage rangbeu. <verse eid="GEN 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Israel pena kedame de swa Joseph de ku ki la, kedanemene pecing cai ne pecu mna kelune. Pa pecu ncwa yisüt kecu ge teibeu. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Pe swacingmedung penui pei Joseph de penuide swa ku ki kecu ngaudi. Penui pecu ngkau sütti nah sam keyi de pecu resiu tadi.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Zeuziu ge Joseph hemang ge mmidi, nah pa pe swacingme de cipau de paulia. Penui pecu nkau gwadi. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Pa penui dage rang eh, “Ngaunggia eh aipau mang Ih mmi de kingnei gailou. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Ainie, anui pelane hereibuidung luh gade kang hekwa bam nah ainie, agu hereibui cuhlu delwe sap dung bam, nah ainie, nnui gu buidung gwang twagwa lu nah keumie bam agu hereibui da.” <verse eid="GEN 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Pe swacingmedung pe dage rang eh, “Nang anui reu hegwangtei lau ni? Nang anui reu di kesang lau ni?” Penui pecu nkau gwa di pemang ziemne nah pesamdung ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Pe cai pa pe mang keda mmi dai nah cide pe swacingmedung da ranglia. Pa rang eh, “Ainie, Ih amang kedage mmi: Tingnaimiak nah hekei nah hegidung kereieket ada keumie.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Pa pe swacingmedung dage kerang nzwa pe pei dage ranggai, ge pe pei pecu kesiudi. Pa pe da rang eh, “Nang kemmi mang de daipai mang ge de no? N pui nah Ih nah n swacingmedung hangdeu ga nda ge keumie kera gwang kesang zieni?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Pe swacingmedung pecu periak di, dede pe pei cide pepeu sui ga ladi.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joseph de pe sinamedung ne zwakedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Tingnai ge pe swacingmedung penui pei gu hekaune hau ma pie zie lie Shechem ga mie. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Israel Joseph dage rangdi, “N swacingmedung Shechem ga hekaune hau ma piela me ni? Gwang lu, Ih ncu penui dage langgai zie.” Joseph pe dade rangdi, “Ih mtei luda.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Jacob Joseph dade rang eh, “Mie cu, delwe n swacingmedung nah hekaune hau yi la mi mie pielo, nah ada sam teu gwang beulo.” Cine Jacob pecu Hebron langkam gade lang mpet gai, nah Joseph Shechem ga mie di. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Ge mipei ge Joseph de ngaulu. Ainie, Joseph luh ga hui la. Mina be pecu keteu, “Nang daipai peei la no?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Joseph rang eh, “Ih a swacingmedung de peei la. Kehereide acu ranglia lo penui daiga ketumhau de piela bi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Mina be rang eh, “Penui aipau bam gade tetdi da, Ih penui rang cu siuda, ‘Anui Dothan ga mie go.’” Joseph pe swacingmedung cai zuimie nah penui de Dothan gade ngaulu.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Penui pecu kemdei gade ngaugai, nah pa penui da gwang cang kemakne, penui pe dage teigai kera heciem peeidi pecu teitset kera. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Pe sinamedung hangge ge dade rangdi, “Pielo, hemang kemmibe de gwang la da. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Cu gwanglu, anui pecu teitsetdi go nah hekwaki ge gage kai di go. Anui rang zie, ‘Renaam kau ge ne pecu tui di delie.’ Anui pie zie pe mangdung dainzwa dizie bi kecu.” <verse eid="GEN 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Reuben cide siulu nah penui ba gade pecu kelibeu. Pa rang eh “Anui pe teilung keudi me lugo.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Reuben penui dage rangdi, “Tei rejam so. Hetaideu ga kebam hekwaki de gage keliengai di pecu, dede pereu gage nnui ba kaiso,” iciulude pa penui ba gade pecu keli lwe pepei dage ngngwa cailigwang beu lu kera. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Cinzwadi eh Joseph pe swacingmedung da gwang canglu ge, penui pe ncwa keyi de lwak lu. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Penui pecu tui lu nah pecu keliengai di hekwaki gage. Hekwaki cide mtaku eh dui de ga bam.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Penui matyei kera ntumlu. Penui ngang cu nah piegai, nah, ainie, Ishmaelme gu Caravan ge Gilead gade mbeuh gwangla, penui utdung ga mosala nah tsing ca nah myrrh püt teipungla. Penui mbeuh la cidungde Egypt ga pungmie lai eh. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Judah pe sinamedung dage rangdi, “Anui daige ngau lu lai no magade anui anui caiheriebe de teitset nah pe tsit hekim kelu le? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Gwanglu, nah anui pecu Ishmaelme dage zwa beu di go nah anui ba pecu kai mene. Kedanemene pa anui sinabe, anui teijai lu.” Pe sinamedung pecu kesuizwa lu. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Midianme heli keteime kah gwang. Pe sinamedung Joseph de teu ncuhlu delwe pecu hekwaki gade teumpet lu. Penui Joseph de Ishmaelme dage rangkang geu ngkai gade zwadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkang geu ngkai gade zwadi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu gram haina ngkai de hebaangme pei ge mi</char></note>. Ishmaelme Joseph de Egypt ga pung gwangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Bat. 7:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Reuben hekwaki ga cailigwang, nah, ainie, Joseph hekwaki ga bam ma. Pa pesuisia eh pe paidung hietdi. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Pa pe sinamedung da cailigwang nah rang, “Mipeinabe aika galie! Nah Ih, dai ga mie lai?” <verse eid="GEN 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Penui hemeu ge daptsetlu nah pecai Joseph ncwa keulu nah cipau jai gage mpunglu. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Pecai penui cide teugwang penui pei da nah rang eh, “Anui aide ngaulu. Kehereide pielo aide n napei ncwa mi mebi kecu.” <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Jacob cilu nah rangdi, “Aide a napei ncwa da. Renaam kaune ne pecu teitset dida. Joseph de teu rak takcai dida.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Jacob pesuisia eh pe paidung hietdi delwe pe kia reu ge rosopai balu. Pa peting ketie ge pe napei de hei eh hap. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Pe napeimedung nah pe napuimedung pelane pelung tei nciep kera cuhlu, dede pa pelung tei nciep kera lulu tadi. Pa rangdi, “Kesang Ih ana de hei hap eh Sheol ga hung zie da.” Pe pei pe ziemne hap ladi. <verse eid="GEN 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Midianme pecu Egypt gade zwa Potiphar dage, Pharaoh gu kedibe, reketme gu muiteube.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Judah penai Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Cinzwadi eh cipau ting dau Judah pe sinapeidung de pütdi nah Adullamitme ge de ngngwa bamdi, pe zi caige Hirah. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Pa cika Canaanme pei pe zi Shua lie kecube napui de redaulu. Pa pecu luulu delwe pecu ngngwa zeu di. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Pa tetlaklu nah mipeina ge lungh lu. Pezi Er msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Pa tetlak dailu nah mipeina lunglu. Pa pezi Onan msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Pa mipeina ge lungh dailu nah pezi Shelah msiaklu. Kezib gade pa pecu mnalu <verse eid="GEN 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Mmi kiee ge cai Judah pe neraibe Er ziemne penau pei beu. Nah pe zi cai Tamar. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Er, Judah neraibe, RAMPAUBE dwa gade pezai sia. RAMPAUBE pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Judah Onan dage rang eh, “Mie n sinabe nau de ngngwa zeu lu. Pe dage pe nahpei sinabe kecu ta nsam be tei gailo, nah n swacingbe ziemne hena lungbeulu.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Nah Onan hena cide pegu kelak ci. Pa pe swacingbe nau de ngngwa henau hepei zai ketei ramsangne, pa hangdeu gage henatsi leuh tei tangra gi dila, ciude pe swacingbe ziemne pa hena lungbeu melu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Pa tei kegaide au RAMPAUBE dwa gade kesia ge. RAMPAUBE pecu de teitsetdi. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Pecai Judah pena nau, Tamar dage rang eh, “N pei kiga gwang hemipui teibam lulo, a napei Shelah, ngking cu kemaktane.” Kedanemene pa hing di, “Pe swacingbe kena nzwa, pa de tsai di kera.” Cine Tamar tetdi nah pe pei ki ga lungdi.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Peting tie kedicai, Shua napui, Judah nau tsaidi. Judah helung ncieplu nah Timnah ga pe meurün mai bietkebamme da hang, pa nah pe zangpei Hirah, Adullamitme. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamar dage rangbeu, “Pielo, n nahpei pei Timnah ga mie pe meurün mai biet lai zeu.” <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Pa pe hemipui paini de lwakdi nah pecu pe pai le gumlu delwe pecu kezuilu. Enaim kirie ga pa ntum bam, Timnah ga kemie lampui de ga. Kedanemene pa ngau da Shelah cu au rehang dida dede pecu peu penau tei kera ha beu mene bam la. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Cidau Judah pecu ngau lu eh pa cetdi pecu helipui ge lie kedanemene pa pezu gum kedine. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Pa lampui kung ga peda mie nah rangdi, “Gwang lu, ngau nggia acu peu ncu ngngwa zeulo,” kedanemene pa au pe na nau lie kecu ci kemakne, nah pa rangdi, “Nang acu dai peu lai ciu eh nang acu ngngwa zeulu kerane?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Pa rangdi, “Ih ncu hekaune hau gade hemeuna ge langgai beuzie.” Pa rangdi, “Nang cide langgai kemak dwa cide nding gade nang acu mage peu cai?” <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Pa rang eh, “Dai pe nding gade Ih ncu peu lai?” Pa keligai, “Ngu kaugiak nah cide kekangria, nah n ba ga kela tuitie de.” Pa cidung de pecu peudi nah pa pecu ngngwa nauhepei zai teidi, nah pa pe na tetlakdi. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Pa cuhlu delwe tetdi. Pa pe pai keugidi nah pe hemipui pai ni kai lu. <verse eid="GEN 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Judah pe zangbe Adullame pei da hemeuna langgai ciu eh mipui be ba gade pe guniadung de pa ngau dailu kerane, dede pa pecu ngau lu tadi. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Pecai Adullamitme pei mina cipau bam ga kebam de keteu, “Recaki helipui Enaim lampui kung ga kebam de daiga lano?” Penui rangdi, “Aika madaude recaki helipui bam lama.” <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Pa Judah da cailigwang nah rangdi, “Ih pecu ngau lu ma. Nah, cika minadung kebamme rangdi, ‘Aika madaude recaki helipui bam lama.’” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Judah rang eh, “Peu pecu maniadung keulu, ciu eh anui de hengam tei melu kerane. Kesang, Ih hemeuna aide langgai, dede nang pecu ngaulu ma.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Cinzwadi eh matie mene keicum cai Judah dage rang beu, “Tamar n napei nau helipui ge nzwa heli li dida, nah kesang pa au cide ziemne tetlak dida.” Judah rangdi, “Pecu aika ngngwa pet lwe ru tset di lu.” <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Pecu ngngwa pet luge, pa pe nahpei pei dage sam lang gai, “Aipau mania mpaube pei ne acu tei tetlak dida.” Pa rang eh, “Aidung cau gu bi ngau ngngia pie lulo, kaugiak nah pe kangria nah hetui tie.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Judah cidung de cilu nah rang eh, “Pa au a swade petau gwalie, kedanemene Ih pecu a napei Shelah nau tei kera pwa peu kemak ne.” Pa madaude pecu ngngwa zeu si tadi. <verse eid="GEN 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Cidau pa mna kera ting gwang cang di ge, ainie, nedui peza ga bam. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Cipau ting dau pa mna kebam dau hangge peba ketwa mpet, nah kelamluibe pui helangria kegie ge keulu nah cide pe ba gage kanggai nah rangdi, “Aide de mna mpet rai luda.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Iciu de pa peba keu caili nlüt daidi, nah, ainie, pe sinabe de mna rai lu. Kelamluibe pui rang, “Nang dainzwa mpet luno!” Cine pezi Perez msiaklu. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Pecai pe sinabe de mna lu, peba gage helangria kegie kang pung kelabe de, nah pezi Zerah msiaklu.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Joseph penai Potiphar nau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Joseph de Egypt ga ngngwa nghung lu. Egyptmepei Potiphar, Pharaoh kangga kedibe hegwangki kekwa kedibe, Ishmaelme pecu cika ngngwa kehungme dade pecu luilu. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />RAMPAUBE Joseph de ngngwala nah pa mina heisüt kecume ge teilu. Pa Egyptme pei pe mpaube ki ga lungh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Bat. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />RAMPAUBE pecu ngngwa kela pe mpaube ngaudi nah RAMPAUBE be bata leune ga peu yisi reu reulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Bat. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Joseph de pe dwade ngau pe sui lu. Pa Potiphar gwatei. Potiphar Joseph de peu peki ga ma kerengeibe teilu, nah pe mabam kebam pelane, pa pekang gage kaidi. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Cinzwadi eh pa pecu peki ga nah pe mabam pelane reu pie kerengeibe teikelu benai gade, RAMPAUBE Joseph ziemne Egyptme kilungme de samlam beu. RAMPAUBE samlam Potiphar ki ga kebam peciakne nah luh ga kebam leune da bamlu. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Potiphar ma pelane pegudung de Joseph kang gage kaidi. Pa mage de cet mning nang tadi pe taktyei de gwale. Cu Joseph au rehang yi nah hezuyi süt. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Cinzwadi eh aipau cai pe mpaube pei nau Joseph dage pemiak kai di nah rangdi, “Acu ngngwa zeu lo.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Dede pa kelidi nah pe mpaube pei nau dage rang, “Pie lo, a mpaube kilung ga Ih daitei la bi de helung pang ma, nah pa ma pelane pegu pwa akang gage kaidi da. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Mi gede aswa kedi gada aipau kiga. Pa ncu gwale magede ada de kaizeu dima, kedanemene nang penau kecune. Cine dainzwa Ih heta kesia kedi aide teilu lai nah kemau Tinggwang dage?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Pa Joseph de langnaige cai langnaige mpau, dede pa kelidi pecu ngngwa zeu kera mede pecu ngngwa bam kera. <verse eid="GEN 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Cinzwa eh tingnai ge pa kilung ga nlwet peta tei kerane. Kilame migede kilung cika bam ma. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Pa pe pai teulwe pecu herak lwe rangdi, “Acu ngngwa zeulo.” Pa pe pai peba gage gi di, pakdi, nah hegwale mpet di. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Cinzwa eh pa peba ga pe pai gi kenzeu nah hegwale pak mpet kedi ngaulu ge, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />pa pe kilung kilame de qulu nah penuide ranglia, “Pielo, Potiphar Hebrewme pei de ngngwa gwang anuide hengam tei kera. Pa ada gwang eh acu ngngwa zeu kera tei, nah Ih mra gai. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Cinzwa eh Ih mra kegai pa siu lu ge, pa pe pai ada gidi eh, pakdi, nah hegwale mpetdi.” <verse eid="GEN 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Pe mpaube kilung gwang kemaktane pe pai pa petaige kai nzeu di. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Pa pe dage cipau ha de paubeu, “Hebrew kilabe anui da nang ngngwa kegwang de, acu kemneu ta tei kera lüt. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Cidau Ih mra gai ge, pa pe pai a tai gage gidi nah hegwale pak mpetdi.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Cidau pe mpaube pehade pe nau pe dage kerang siulu ge, “Aide n kilabe a dage tei kegai,” pa perata sütdi. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Joseph mpaube pecu tuilu nah hebaangki gage kai, hegwangpei baangme de kai kenzeu gage. Pa hebaangki cika bam. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Dede RAMPAUBE Joseph de ngngwa la nah samkak kelu samsang de pecu keulia. Pa pecu peu pesui lu hebaangki kekwame dwa gade. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Hebaangki kekwabe Joseph ba gage hebaangme pelane hebaangki ga kebamme de kaibeu. Cika penui ketei leune, Joseph ne cide pie rengei beu. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Hebaangki kekwabe mage de pelung keherei ma peba ga kebamne, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pecu ngngwala kecune. Pa makeheibe teide, RAMPAUBE samlam beu.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Hepiak kepwabe penai tangku kerube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Cinzwa eh aidungde cai, Egypt gwangpei piak kepwabe nah hegwangpei tangku kerube penai mpaupei Egypt gwangpei suisiet teidi. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Pharaoh pe gwa ketei kedibe kena de pe rata di, hepiak kepwa kedibe nah tangku kerube kedibe de. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Pa penai de kedibe ki ga hegwangpei baangme ki gage kaidi, Joseph de kai kenzeu hebaangki de gage. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Hebaangki ga kedibe Joseph de peu penuide pie rengei, nah pa penui gwatei. Penui peting ketie ge hebaangki ga bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Penai pe mang riep mmi, Egypt ga hegwangpei piak kepwabe nah tangku kerube hebaangki ga baang kenzeube kena, zeuziu ge gage penai hangna na de penai mang riep mmi, nah hemang kena na de pekie ketsamtsam. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Joseph tingcang penai da gwang nah penai de ngau. Ainie, penai sui sia bam. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Pharaoh gwa ketei kedime pecu ngngwa pe mpaube ki baangki ga kebambe kena de pa keteu, “Daitei henai nnai suisia süt bam no?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Penai pe dage rang eh, “Anai hangna na de hemang ge riep mmi nah cide migede pekie ranglu kera galie.” Joseph penai dage rang, “Tinggwang hemang kieh siaklu kelabe melui ni? Adage rang gailo, kehereide.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Hepiak kepwa kedibe Joseph dage pemang ranglia. Pa pe dage rang eh, “Amang gade, ainie, kubebang ge adwa ga bam. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Kubebang ga pekiak kecum bam. Peneidung bwa herizi, pepadung pa pet lu nah kubetsidung meudi. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Pharaoh piak a ba ga bam. Ih kubetsidung keulu nah Pharaoh piak gage tui gai lu, nah Ih Pharaoh ba gage hepiak be habeu di.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Joseph pe dage rang eh, “Aide pekie da. Pekiak kecum de tingba zie lang cumne. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Lang cumne gage Pharaoh n peu teucu beu zie nah peu ncu nta ga tei daizie. Nang Pharaoh piak pwa pe ba gage kai zie, nang ndaa pe piak pwa kecudau nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Dede acu nsung gailo nang lung reluikelu dau, nah kehereide acu keku pwa lialo. Pharaoh dage aha ranglo nah acu hebaangki aika de keumpet beulo. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Kesangbe acu Hebrewme deu gade tui teuh mpet. Nah Ih aikade de mage de penui acu hangdeukang baangki aide gage kai kera ta tei ma.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Tangku kerube kedibe hemang kie rang kegai dau ngau pesui lu, pa Joseph dage rang eh, “Ih de amang mmi, nah, ainie, tangku rak kecum apeu ga bam. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Perak reu ga Pharaoh ziemne ru kelu tangku ketsamtsam pwala, dede nruinedung ne cidung tyei bam a peu reu pungkela rak gade.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Joseph keligai nah rang, “Aide pekie da. Tangku raak kecum de lang cumne da. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Lang cumne gage Pharaoh ncu lungmpet beu zie nah ncu tsingbang gage kezu luzie. Nruinedung ne n teih tyei luzie.” <verse eid="GEN 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Cinzwa eh lang cumne cai Pharaoh de kemna tingba. Pa pegwa keteime peciakne ziemne taktyei teleilu. Pa hepiak kepwabe kedibe nah tangku kerube kedibe de lung mpet beu, pegwa keteimedung kak gage. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Pa hepiak kepwabe kedibe de nda ta gage kaidai beu, nah pa Pharaoh ba gage hepiak pwa gai dai. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Dede pa tangku keru kedibe de gwaktsetdi, Joseph penui dage rang kebeu nzwa eh. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Dede hepiak kepwa kedibe Joseph de nsung lu ma, dede pecu nsung tadi.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Pharaoh mang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Cinzwa eh mmi kena kekam le gwang di ge Pharaoh hemang ge mmi. Ainie, pa Nile reuki ga sap bam. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Ainie, Nile reuki gade ketumdung hena mpetlu, pelui yi, nah mdui süt eh, nah penui kiinaa bangdung peei tyeila. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Ainie, ketumpuidung keda hena, peluisia nah perarie kecu penui cai Nile reuki gade mpet lu. Penui keda ketumpuidung tai ga kereuki ga saplu. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Pecai pelui kesia nah perarie tumpuidung ne pelui keyi nah mdui süt tumpuidung hena de tyeilu. Ge Pharaoh mrak cuhdi. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Pecai hegwangpei zipmie dai ge hemang keda mmi dai. Ainie, meibui hena meibang ge ga lungh bam, pui nah meu eh. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Ainie, meibui keda hena repei nah kepetle tingkai ne guikidi nah cidungde cai pwakcu lu. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Nah meibui kerepeidung dene kepuidung hena de mneulu. Nah Pharaoh mrak cuhlu, nah ainie, pa hemang mmi kebam cilu. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Cinzwa eh tingcang di ge pa pelung keherei di. Cine pa Egypt ga rekamedung nah makecime pelane de ngngwa gwang lo mide langgai. Pharaoh penui dage pe mangdung ranglia, dede cika migede cidung de kie Pharaoh de rangbeu gailak di.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ciu eh hepiak kepwa kedibe Pharaoh dage rang eh, “Henai Ih teimau kedidung de mning bam. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Pharaoh pegwa keteimedung de perata di, nah kekwame kedibe ki ga hebaangki gage acu kaidi, tangku keru kedibe anaide. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Zeuziu ge anai hangna na hemang mmi hiplu, pa nah Ih de. Anai hangge ge kecu mangkie ketsamtsam rehi gade mmilu. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Cika Hebrewme rehangme ge anai de ngngwa bam, pumkwame reu kedibe kilabe ge. Anai pedage pau beu nah pa anai ziemne anai mang pekie ranglia. Pa anai mang rehi gade anai de pekie ranglia. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Cinzwa eh pa pekie anai dage kerang nzwa, cide nzwa teilu. Pharaoh peu acu a bam ga bam dailu, dede pa tangku kerube de gwaktset di.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Ciu eh Pharaoh mide langpwa Joseph de qugai. Penui zette pecu hangdeukang baangki gade ngngwa mpetlu. Pa pekatei pemai taidi, penia keyi kailwe Pharaoh dwa ga lüt. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Pharaoh Joseph dage ranggai, “Ih hemang ge mmi, dede mige de pekie ranglu ma. Dede Ih n ha siu, nang hemang siu kegai dau nang cide kie rang lubui lie kecu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Joseph Pharaoh de keli eh ranggai, “Ih ne teigai lak. Dede Tinggwang Pharaoh de pekie be siaklia zie.” <verse eid="GEN 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Pharaoh Joseph dage rang eh, “A mang gade, ainie, Ih Nile reuki kung ga sap bam. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Nah ainie, ketumpuidung hena Nile reuki gade mpetlu, pelui yi, nah kemduidung, nah penui kiinaa bangdung peei tyei ladi. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Nah ainie, ketumpuidung keda hena penui cai gade mpetlu, nnei nah pelui sia süt, nah pe pum perarie rünne. Ih madau de Egyptme deu pelane ga cidungde kenzwa pelui kesia ngau ma. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ketum peluisia nah kesiadung dene keraibe ketumdung pelui keyi hena de tyeilu. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Penui cidungde de tyeilu ge, penui de tyeilu cu ciswa gailak, kedanemene penui cude nda nzwa pelui sia bam reu kecune. Ciu eh Ih nrak cuhdi. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Ih a mang gade ngau, nah, ainie, meibui hena mei bang ge ga lung bam, puih nah yi eh. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Ainie, meibuidung keda hena, kidi, repei nah kepetle tingkai ne guiki kedi, cidungde cai mtwacuhlu. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Nah meibui kesiadung ne keyi hena pui kebamdung de de mneulu. Ih rekame dage a mangdung paubeu, dede cika penui mige de ada cidung ranglu meda.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Joseph Pharaoh dage rang eh, “Pharaoh mang kena de pekie nzwakap. Tinggwang teigai lai kezeu de, pa Pharaoh dage keulia beuda. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ketumpui pelui keyi hena de mmi hena, nah mei bui kepui henadung de mmi hena. Hemang kenade au nsam kap. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ketumpuidung pelui kesia nah perarie hena cidung de cai cuh kecudung de cai mmi hena nah meibui kesia hena kepetle tingkai ne guiki kedidung de herakum mmi hena zie. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ih Pharaoh dage sam rang kebeu de cide da. Tinggwang teigai lai kezeu de pa Pharaoh dage keulia beu. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Ainie mmi hena Egyptme deu pelane ga pui nlim gwang zie. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nah mmi hena herakum nnui da gwang zie, nah pui kenlim mmidung pelane nsungta dizie Egyptme deu ga, nah herakum dene deu be de ngkap dizie. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Pui kenlim ting de hangdeube ga nsungta dizie kedanemene herakum pecai ga gwang kera de ziemne, kedanemene cide au siasüt zie kecune. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Hemang piana Pharaoh mmi keswa kedi de au kedanemene Tinggwang ne makie de peting riem lwe nah Tinggwang cide peu kelwa gwang kera mtei kelune. <verse eid="GEN 41:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Pharaoh de peu cu au lungcet keyi nah maci kebam mige de peeilu, nah pecu peu Egyptme deu reu kedi teu kera kailu. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Peu Pharaoh de kedimedung de deu reu ga kedetlu, nah penui de peu Egypt ga pui kenlim mmi hena meidung gu zi mengei de peu keulu. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Peu penui taktyei pelane hekwalu aipau mmi keyidung kegwang dau ge, nah Pharaoh kengkieng kang gade mei hekwa lu, namdidung ga taktyei teilu kerane. Penui cide kai nzeulu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Taktyei de herakum mmi hena de ziemne hangdeube ziemne taktyei zi beu zie cide Egyptme deu ga de zie. Ainzwa eh hangdeube ga herakum kekum dau keherei di melu kerane.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Heciem aide Pharaoh miak gade nah pegwa keteimedung pelane miak gade ngau penui suilu. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Pharaoh pegwa keteimedung dage rang gai, “Anui mina aikenzwa ge ngaulu bui ni, peda Tinggwang Rabe kebam?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Cine Pharaoh Joseph dage rangdi, “Kedanemene Tinggwang ma pelane aidungde ncu keu keliane, nswa mige de maci nah lungcet keyi ga da. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Nang a ki keteube teizie nah nsam nzwa a minadung pelane reu teu zie. Hegwangbam ga rünne Ih nswa di zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Bat. 7:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joseph Egypt reu kedi teikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Pharaoh Joseph dage rang eh, “Pielo, Ih ncu Egyptme deu pelane teu kecube kai dida.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Pharaoh peba gade bakap pe hegwang kaugiak kenzeu de keu mpet Joseph ba gage kai beu. Pa pecu langcim keyi paidung pwa ba beu nah kecak teiria pwa pe ngwang gage kaibeu. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Pa peda kebam de bagi pekenabe ga pecu peu tetlu. Minadung sah eh pedwa ga, “Keu mielu.” Pharaoh pecu peu Egyptme deu pelane reu gage kaibeu da. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Pharaoh Joseph dage rangdi, “Ih au Pharaoh nah nang gwale migede pe ba mede pe pi Egyptme deu pelane ga hwacu gailak.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Pharaoh Joseph zi “Zaphenath-Paneah qulu.” Pa pecu penau kerane On cingkupei Potiphera napui Asenath de pecu peu. Joseph Egyptme deu pelane rwamie di<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:45 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Joseph Egyptme deu pelane rwamie di: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Ainzwa eh Joseph kideube reu kedi tei.” </char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Joseph mmi camrei di pa Egypt hegwangpei Pharaoh dwa ga kesap dau. Joseph Pharaoh kebam gade tet pwa nah Egyptme deu pelane ga miedi. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Makehei mmi hena dau hangdeu meibui hemi süt beu. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Pa taktyei pelane mmi hena gu hekwa lu Egyptme deu ga kebam ga nah namdidung gage taktyei kailu; pa taktyei luhdung gade namdidung twagwapung kebam leune gage kailu. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Joseph mei hekwa lu jaaidi ga heciangdung nzwa, ciu eh kiee ham eh pa pei cu ntak di, kedanemene cide kiee zu kedine. <verse eid="GEN 41:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Joseph pena hangna mipeina herakum kum kecu mmi gwang kemak dwa lunghlu, On deuceu Cingkupei Potiphera napui Asenath ne pecu mna kebeu kena de. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Joseph pena neraibe zi Manasseh msiaklu, pa rang eh, “Tinggwang acu peu a reidung pelane nsungta dida, nah a pei kilungme pelane.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Pa pe napei pekena be zi Ephraim msiaklu ciu eh pa rang eh, “Tinggwang a reiketei deu gade acu a name pwa peu da.” <verse eid="GEN 41:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Mmi hena pui kenlim Egyptme deu ga kebam de penli gwang di. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Mmi hena herakum kum kecu ndeu di, Joseph kerang nzwa eh, hangdeudung pelane ga herakum kum gwang di, dede Egyptme deu ga taktyei dung bam lu. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Cidau Egyptme deu pelane ga herakum kum dige, minadung Pharaoh dage taktyei ziemne nra gai eh qu. Pharaoh Egyptmedung pelane dage rang eh, “Joseph da mie cu nah pa dai rang bi teilu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat 7:11 </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Herakum kum mtei zu eh hangdeu pelane reu ga gwangdi. Cine Joseph mei hekwa kelu kidung pelane let lwe Egyptmedung de zwabeu. Egyptme deu ga herakum kum mtei zudi. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Kideu pelane Joseph dade mei lui kerane Egypt ga mie bam, kedanemene kideu pelane ga herakum kum süt kedine.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Joseph sinamedung Egypt ga kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Cu Jacob Egypt deudi ga hetsiu kebam cilu ge, pa pe napeidung dage rang eh, “Daitei nnui hangge gede pie bamno?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Pa rangdi, “Pielo aika, Ih siu da Egypt ga mei bamlie kecu, cika mie cu, delwe nnui ziemne luilu cikade iciu eh anui nzeu tsaidi melu kerane nah ringlu kerane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Bat. 7:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Joseph sinapeidung hangkerei mei lui kerane Egypt ga miedi. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Dede Jacob Joseph sinabe Benjamin de lang gai ma, pe sinamedung dage, kedanemene pa rangdi, “Peda keherei gwang dilu kera Ih hing kecune.” <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Israel napeidung mei lui kera kegwangme kak ga ngngwa lwe gwanglu, kedanemene Canaan deu ga herakum kum kedine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Bat. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Joseph ne cu deuceudi tei bam Egyptme deu reu. Pa ne hangdeu pelane ga minadung dage mei zwa beu bam. Joseph sinamedung gwang pe dwaga keumie penui zu hangdeu gage bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Joseph pe sinapeidung de ngau lwe penui de cilu, dede pa penui de peu pecu cima delwe pa penui dade pekwa hu eh marang. Pa penui dage rang eh, “Dai gade nnui gwang la no?” Penui rang eh, “Canaanme deu gade taktyei lui kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Joseph pe sinamedung de cilu, dede penui pecu ci luma. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Ge Joseph pe mang kiedung nsunglu, pa penui de mmi kecu mang de, nah pa penui dage rang eh, “Nnui reulimme! Nnui anui deu kemneidung de pie lai eh lada.” <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Penui pedade rangdi, “Ma a mpaubo. N kilamedung taktyei lui kera gwangla. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Anui pelane au pei ge napeidung. Anui au ma kesangme. N kilamedung au reulimme dung ma.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Pa penui dage rang eh, “Ma, nnui anui deu kemneidung de pie lai eh lada.” <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Penui rangdi, “Anui n kilamedung anui sinamedung hangkereikena, Canaan deu ga mi hangge napeidung lie. Pielo henatube cudau anui pei da bam, nah sinabe hangge ringbam meda.” <verse eid="GEN 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Joseph penui dage rang eh, “Ih nnui dage kerang de da; nnui au reulimmedung. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Aide le nnui de kedak pie zie. Pharaoh teilung gade, nnui aikade tet gailak da, nnui sinabe henatube aika gwang kemaktane. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Nnui kakgade hangge de langgai eh peu mie nnui sinabe de ngngwa lulo. Nnui hebaangki ga bam zie, iciu eh nnui kerang samdung de kesang mi mebi kecu ci nci lu kerane. Maige, Pharaoh teilung gade au, nnui reulimme bi geda.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Pa penui pelane de langcumne hebaangki gage kai zeu di.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Joseph penui dage rang eh langcumne benai, “Aide tyei lwe ring lu, kedanemene Ih Tinggwang mie hinglu. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Nnui masang kecume liecai, peu nnui sinabe hangge de hebaangki ga bamlu, dede nnui tet cu, mei pung lu herakum kum kebam nnui kelakdung ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Nnui sinabe henatube de ada ngngwa gwang lu ciu eh nnui samdung de kesanglie kecu nci lu zie nah nnui tsai di lak.” Ciu eh penui cide teilu. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Penui hangge ge dade rangdi, “Anui mau süt dida ndaa anui caihereibe dage tei kegai de ziemne pa pe ngngia anui da kie kecudau pa pelung keherei süt kedi anui ngauda dede anui kingnei meda. Ciziemne anuida keherei aide gwang bam dida.” <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Reuben penui de keligai, “Ih nnui dage rang meni, ‘Henanabe reu gage kemau tei gai helo eh,’ Dede nnui kingnei luma? Cu, pielo, pe jai anui reu ga gwang dai au da.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Joseph penui kerang de ci dede penui cide cima, kedanemene penui kakga pauswa kedine. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Joseph penui de nreu tetdi delwe hap bam di. Pa penui da cailigwang dailu delwe marang dai. Pa penui kakga de Simeon de teu lu delwe penui miak dwa gade pecu kanglu. <verse eid="GEN 42:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Ciciu eh Joseph pe kilamedung dage pe swacingmedung püt mei le tei pui beu lo, nah penui püt rip gage rangkang kaidai beu lo, nah penui beu ziemne taktyei peu lo aja kaigai. Ge penui ziemne cinzwa teibeu.<verse eid="GEN 42:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Penui sinamedung mei le penui gadadung püt tei lu nah cika de tetdi. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Penui cipauziu kezeuni gade mige gada pok tei zie lie pe püt letlu, ge pa pe rangkang ngaulu. Ainie, pe püt peu gade. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Pa pe sinamedung dage rang eh, “A rangkang kaidai beu pwa bam lie. Pie gailo cide a püt ga bam.” Penui lung keherei di nah penui mbeu eh nreu hangge ge da ge ranggai, “Aide dai no Tinggwang anui dage tei kegai?” <verse eid="GEN 42:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Penui Jacob da gwang, Canaan deu ga penui pei da nah penui dage matei kedi pelane pe dage ranggai, penui rangdi, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Deuceudibe, hangdeu mpaube, anui dage pe sam hungsüt eh nah anui de hangdeu cika reulimme lie eh cet di. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Anui pedage rang eh, ‘Anui au makesang minadung. Anui au reulimme ma. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Anui siname hang kereiekena, nah pei ge na. Hangge au ringbam meda, nah henatube henai dau anui pei da bam Canaan deu ga.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Hangdeu mpaube minabe, anui dage rangdi, ‘Aide le Ih nnui makesangme lie kecu cilu zie. Nnui sinabe hangge de adage kai zeu lu, mei punglu delwe herakum kum kebam nnui kilungmedung ziemne, nah nnui lampui ga tet cu. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Nnui sinabe henatube ada ngngwa gwang beu lu. Iciu de Ih nnui reulimme kemak, dede nnui mina makesangme lie kecu cilu zie. Iciu cai Ih nnui sinabe de nnui de peu dai zie, nah nnui hangdeu aika heli tei lubui.’”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Cinzwadi eh penui penui pütdung ligai ge, ainie, penui keheibe de rangkang penui püt riep bam. Ge penui nah penui pei penui pütdung ga rangkang ngau lu ge, penui ngngi di. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Penui pei Jacob penui dage rangdi, “Nnui acu peu a namedung pelane de tei nggadi. Joseph au ringbam meda, Simeon gah da, nah nang Benjamin de ngngwa tetdi lau ni. Aidung pelane gade Ih ne rei tu be da.” <verse eid="GEN 42:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Reuben pe pei de marang eh, ranggai, “Ih Benjamin de nda ngngwa caili gwang dai mecai a napei kena de nang teitset di lu. Aba gage pecu kailu, nah Ih pecu nda ngngwa gwang dai beu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 42:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Jacob rang eh, “A napei nnui de nzang mie lak. Pe swacingbe tsai dida nah pa rünne dida. Magade nnui lampuiki ga kemie dau kerehim peda gwang cai, iciu eh nnui a peu tam puu kedi caine alungrei tei beu eh ketsai kecang lubui.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Egypt ga kemie kenabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Hangdeube ga herakum sia sütdi. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Cinzwadi eh penui Egypt gade mei pung gwang kelu de tyei canglu ge, penui pei penui dage rangdi, “Mie dai cu; anui ziemne taktyei kesa luilu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Judah peda ranggai, “Mina be anui de rang mcigi gai beuda, ‘Nnui caihereibe de nnui nzang gwanglu mecai nnui adwa ga lüt gailak.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Nang anui caihereibe de peu anui de ngngwa mie cai, anui mie eh n ziemne taktyei luibeu zie. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Dede nang pecu lang gai mecai, anui mie laklie. Kedanemene minabe anui dade rangdi, ‘Nnui caihereibe de nnui nzang gwanglu mecai nnui adwa ga lüt gailak.’” <verse eid="GEN 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Israel rangdi, “Daitei nnui minabe dage nnui sina keda ge bam reu lie ranglia eh a lung tei keherei la no?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Penui rangdi, “Minabe anui ha nah anui kilungme ha pelane keteu siak dedi. Pa rangdi, ‘Nnui pei ringbam reu ni?’ Nnui sinabe kedabe bam reu ni? Pa keteu kecu ria gade anui pesam keligai da. Anui dainzwa cilu lai no, ‘Nnui caihereibe de ngngwa hung lu lo?’” de eh pa rang kera. <verse eid="GEN 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Judah pe pei Israel dage rangdi, “Mipeinabe de a dage langgai lulo. Anui cuhlwe tet cugo iciu eh anui ringlu kerane nah tsaidi melu kerane, anui nah nang de, nang nah anui name pelane. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Ih a teilung pe ziemne peu zie. Nang a zie lie lubui. Ih magade n dwaga pecu ngngwa gwang dailu mecai, iciu cai peu acu kelungta mmau lulo. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Kedanemene anui aitiege kwa bam di maige, cu au anui piana mie lwe gwang dai bam dizie de nage.” <verse eid="GEN 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Penui pei Israel penui dage rangdi, “Cide iciu maisia cai cu aide teilu. Hangdeu gade ngau keludung yitube teu nnui pwet gage kailu. Kedibe de pungmie peu kera mapeu, tsingcadui kesa, heliadui, Mosala nah myrrh, pistachio tsidung, nah almond. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Nnui ba ga rangkang kena kie ge teulu. Nnui püt peureudung gage rangkang kai kebeu n ba ga pung dailu, cide kai mau mzeu pwabam lu builu. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Nnui caihereibe de dede ngngwa lu. Cuhlu delwe mie daicu minabe da. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Peu kengkieng Tinggwang de minabe dwaga de nnui de peu ngau nggia beulu, iciu eh minabe Benjamin nah nnui sinabe kedabe de nnui de peu dailu kerane. Ih au a namedung de deungga maisiadi cai, Ih au deungga maisia de delu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Penui siname mta mapeu aide keulu, nah penui ba ga rangkang de kena kieege keulu, Benjamin de si eh. Penui cuhlu delwe Egypt ga mie nah Joseph dwaga saplu.<verse eid="GEN 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Joseph Benjamin penui de ngngwa kela ngaulu ge, pa pe kilung ga hetatei kebamme dage rangdi, “Penuide kilung ga ngngwa gwanglu, makaune dap lwe mteilu, iciu eh penui tingna acu ngngwa matyei zie.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Heta tei kebamme Joseph kerang nzwa teilu. Pa penui de Joseph kilung ga ngngwa gwanglu. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Penui ngngi di kedanemene penui de Joseph kilung ga ngngwa gwang kedine. Penui rangdi, “Aide au kedanemene nda kerai be pia anui pütdung gage rangkang kaidai kebeu de ziemne anui ngngwa gwangla kecu, pa anuide ngaurau kera peei zie da. Pa anui de tuilwe nah anui de hebaangmedung dizie da nah anui gadadung de keu teudi zieda.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Joseph kiga heta keteime da penui gwang nah penui heki kikam gade pecu mpau, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />ranggai, “A mpaubo, anui keraibe pia aika taktyei lui kera gwang da. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Cinzwa eh, anui ramzeuki ga gwang canglu ge, anui püt let kegai dau, ainie, anui hangge ge püt rip gade pe rangkang ngau ciaklu, cide pelane. Anui cide anui ba ga teu gwang dai lada. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Anui ba ga rangkang keda de teu gwang la anui taktyei lui kerane. Cau ne anuigu rangkang anui pütdung gage kai bi anui cilu ma.” <verse eid="GEN 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Heta keteibe rangdi, “Lungciep nda bamlu, ngngi diso. Nnui Tinggwang nah nnui pei gu Tinggwang ne nnui pütdung gage nnui gu rangkang kaidai beu au zie. Ih nnui gu rangkang ngau luda.” Ciu eh hetaketeibe Simeon da penui de ngngwa gwang beu. <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Hetaketeibe penuide Joseph kiga ngngwa nlütlu. Pa penui de dui habeu, nah penui penui pi huilu. Pa penui gadadung de gui beu. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Joseph tingna gwang de mapeudung peu kera penui mteilu, ciu eh penui cika matyei zie lie penui siu kelune.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Joseph kilung ga gwanglu ge, penui mapeudung penui ba ga kela teu kilung ga nlwet, nah pedwa ga keumie hangdeu ga. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Pa penui yi la ha kecu penuide keteu nah rangdi, “Nnui pei yibam mi, nang kecingpei ha ranglia kela de? Pa ringbam reu ni?” <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Penui rangdi, “N kilabe anui pei au yibam. Pa ringbam reu.” Penui koktungmie hangdeu tunglu delwe keumie gai. <verse eid="GEN 43:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Pa pemiak ngang cu pie gai ge pe caihereibe Benjamin de ngaulu, pepui napei, nah pa rangdi, “Aide ai nnui sinabe henatube de ni nnui adage kerang de?” Ge pa rang eh, “Peu Tinggwang ngaugia nda bamlu, a na.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Joseph zette kibung gade tetdi, kedanemene pa pe sinabe ziemne pelung sia süt kedine. Pa keda ga mie hap kera peeidi. Pa pe kibung ga gwang delwe cika de hap. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Pa pe zu mrüt lwe pet dai. Pa pekatei pecu kezeulu, “taktyei pwa gwang lulo” ranggai. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Kilamedung Joseph katei de taktyei bam gega mtei beu nah pe sinamedung de penuikatei taktyei bam mtei beu. Egyptmedung penuikatei cika pecu ngngwa matyei kedanemene Egyptmedung Hebrewmedung de ngngwa matyei la kemakne, cide Egyptmedung zai kecune. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Penui sinamedung taktyei bam ga pecu ncwa eh, penui neraibe penui mmi rehi gade, nah henatube pe rehang rehi gade. Penui kebam rehi de ngau lu ge penui swaga eh hangge ge de pie bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Joseph petai ga taktyei bam gade penuide taktyei langgaibeu. Dede Benjamin de pe siname kedame gu mengei kie ge kaibeu. Penui pecu ngngwa sak eh penui sui yilu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Joseph gu rangkanggeu piak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Joseph pe ki ga hetaketeibe dage ajah kaigai, eh ranggai, “Minadung püt taktyei le tei pui beulu, penui punglu kebui kie ge, nah penui pelane gu rangkang pe püt kengkie rip gage kaibeu lu. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />A piak, rangkanggeu piak, be pwa henatube püt kengkie gage kai beulu, nah mei kelui pe rangkang dede si eh.” Hetaketeibe Joseph kerang nzwa teilu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Tingcang nuge tingba luge, minadung de, penui nah penui gadadung de si eh langgaidi. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Cidau penui namdibe gade tet mpet, dede dei ham kemak ga, Joseph pegu hetaketeibe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu, minadung cai pwa mie cu, nah nang penui da gwangcang lu de, penui dage rang eh, ‘Daitei nnui makeyibe pwa kesiabe hiak lano? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Aide ai a mpaube rangkanggeu piak pwa sak, nah pa reka ta ziemne keu kela de me ni? Nnui aide tei kedi kemau kehungge tei dida.’” <verse eid="GEN 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Hetaketeibe penui de gwacanglu ge sam aidung de penui dage rang gai. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Penui pedade rangdi, “Daitei a mpaupei aikenzwa samdung rang di no? N kilamedung dade ci kenzwa ta ketei au peu henei dilulo. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Ainie, anui rangkang anui püt peu gade ngau kelu, anui Canaan deu gade ncu teu mie dai beuda. Ciciu cai dainzwa anui n mpaube ki gade rangkang mede kecak regalu lai no? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />N kilamedung mi keheibe dade cide ngaulu cai, pecu peu tsai dilu, nah anui de a mpaube hebaangme tei dizie.” <verse eid="GEN 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Hetaketeibe rangdi, “Cu peu n samdung rehi gade lulo. Pa cau dade hepiak be ngaulu dibi cipau de a kila teizie, nah nnui kedamedung tet lubui.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Cidau penui hangge ge zette penui pütdung hangdeu gage keu mie kelwa gaibeu, nah penui hangge ge penui püt rip let ciau gaibeu. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Hetaketeibe pie. Pa hecingtu gade gwang henatube kecang, delwe Benjamin püt gade hepiak be ngau lu. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Cidau penui penui suisia eh painidung hietdi. Keheibe de penui gada püt tei lwe namdibe ga caili gwanglu.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Judah nah pe sinamedung Joseph kiga gwanglu. Pa cika cude bam, nah penui pe dwaga hangdeu ga keumielu. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Joseph penui dage rangdi, “Aide dai no nnui tei kegai? Nnui ci meni mina Ih kenzwame reca tei kela.” <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Judah rangdi, “Anui daipai rang lulai a mpaube dage? Daige anui rang lu lai? Mede Anui dainzwa anuide tei nzeu lulai? Tinggwang ne n kilamedung kemau ngaulu da. Ainie, anui au a kedibe kilamedung dida, anui de nah hepiakbe pe ba ga la eh ngau kelube de si eh.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Joseph rangdi, “Ih ciciu tei kera au peu henei dilulo. Mina be dade hepiak ngau kelube rünne cipau peide a kila zie, dede kedamedung ziemne au, nnui pei da kwak nah yi eh gwanglu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Ciu eh Judah Joseph da gwang nnalu delwe rangdi, “A kedibo, kehereide peu n kilabe de a mpaube kün gage sam ge ranglo, nah n kilabe de nrata di solo, kedanemene nang au hegwang Pharaoh nzwa kap delu. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />A mpaube pe kilame dage keteu eh, ranggai, ‘Nnui pei mede nnui sina bam mi bam ma?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Anui a mpaube de rang beuda, ‘Anui pei bam, kecingme ge, nah pecing cai ne hena mna kelu nage bam lie. Dede henanabe swakecingbe tsaidi da, nah pa rünne pe pui na ring bam lie, nah pepei pecu ku sütla.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Ciu eh nang n kilamedung dage rangdi, ‘Pecu ataiga ngngwa gwanglo Ih pecu ngau gai kerane.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Cipau cai, anui a mpaupei dage rangdi, ‘Henanabe pe pei dade gidi gailak. Kedanemene pa pepei da gidi maisia cai pepei tsaidi zielu.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Ge nang n kilamedung dage rangdi, ‘Nnui caihereibe henatube nnui de ngngwa gwang kemaktane, nnui a zu ngau dai gailak.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Pecai cinzwa eh anui n kilabe anui pei da gwang ge, anui a mpaube samdung pedage rang gai. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Anui pei rangdi, ‘Mie daicu, anuide taktyei kesa lui kerane.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Ge anui rangdi, ‘Anui mie dai lakta. Anui caihereibe henatube anui de ngngwa mie cai anui mie zie, kedanemene anui caihereibe henatube de anui da ngngwa gwanglu kemaktane anui cipau pei de zu ngau gai lakta.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />N kilabe anui pei anui dage rangdi, ‘Nnui cibam a nau Rachel mipeina hangna acu mna kebeu. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Penai hangge be adade tetdi da nah Ih cetdi, “Pecu teurak takcai di au zie da, nah pa tet kedicai Ih pecu ngau me delu.” <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Nnui cu aipau dede adade ngngwa lwe, nah pecu keherei gwang cai, nnui acing caine alungrei tei eh tsai zie da.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Cu, ciziemne, Ih n kilabe a pei da kegwang dau, nah anuide henanabe de ngngwa mene lacai, kedanemene peteilung au mipeina be teilung ga kang ncüt pwa bamlu, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />cinzwa eh pa mipeinabe anui de ngngwa la kemak ngaulu cai, pa tsai zieda. N kilamedung n kilabe anui pei cing kedi cai ne pelungrei tei pecu teitset zieda. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Kedanemene mipeinabe ziemne a pei de Ih a teilung peu di eh ranggai, ‘Ih magade pecu nda ngngwa gwang dai beulu mai, ciciu cai Ih a pei dade a teilung pelane kemau punglu zielie beu dida.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Ciziemne, kehereide n kilabe de peu bamlu henanabe mding gade n kila tei luzie kedibo, nah peu henanabe de pe sinamedung de ngngwa gwang lulo. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Kedanemene magade henanabe de acu ngngwala mecai dainzwa Ih au a pei da gwanglu laino? Ih ngngi a pei da makesia aide gwang eh ngau kera.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Joseph pecu peu cikegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Ciu eh Judah samdung siukelu dau Joseph pekatei pecu ketip gailak di pe kilamedung pelane petai ga sap kebamme dwa gade. Pa sahbak eh rangdi, “Mileune a dade mbai di lu.” Cine Joseph pe ha pe sinamedung dage rang kelia dau kilame migede petai ga sap ma. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Pa hap mtei sütdi eh Egyptmedung cide siulu, nah Pharaoh kiga cide ci gwang cangdi. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Nah Joseph pe sinamedung dage rang eh, “Ih au Joseph. Apei ring bam reu ni?” Pe sinamedung pesam kelilu tadi, kedanemene pedwa gade penui de keheu süt kedine. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Ge Joseph pe sinamedung dage rangdi, “Kehereide, atai ga gwang mna lulo.” Penui gwang mnalu. Pa rangdi, “Ih Joseph nnui sinabe, nnui Egypt gage zwagai kedibe deda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Bat. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Nnui lung keherei diso mede nnui katei nnui de mmau so acu aika zwa gai kedine, kedanemene Tinggwang nnui teilung kelilu kerane acu nnui dwa lang nswa gai beu delu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Bat. 7:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Aipau mmi kena ge hangdeube ga herakum kumdi nah mmi mengei si zie reu cidau pu mede rum delak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Bat. 7:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Tinggwang acu nnui dwa lang nswa gai, ai nzwa eh nnui de kideu ga peu bang kelume tei lu kerane, nah miswakega aikenzwa gade nnui de peu ringbam lu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Cu cine aika ge acu lang kegai de nnuine ma dede Tinggwang ne, nah pane acu peu Pharaoh gu kedibe tei beuda, peki pelane mpaube, nah Egypt deu pelane ga kengking. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Cuhlu nzet eh a pei da gwangcu nah peda rang beulo, ‘Aide n napei Joseph ne ainzwa rang au lie, “Tinggwang ne acu Egyptme pelane reu kedibe teibeu da. Ridi mene, ada gwang lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Bat. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Nang Goshen deuceu ga lungh luzie, nah nang a taiga bam luzie, nang nah n name nah n tsame nah n kaunedung nah n meuründung, nah n mabam kebam pelane. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ih ncu cika rengei beuzie, kedanemene mmi mengei herakum kum kera bam reu, ciu de peu ncu mzeu bam dilak, nang, n kilungme, nah n mabam pelane de.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Bat. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />“Pielo, nnui miak gade ngau da, nah a sinabe Benjamin miak gade de, amui gade nnui dage sam kerangdung da. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Nnui a pei dage rang beulo, Egypt ga a kendu pelane ha, nah nnui ngau kelu pelane. Nah nnui nzet tu gade a pei de aika ngngwa gwanglu.” <verse eid="GEN 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Pa pe sinabe Benjamin de tuipwa lwe hap, nah Benjamin pecu tui lwe hap. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Pa pe sinamedung pelane de kemam lwe hap. Cipau cai pe sinamedung pecu mpau bam di.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Makie sam be Pharaoh kiga ranglia gai: “Joseph sinamedung gwang bam lie.” Pharaoh nah pe kilamedung cide pesuiyi sütdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Bat. 7:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Pharaoh Joseph da rangdi, “N sinamedung dage rang lo, ‘Aide teilu: Penui kaune dung püt tei lwe Canaan deu ga mie culo. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />N pei nah n kilungme dung de ngngwa ada gwang lulo. Ih ncu Egypt ga hangdeu keyi hazie, nah nang hangdeu ga taktyei yitube tyei zie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Bat. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Cu ncu ajah peula, ‘Aide teilu, Egypt gade garidung de teugwang lu n namedung ziemne nah nnui naudung ziemne. Nnui pei de ngngwa lwe gwanglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Bat. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Nah nnui mabam gidi kerane nnui lung keherei so, kedanemene Egypt deu keyi pelane nnui gu delu.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Nah Israel namedung cinzwa teilu. Joseph penuide bagidung habeu, Pharaoh aja kai kebeu nzwa, nah penui beuma ziemne taktyeidung de penuide peu. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Penui pelane de pa penui paini kereleu ket ket peu, dede Benjamin de pa rangkanggeu haicum nah paini kereleu mengei peu. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Pepei ziemne pa aide langgai: Egyptme gu ma yitubedung gada kerei püt; nah mei, tangku, nah taktyei keda si eh gadapui kerei püt teilwe pe pei ziemne nah hebeu ziemne langgai beu. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Cine pa pe sinamedung de lang gidi nah penui tetdi. Nah pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui hebeu tei kela dau kesamlim helo.” <verse eid="GEN 45:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Penui Egypt gade tet pwa Canaan deu ga gwanglu, penui pei Jacob da. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Penui peda rang eh, Joseph ringbam reu, nah pa Egyptme deu pelane reu kengking teu kebam ranglia beu. Ge peswa gadi, kedanemene penui pecu kerang de pa nlum gailak di. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Penui Joseph penui dage kerang samdung de pelane peda rang beu. Cidau Jacob pecu pung kera Joseph bagidung lang kegai ngau luge, penui pei Jacob rabe mrak cu dailu. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Nah Israel rangdi, “Aide cangda. Joseph a napei cude ring bam. Ih mie pecu ngau zie Ih tsai di kemak dwa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Jacob Egypt ga kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Israel pe beu ga peda kebam mabam pelane punglu delwe Beersheba namceu ga miedi. Cikade pa pe pei Isaac Tinggwang de ratakdung tei pwa peu. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Tinggwang Israel de tingmui marengei gade marang eh ranggai, “Jacob, Jacob.” Pa rangdi, “Ih au aika bam.” <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Pa rangdi, “Ih au Tinggwang, n pei Tinggwang. Egypt ga hung kera hing so, kedanemene cika de Ih ncu heleuh kedi ge tei beu zie. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ih ncu ngngwa Egypt ga hung zie, nah Ih ncu ngngwa nghang dai beu bi zie delwe nang Joseph ncu ngngwa lazie nang ketsai benai n miak ngkui kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Jacob Beersheba gade tet mpetdi. Israel namedung penui pei Jacob, penui namedung nah penui naudung de Pharaoh ne pecu pung kera bagidung langgai kebeu gage kailu. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Penui penui kaunedung nah Canaan deu gade penui ngaukelu penui madung punglu. Jacob nah pe leuhme peciakne pecu ngngwa eh, penui Egypt ga gwanglu. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Pa pe napeimedung, pe tsamedung, pe napuimedung, pe tsapuimedung nah pe leuhme peciakne de pecu ngngwa Egypt ga gwang lu.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Aidung de cai Israel namedung Egypt ga gwang kelume zidung: Jacob nah pe napeimedung, pe neraibe Reuben; <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Reuben napeime: Hanok, Pallu, Hezron nah Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simeon napeime: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakin, Zohar, nah Shaul, Canaanme pui napei, <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />nah Levi napeime: Gershon, Kohath nah Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Judah napeime cai: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez nah Zerah (dede Er penai Onan Canaan deu gade tsaidi). Perez napeime cai Hezron nah Hamul. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Issachar napeime cai: Tola, Puah, Lob nah Shimron. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Zebulun napeime cai: Sered, Elon nah Jahleel. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Aidung de Leah napeime pane Jacob de Paddan Aram gade mna kebeudung, pe napui Dinah de si eh. Pe napeime nah pe napuime peciakne ge camreiekecum. <verse eid="GEN 46:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gad napeime cai: Zephon, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi nah Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Asher napeime cai Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, nah Beriah; nah Serah au penui tipui. Beriah napei kena cai Heber penai Malkiel. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Aidung de cai Zilpah, Laban ne pe napui Leah de kebeube pui napeime. Pe leuhme aidungde pa ne Jacob de mna beu, peciakne ne ge kereieherok. <verse eid="GEN 46:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Jacob nau Rachel napei kena cai Joseph penai Benjamin. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Egypt gade Joseph pe na Manasseh penai Ephraim lunghlu, On namdi ga cingkupei Potiphera napui Asenath dade. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benjamin napeime cai Bela, Beker, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim nah Ard. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Aidung de Rachel napeime Jacob de mna kebeudung, peciakne ge kereiemdai. <verse eid="GEN 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dan napei cai Hushim. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Naphtali napeime cai Jahziel, Guni, Jezer nah Shillem. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Aidung de cai Bilhah, Laban ne pe napui Rachel de kepeube pui ne Jacob de mna kebeu pe napeimedung, peciakne ge hena. <verse eid="GEN 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Jacob de ngngwa Egypt ga kemieme peciakne, pe leuhmedung, pe napeidung nau de pei si mene, pelane ge riakherokeherok. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Joseph napei kena Egypt gade pecu mna kebeu de si eh pe kelak peupeidung Egypt ga kemieme pelane ge riakhena.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Jacob Judah de pe dwa Joseph da lang nswa gai, pedwa Goshen lampui saulia kerane, nah penui Goshen deuceu ga gwanglu. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Joseph pe bagi mteilu eh pe pei Israel de redau kera Goshen ga miedi. Pa pecu ngaulu ge, pe ngwang tuipwalu delwe peting ketie ge pe ngwang gade hap bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Israel Joseph dade rangdi, “Cu acu peu tsai culo, nang ringla reu kecu Ih n zu ngaulu delu.” <verse eid="GEN 46:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Joseph pe siname nah pe pei kilungme dade rangdi, “Ih mie delwe hegwangpei dage rang eh ranggai zie, ‘A siname nah a pei kilungme Canaan deu ga kebamme ada gwang luda. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Penui au meurün kekwame, kedanemene penui au kauruinedung kerengeime kecune. Penui gu kauhaudung, ketumdung nah penui mabam pelane pung gwang luda.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Ainzwa tei gwang zie, Pharaoh nnuide qulu eh, ‘Nnui daipai ta tei la no?’ de eh keteu kecu dau, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />nnui ainzwa rang lulo, ‘N kilamedung anui rehang gade cu kecang, anui nah anui paume hangna na de hekaune ma kepieme.’ Ainzwa ranglu ciciude nnui Goshen deu ga lungh kerane, kedanemene Egyptme ziemne meurün kekwame keheibe de de ngau ngkaula kecune.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Pecai Joseph lütlu delwe Pharaoh dage rangbeu, “Apei nah a sinamedung, penui kauhaudung, penui tumdung nah penui mabam pelane teu eh Canaan deu gade gwang luda. Ainie! Penui Goshen deuceu ga bam dida.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Pa pe sinapei hangmengei de ngngwalu delwe penuide hegwangpei dage lia gai. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Hegwangpei pe sinamedung dade rangdi, “Nnui daipai ta tei la no?” Penui hegwangpei dade rangdi, “N kilamedung au meurün kekwamedung lie, anui paumedung nzwa eh.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Ge penui Pharaoh dade rangdi, “Anui aipau deu ga sauge lung gai kerame ge tei eh gwangla. N kilamedung kauhau ziemne cehei deu gahda, kedanemene Canaan deu ga herakum kum sütdi kedine. Cu cine, kehereide n kilamedung de peu Goshen deu ga lung lo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Ge Pharaoh Joseph dade marang eh ranggai, “N pei nah n sinamedung nda gwang luda. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Egypt deu n dwa ga bamda. N pei nah n sinamedung de Goshen deu cuikui yitube ga peu lung lulo. Nah magade penui kak ga teilu kebui minadung nang cibam cai, penuide peu a kauruine mapie rengei kera kaibeu lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Pecai Joseph pe pei Jacob de ngngwa lütlu delwe pecu Hegwangpei dage liagai. Jacob Hegwangpei de samlam beu. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Pharaoh Jacob dade rangdi, “Nang mmi dai kieege di deno?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Jacob Pharaoh dade rangdi, “Ih hui kela mmidung au hai ge camrei dida. A teilung mmidung au cam nah keherei lie. A teilung mmidung a paume teilung mmidung ketie nzwa di ma.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Cidau Jacob Hegwangpei de samlambeu nah pe dwa gade tetdi. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Pecai Joseph pe pei nah pe siname de peu lunghlu. Pa penuide Egyptme deu gade hangdeu gumlu kera ge pwapeu, Rameses cuikui ga, hangdeu yitube de, Hegwangpei rangkebeu nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Joseph pe pei, pe siname nah pe pei kilungme peciakne de taktyei pwa peu, penui teu maikesia nzüt gade.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joseph nah herakum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Cu hangdeu pelane ga taktyei magede gah di, kedanemene herakum sia süt kedine. Egypt deu nah Canaan deu mnei di, herakum de ziemne. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Joseph Egypt deu nah Canaan deu ga rangkang kebam pelane hekwalu, cika kelungme dage mei zwa kecu gade. Delwe Joseph Pharaoh hegwangki ga rangkang de teugwanglu. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Egypt deu nah Canaan deu gu rangkang kebam pelane mpet cangdi ge, Egyptme pelane Joseph da gwanglwe ranggai, “Anuide taktyei peulo! Anui rangkang gah kedi ziemne daitei anui n dwade tsai lai no?” <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Joseph rangdi, “Nnui rangkang gah di cai, nnui kauruine teugwanglu iciude Ih nnui kauruine de rehiak eh nnui de taktyei pwapeu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Cine penui Joseph da penui kauruine teugwanglu. Joseph penui de taktyei pwapeu, penui hekündung ziemne, kauhaudung ziemne, tumdung ziemne, nah gadadung ziemne rehiak eh. Cipau kum de pa penui kauruine pelane rehiak kecu de ziemne penui de tangku le penui pok teibeu. <verse eid="GEN 47:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Cipau kum de cangdi ge, pecai bekum penui peda gwanglu delwe pe dade rangdi, “Anui gu rangkang pelane gah kedi anui a kedibe dade mbai dilak, nah ketum haudung a kedibe gu dida. A kedibe dwa gade magede gahda, anui pumdung nah anui deu rünne gwale. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Anui daitei n dwade tsai lai no, anui nah anui deu de? Anuide nah anui deu lui lulo taktyei le rehiak eh iciude anui nah anui deu Pharaoh kilame teidi zie. Anuide heleuh peulo ciu eh anui ring bam lu kerane nah tsaidi melu kerane, nah ciu eh hangdeube mta mrwa di melu kerane.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Cine Joseph Egypt ga deu pelane hegwangpei ziemne luilu. Kedanemene herakum sia süt kedine Egyptme leune pe luh zwa di. Ainzwa eh, hangdeu hegwangpei deu teidi. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Minadung de cai, pa Egypt deugumrai tu ge lamde kedale kecang penuide hebaangme teidi. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Joseph cingkume deu rünne lui ma, kedanemene cingkumedung de teu lung kera kepeu ne. Penui Pharaoh ne kepeu gade tyei bam. Ciziemne penui penui deu zwa di ma. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Pecai Joseph minadung dade rangdi, “Ainie henai Pharaoh ziemne Ih nnuide nah nnui deu luilu da. Cu aika nnui ziemne heleuh bam nah nnui luh de ga heleuh ling zie. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Luhlüt dau, nnui Pharaoh de zi mengei zi ge peu maisia, nah zi mdai be nnui katei gu zie, luh ziemne heleuh, nah taktyei nnui kilungmedung nah nnui name ziemne.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Penui rangdi, “Nang ne anui teilung keli beuda. Peu anuide n dwade nsuibe tei lulo. Anui Pharaoh kilame tei dizie.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Cine Joseph zi mengei zi ge hegwangpei gu zie lie kecu teu Egypt deu ga hezai teidi, cipau zai de henai kecang teu lungh la. Cingkume deu rünne Pharaoh deu tei di ma.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Ciciu eh Israelme Egypt deu ga lunghla di, Goshen deu ga. Pe minadung cika mabamdung kekiee ngaulu. Penui au hena kekiee lungh eh lungh hing sütlu. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Jacob Egypt deu ga mmi kereiehena lunghlu, ciu eh Jacob mmi pelane hai ge eh riakdaiehena ge lunghlu. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Israel tsai kera ting mna di ge, pa pe napei Joseph de qulu delwe pe dade rangdi, “Magade cu Ih n miak ngau gade nsuibe teilie cai, n ba a mnie kang gage kailo, delwe n kesamsang nah nlumlukebui acu keu lia lo. Kehereide acu Egypt gage kung helo. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Ih a paume ngngwa tsaidi de, nang acu Egypt deudi gade ketsai paau pung mpet luzie nah a paume de kekung ni gage acu kung lulo.” Joseph rangdi, “Ih nang kerang de nzwa tei lu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Israel rangdi, “A da n sampet beu lulo,” nah pe dage Joseph pe sampetlu. Pecai Israel pe zeu peu gade Tinggwang de reca.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Heb. 11:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Manasseh penai Ephraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Ma aidungde cinzwa gwang kedicai, mige Joseph dade rangdi, “Ainie, n pei sai zeulie.” Cine pa pe napei kena Manasseh penai Ephraim de peu pecu nzanglu. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Jacob de, “Pielo, n napei Joseph ncu pie kera gwanglu delie,” de eh pau beu ge, Israel pe kengkieng pelane teu eh cuh zeu ga bamlu. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Jacob Joseph dade rangdi, “Kengkieng Tinggwang Canaan deu Luz gade ada ge pezu liagai. Pa acu samlam beu <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />nah a dade rangdi, ‘Ainie, Ih ncu n name kekiee peu eh n leuhme kieesüt zie. Ih ncu heleuh kekieege tei beu zie. Ih aipau deu de n leuhme de kelungta penui gu tei kera pwapeu zie.’ <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Cu n napei kena de, Ih nda Egypt ga gwanglu kemak dwa ncu Egypt deu gade mna kebeu de, penai au agu lie. Ephraim penai Manasseh agu zie, Reuben penai Simeon agu kecu nzwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Penai cai n name lungh dai kecube n gu zie; penui magum ga penui de penui sinabe kena zi kangga de qudi zie. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Dede a ziemne au, Ih Paddan gade kegwang dau, A suisia zu lie, lampui gade Canaan deu gade Rachel tsaidi, Ephrath ga mie kera dei kemak ge gade. Ih pecu Ephrath ga kegwang lampui gage kungdi” (cide cai, Bethlehem).<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Israel Joseph napei kena de ngaulu ge, pa keteudi, “Aipau kena de cau na no?” <verse eid="GEN 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Joseph pe pei dage ranggai, “Penai au a napei lie, Tinggwang ne aika de acu pwa kepeube kena lie.” Israel rangdi, “Penai de ada ngngwa gwanglo, iciude Ih penai de samlam beulu kerane.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Cu Israel miak mneidi pa cing kedine, cine pa ngaulu tadi. Cine Joseph penaide petaiga ngngwa gwang beu, nah pa penaide kemam gai nah penaide tui gai. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Israel Joseph dade rangdi, “Ih madaude ncu ngau dai kera cetlama, dede Tinggwang acu peu n name dede ngau kera peuda.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Ge Joseph penaide Israel ngkokpui kena kak gade teu mpet lu, delwe pa pe zu hangdeu ga keu miedi. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Joseph penai hangna na de, Ephraim de pe ba zetle ga Israel ba hile bie nah Manasseh de pe ba hile ga Israel ba zetle bie ge teulu, delwe penaide petai ga ngngwa gwang kaibeu. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Israel pe ba zetle nzang pet delwe Ephraim peu gage kailu, pa au henabe, nah pe ba hile Manasseh peu gage kailu. Pa pe ba kena de barilu, kedanemene Manasseh be neraibe kecune. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Israel Joseph de samlam eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Tinggwang, a peime Abraham nah Isaac pe dwa tet kegwangbe de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">nah Tinggwang henai tingba kecang de a mapiela kelabe de,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Heb. 11:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />tinggimgwabe, rejam lu kebui peciakne gade acu kelikelube de aipau peina kena dede peu pecu samlam beulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Peu a zi nah a peime Abraham nah Isaac zi penai da la kelube teilo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Peu penai name kideu ga kekiee ge lungh kelube tei lulo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Heb. 11:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Joseph pe pei pe ba zetle pwa Ephraim peu gage kaipwa kebam ngau luge, pe sui tadi. Pa pe pei ba pwa Ephraim peu gade Manasseh peu gage kai kera teulu. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Joseph pe pei dade rangdi, “Ciciu ma, a pei; kedanemene aide be neraibe lu. N ba zetle pwa pe peu gage kai lulo.” <verse eid="GEN 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Pe pei mlaidi eh rangdi, “Ih ci, a na Ih ci. Pa de heleuh ge teilu zie, nah pa de heleuh kedi ge tei luzie. Dede pe caihereibe au pe swa diki zie, nah pe leuhme heleuhdung kekiee ge tei lu zie.” <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Israel cipau nai penai de aipau samdung de teu eh samlam beu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">“Israelme mide samlam kebeu dau nnai zi teu eh ainzwa rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">‘Peu Tinggwang de ncu Ephraim penai Manasseh nzwa teibeu lulo.’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Ainzwa eh, Israel Ephraim de Manasseh dwa kailu. <verse eid="GEN 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Israel Joseph dade rangdi, “Ainie Ih au tsaidi lai zeuda, dede Tinggwang ncu ngngwa la zie, nah ncu n paume deu gage ngngwa cailigwang beu zie. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Nang, n siname reu kebambe de, Ih Amoritme dade a kiengtie nah a lakpi le keu kelu lamlwa deupia de Ih ncu peula lie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:5">Jhn. 4:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Jacob pe napeidung de samlam kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Pecai Jacob pe napeidung de qulu delwe rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:1">“Nnui gwang ngkwa ncüt lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:1">ciu de gwangkela ting ga nnui da daipai gwang ziebi Ih ranglia lu kerane.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Nnui gwang ngkwa lwe kingneilu, nnui Jacob napeidung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Nnui pei Israel sam kingneilu.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Reuben, nang au a neraibe, a kengkieng</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">nah a kengking bangdwabe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">herüt peulu kebui gade yitume ge nah kengkieng gade yitume ge.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Duihia kemie kam gaikelak nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">nang nlangtu be lak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">kedanemene nang n pei zeu ga gwang kedine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Pecai nang cide tei heradi delwe nang a zeu ga gwangdi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 35:22 </char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simeon penai Levi au sina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Penai kingtiedung au kenggi reunetdung da.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 35:22 </char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />O a keringria, penai ngkiem ga ngngwa hemaa ncüt so;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">penai kangbaudung ga ncüt so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">kedanemene cide a nlung suibe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">kedanemene penai rata gade penai minadung de teitsetdi kecune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Penai renga ziemne hetumseudung pi tei telwadi.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Peu penai lunghop reset dilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">kedanemene cide sia süt lu, nah penai rata ga, kedanemene cide pezai sia lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Ih penaide Jacob leuhme kakga nzi dizie nah penaide Israel kakga tei zangra dizie.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Judah, n siname ncu twa zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">N ba n ngauraume ngwang gage kai zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">N siname ndwa keumie zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Judah au hingho na ge. A na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">nang n taktyei teitset lwe cailigwang luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Pa keu henamie, pa hingho ge nzwa ngguizeu, hingho lei ge nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Cauge ne pecu tei mrak lai no?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:5">Keu. 5:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Judah dade hegwang tuitie de nzia dilak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mede kedime tuitie de pepi kak gade de nzia dilak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Shiloh gwang kemaktane. Heleuhdung pe sam mzai zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:52">Jhn. 11:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Pa pe gada de kubebang gage keulu eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">nah gadana de kubebang yitube gage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">pa pe niadung zau gage hetaa luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">nah pe pai kubetsi dui kegiedung gage.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Pe miak zau kegie nzwa gie zie, nah pe gei au tungdui swade ha.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Zebulun jaaidi kung ga lungh zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Pa limdung ziemne limtaubam ge zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">nah pe deuraih Sidon namceu ga kecang zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Issachar au gada kengkiengbe nzwa, meurün ki kena kak ga zeu bam.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Pa kemtak bam keyi ge nah hangdeu keyi ge ngaulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Cine pa pe hekeutu hepüt kerüt de gage keumie gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">delwe heta ziemne kila ge teilu zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dan pe minadung tutiak zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">Israel leuhdung kak de heleuh ge tei eh.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dan au lampui kung ga henei ge zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">lampui ga henei kerabe ge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">hekwen pideu nsau kelabe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">ciciu eh hekwen teu kelabe de pecaile ge kaugai zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />RAMPAUBO, Ih n kelikelu de kwa bam.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gad, süt ketyeime ne pecu gwaketang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">dede pa penui de kekamle de zui eh gwaketang zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Asher taktyei au keyibe zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">nah pa hegwangme taktyei keyidung peu zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Naphtali au heti lie ge pak kelabe nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">pa pe nadung hezukeyi lunghlu zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Joseph au tsingkiak pe tsi bui kebambe ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">duilet taiga tsingkiak keyibe ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">pe kiakdung au herie reu kahpetla.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Lakpi kekapme pecu gwaketang zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">nah pecu kap nah pecu teikeherei zie.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Dede pe lakpi au ntip eh bam zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">nah pe ba kena de au ngkieng zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Jacob gu Kengkieng Tinggwang ba kena de ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Israel Tsurabe, Meurün Kekwabe zi de ziemne.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />N pei Tinggwang ncu ngha zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">nah Ngkiengtube Tinggwang ncu samlam beu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ting nreule samlamdung de teu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">hangdeu kang kecuk ga kebam samlam de teu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">nah hekaune kekiee nah hena kekiee samlamdung de teu eh.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />N pei samlamdung au</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">ndaa lamlwatudung samlam swa de di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">mede ndaa hangdeutudung <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ndaa hangdeutudung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kelungta hangdeutudung </char></note>ga ma keyibedung swade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Peu cidung de Joseph peu ga bam lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">pe sinamedung reu kedibe peurwa reu ga gade.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benjamin au heneu kenzeube nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Tingcang pa pe kautui tyei luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">nah tinghegi pa süt kelude nzi zie.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Aidungde au Israel leuhme kereiekenadung. Aide au penui pei penuide samlam kebeu dau penuide kerang sam. Pa samlam petautube teu penui hangge gede samlam beu.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jacob tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Pecai Jacob penui dage maranglia eh penui dade rangdi, “Ih au a minadung da gwangdi lauda. Acu Hittime pei Ephron luh tsupop ga a paumedung de kekung gage kung lulo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Bat. 7:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Machpelah luh ga tsupop kebam gage, cide au Canaanme deu ga Mamre taiga, Abraham luh cide Hittime pei Ephron dade heraukie tei kerane luilu. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Cika ge penui Abraham nah pe nau Sarah de kungdi; cika ge penui Isaac nah pe nau Rebekah de kungdi nah cika ge Ih Leah de kungdi. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Luh nah tsupop cika kebam de Heth name dade luilu.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Jacob ma aidung de pe namedung dage ranglia cangdi ge, pa zeu ga zeu dai lu, delwe tsaidi nah pe leuhmedung da gwangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Bat. 7:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Ge Joseph pesui siasütdi eh pe pei zu ga gumpunglu delwe pa pe reu ga hap nah pa pecu kemam bamdi. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Joseph pe kilame daru kecime de pe pei pau keniak ra sam kaibeu. Cine daru kecime Israel de keniaklu. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Penui cide zie riakdai ge teibamdi, kedanemene peting ci kenzwa ge keu keniakla kecune. Egyptme zie riakhena ge ziemne pecu heei eh hap.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Heei eh kehap tingbadung cang di ge, Joseph Pharaoh kilungme dage marang eh ranggai, “Cu Ih magade nnui miakngau gade nnui suibe teilu cai, kehereide Pharaoh dage sam aide rang beu lo, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Apei acu peu sampet eh ranglu, ainzwa eh, “Pielo, Ih au tsai lai zeu da. Canaan deu ga a rau Ih aziemne ne mtei pwakebam de gage acu kunglu lo. Cika ge nang acu kung zie.” Cu cine acu peu hang eh a pei de kunglo, nah iciulu de Ih cailigwang dai zie.’” <verse eid="GEN 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Pharaoh keli gai, “Miecu delwe n pei de kung lulo, pa ncu peu sampet kelu nzwa.” <verse eid="GEN 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Joseph pe pei de kung kera hangdi. Pharaoh kang ga kedime peciakne pecu nzang miedi, pe kilung ga hangkiame, Egypt deu ga mina kemlangme pelane, <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Joseph kilungme peciakne, nah pe sinamedung, nah pe pei kilungme peciakne de nzang miedi. Dede penui namedung, penui gu kauhaudung nah penui gu ketumdung cai Goshen deuceu gage kai nzeudi. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Bagidung nah hekwen keteume de pecu ngngwa mie. Cide au mina hemaa disüt kecu ge. <verse eid="GEN 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Penui Jordan de mcwa kebam, Atad hecaipung ga gwang luge, penui suisiet kepui tei heei eh hap süt bamdi. Cika Joseph lang henane pe pei de heei eh kehap ge teilu. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Canaanme cipau deu ga lunghkebamme, Atad hecaipung ga heei eh hap kebam ngau luge, penui rangdi, “Aide au Egyptme ziemne helung sia süt kecu ting ge lie.” Cide ziemne heni cide de Abel Mizraim lie eh qulu, cide au Jordan kah kepet ga. <verse eid="GEN 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Cine pe namedung Jacob ziemne pa penuide rang kebeu de nzwa teilu. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Pe namedung pe pau Canaan deu ga pung gwanglu nah pecu Mamre taiga Machpelah luh ga tsupop gage kungdi. Abraham tsupop luh kencüt de heraukie tei kerane luilu. Pa Hittitme pei Ephron dade cide luilu. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Pa pe pei de kung kedicai, Joseph pa, pe sinamedung de nzang lu eh, nah pecu pe pei de kekung ga nzang kemieme peciakne de ngngwa Egypt ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joseph pe sinamedung de rangmcidai kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Joseph sinamedung penui pei tsai kedi ngaulu ge, penui rangdi, “Magade Joseph anuide pe rata bam eh anui peda kesia tei gai kedi pelane ziemne anuide hekum pei daicai dainzwalai?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Cine penui Joseph dage sam langgai eh ranggai, “N pei tsai kedidwa marang diak eh ranggai, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Joseph de aide rangbeu lulo, “Kehereide n siname hezai kemak ta tei kedide nah penui n dage kesia tei kegai dau penui mau kedide gibeulo.”’ Cu kehereide n pei Tinggwang kilame mau gibeulo.” Penui pe dage cide rang kegai dau Joseph hapdi. <verse eid="GEN 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Pe siname mie delwe pe dwa gade de keumie. Penui rangdi, “Ainie, anui au n kilamedung lie.” <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Dede Joseph penui sam keli eh, “Ngngi so. Tinggwang bam ga Ih bam ni? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Nnui au, acu teikeherei kera tei, dede Tinggwang cide teu makeyi teilu, henai nnui ngau kebam nzwa, mina kekiee ge teilung peu ringlu kerane. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Cu cine nnui ngngi so. Ih nnui nah nnui name mapielu zie.” Ainzwa eh pa penui lung taumla beu delwe samkeyi le penui lung teinciep beu.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joseph tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Joseph Egypt ga pe pei kelak de ngngwa lunghdi. Pa mmi haige kerei ge lungh. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Joseph Ephraim name ceheu pe kecumbe kecang ngaulu. Pa Manasseh napei Machir namedung Joseph ngkokpui gage kekaidung dede ngaulu. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Joseph pe sinamedung dade rangdi, “Ih tsaidi lauda; dede Tinggwang nnui da gwang bi zie, nah nnuide aipau deu gade ngngwa mpet delwe pa Abraham de, Isaac de nah Jacob de pwapeu kera sampet kelu deu ga ngngwa gwang beu zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:22">Heb. 11:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Pecai Joseph Israelmedung de peu sampet lu. Pa rangdi, “Tinggwang nnui da gwang bi zie. Cipau tingdau nnui a rahdung aikade pung mpet lu maisia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:22">Heb. 11:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Iciu eh Joseph mmi 110 dau tsaidi. Penui pe paau keniaklu delwe pecu Egypt ga hepaaubung gage kainzeu di.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>